Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'zeke-yeager', 'Zeke Yeager is an antagonist of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'kenny-ackerman', 'Kenny Ackerman is an antagonist of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'rod-reiss', 'Rod Reiss is an antagonist of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'grisha-yeager', 'Grisha Yeager is a supporting character of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'carla-yeager', 'Carla Yeager is a character of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'gabi-braun', 'Gabi Braun is a supporting character of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'falco-grice', 'Falco Grice is a supporting character of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'pieck-finger', 'Pieck Finger is a supporting character of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'porco-galliard', 'Porco Galliard is a supporting character of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'willy-tybur', 'Willy Tybur is an antagonist of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Inside the Walls the army is split into exactly three branches: the Garrison, the Survey Corps and the Military Police.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'The Training Corps is the school for new recruits, who only later choose one of the three branches.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'The Smiling Titan that kills Eren''s mother is an ordinary man-eating Titan, not one of the Nine.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attack_on_Titan', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'hannes', 'Hannes is a soldier of the Garrison who rescues Eren and Mikasa when Shiganshina falls.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Rico Brzenska leads her own squad inside the Garrison''s elite forces.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'dot-pixis', 'Dot Pixis is a bald, moustached and eccentric commander who sits among the Garrison officers and rules the Southern Territory.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Nanaba is a blond Survey Corps soldier who commands a team on the 57th expedition.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'mike-zacharius', 'Mike Zacharius sniffs newcomers on first meeting and leads a squad of the Survey Corps.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'hange-zoe', 'Hange is a scientist of the Survey Corps who heads the 4th Squad and studies Titans.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'levi-ackerman', 'Levi, called the strongest soldier of humanity, commands an elite squad of the Survey Corps.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Nile Dok commands the Military Police Brigade, not the Survey Corps.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Wall Maria is the outermost of the three walls, and Shiganshina lies on it.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attack_on_Titan', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Wall Rose is the second innermost of the walls.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attack_on_Titan', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Wall Sina is the innermost wall, where cadets dream of a safe life in the Military Police.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Trost is a city, not a wall: it is the place that the Colossal Titan attacks inside Wall Rose.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attack_on_Titan', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Eld Jinn, Oluo Bozado, Petra Ral and Gunther Schultz are the four soldiers hand-picked for Captain Levi''s Special Operations Squad.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Moblit Berner is the vice captain of the 4th Squad and works as Hange''s assistant and messenger.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'reiner-braun', 'Reiner Braun, a cadet of the 104th, is the one who holds the Armored Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'bertolt-hoover', 'Bertolt Hoover, a quiet 104th cadet who ranked third, holds the Colossal Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'annie-leonhart', 'Annie Leonhart, a 104th cadet who finished fourth, turns into a Titan to ambush the 57th expedition.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'jean-kirstein', 'Jean Kirstein graduates sixth in the 104th Training Corps and is an ordinary human soldier.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'kenny-ackerman', 'Kenny Ackerman heads the Interior Police unit that hunts the Survey Corps.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Traute Carven is the right hand of Kenny Ackerman in his counter-insurgency squad of the Interior Police.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Djel Sanes is a secret policeman of the First Interior Squad, also called the Interior Police.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'Marlowe Freudenberg is a rank-and-file soldier of the Military Police who wants to reform the corrupt force.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'reiner-braun', 'Reiner Braun trained in Marley as a member of the Warrior Unit.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'pieck-finger', 'Pieck Finger is another young Eldian raised in the Marleyan Warrior Unit, and she can become the Cart Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'porco-galliard', 'Porco Galliard, brother of Marcel, was a Marleyan Warrior cadet and holds the Jaw Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'eren-yeager', 'Eren Yeager grows up in the border town of Shiganshina, within the Walls and far from Marley.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attack_on_Titan', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'series', 'attack-on-titan', 'The Nine Titans are a fixed set of named powers; the Colossal, Armored and Female forms belong to it, along with six others.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attack_on_Titan', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The title is written in katakana as ブラッククローバー and read Burakku Kurōbā in Japanese.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Yūki Tabata wrote and drew the manga, and the official site credits him as the original creator.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The manga started on February 16, 2015, and its last chapters appeared on May 1, 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The story began in Weekly Shōnen Jump and finished in Jump Giga, after a move in late 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Shueisha published the collected chapters under its Jump Comics label.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'By June 2026 the manga had passed 24.5 million copies in circulation.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The first TV season, produced by Pierrot, ran 170 episodes from October 3, 2017, to March 30, 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'A second season premiered on October 3, 2026, numbered from episode 171, and it is still airing as of October 25, 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Studio Pierrot animated both the first and the second season of the TV anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Ayataka Tanemura directs the second season and had taken over directing the first season from episode 153.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Tatsuya Yoshihara directed the early episodes of the TV anime, and later episodes were directed by Ayataka Tanemura.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Minako Seki composes the music of the anime, in both the first season and the second.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The film Sword of the Wizard King opened in Japanese cinemas and on Netflix on June 16, 2023, after a delay from March.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Ayataka Tanemura directed the film, Johnny Onda co-wrote its screenplay, and Tabata supervised the character designs.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover:_Sword_of_the_Wizard_King', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'An OVA by the studio Xebec Zwei, directed by Takashi Noto, was first shown at the Jump Festa fan event.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The short comedy Squishy! Black Clover was made by the studio DLE, and its opening song was Possible by the duo Clover×Clover.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'In a world where magic is everything, the orphan Asta has no mana yet aims to become the Wizard King, the top authority below the king.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The Wizard King is the strongest mage of the Clover Kingdom, and the only authority ranked just below the king.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'A four-leaf grimoire is given to only the most gifted mages, while Asta ends up with a mysterious five-leaf one.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Asta signs up with the Black Bulls, whose captain is Yami Sukehiro, and Yuno heads to the Golden Dawn.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Their first big enemy is a radical group, the Eye of the Midnight Sun, bent on revenge for a wrong done to the elves.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Later the knights face the Dark Triad of the Spade Kingdom, and then their eldest sibling Lucius Zogratis, who wants to build his own perfect world.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The story names four kingdoms: Clover, where the hero lives, plus Spade, Diamond and Heart.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The first Wizard King was Lumiere Silvamillion Clover, Conrad Leto was the 27th, and Julius Novachrono is the 28th.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Devils in the story include Liebe, who lives in Asta''s grimoire, and the high-ranking Zagred; Licht, however, is an elf.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Before Black Clover, Tabata had a short-lived science fiction series named Hungry Joker in Weekly Shōnen Jump, which was cancelled.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Tabata spent seven years as an assistant to other manga artists, beginning when he was twenty, before he ran his own series.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Tabata wanted a shōnen version of the dark fantasy manga Berserk, and also drew on The Lord of the Rings and Harry Potter.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Tabata modeled Asta on himself and Charmy Pappitson on his wife, and Charmy is his favorite character to draw.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Tabata picked character names by looking up interesting words in dictionaries of various languages.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Even after the anime began, Tabata kept inking and toning his drafts by hand instead of using digital tools.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Spin-offs include the console game Quartet Knights, the mobile game Phantom Knights and the gag manga Asta-kun Mahōtei e no Michi.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'On stage, Keisuke Ueda played Asta, Naoki Takeshi played Yuno and Arisa Komiya played Noelle.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'As of October 25, 2026, the second season opens with Kienai Riyū by WANIMA and closes with Yellow Brick Road by ONE OR EIGHT.', 'music', 'official', 'https://bclover.jp/music/', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The Black Bulls squad counts Yami, Finral, Magna, Luck, Gauche, Charmy, Vanessa, Gordon and Zora among its members.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Yami leads the Black Bulls, William leads the Golden Dawn, Fuegoleon leads the Crimson Lion Kings and Nozel leads the Silver Eagles.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'Kazuyuki Fudeyasu handled the scripts for the first 152 episodes, Kanichi Katō the rest of season one, and Keiichirō Ōchi the second season.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Clover_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The current King of Clover is Augustus Kira Clover XIII, a ruler with Light Magic who is not a Wizard King.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The TV anime starts with the Magic Knights Entrance Arc, episodes 1 to 10, and its sixth arc, in the Witches'' Forest, ends at episode 65.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_episodes', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The first season closes with the Heart Kingdom Joint Struggle Arc, which fills episodes 158 to 170.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_episodes', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The first season used thirteen openings, from Haruka Mirai by Kankaku Piero to Grandeur by Snow Man.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_episodes', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'series', 'black-clover', 'The thirteen endings of the first season began with Aoi Honō by Itowokashi and finished with BEAUTIFUL by TREASURE.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_episodes', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'asta', 'Asta grew up in a church orphanage with no mana at all, so he built up his body instead of his magic.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'yuno-grinberryall', 'Yuno Grinberryall was a prodigy with enormous magic and wind powers while growing up in the same orphanage as Asta.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'noelle-silva', 'Noelle Silva belongs to House Silva, a royal family, and joined the Black Bulls with Asta.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'yami-sukehiro', 'Yami Sukehiro leads the Black Bulls, and his given name and surname sit in the opposite order in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'finral-roulacase', 'Finral Roulacase took his mother''s family name Roulacase when he left the noble House Vaude.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'magna-swing', 'Magna Swing is the right-hand man of Yami, and he grew up in Rayaka Village.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'luck-voltia', 'Luck Voltia grew up as an orphan in Yvon Village and equates victory with affection.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'gauche-adlai', 'Gauche Adlai was born a noble before turning criminal to support his sister Marie.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'charmy-pappitson', 'Charmy Pappitson looks like a child, but she hides a huge appetite and huge magical power.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'vanessa-enoteca', 'Vanessa Enoteca is a witch who ran away from her mother''s rule in the Forest of Witches.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'gordon-agrippa', 'Gordon Agrippa comes from a family of curse users and speaks softly after a lonely childhood.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'zora-ideale', 'Zora Ideale first refused to wear the Black Bulls robe, and he distrusts nobles because of how his father was killed.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'secre-swallowtail', 'Secre Swallowtail uses Sealing Magic, which also gave her horns and a second form.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'nacht-faust', 'Nacht Faust is the vice-captain of the Black Bulls and Yami''s old friend.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'julius-novachrono', 'Julius Novachrono is the 28th Wizard King and used to lead the Grey Deer squad.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'william-vangeance', 'William Vangeance leads the Golden Dawn, the squad ranked strongest by the Wizard King''s star system.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'mimosa-vermillion', 'Mimosa Vermillion belongs to the royal House Vermillion and admires her cousin Noelle.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'fuegoleon-vermillion', 'Fuegoleon Vermillion is a noble who treats others as equals, unlike most royals.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'nozel-silva', 'Nozel Silva is the heir of the Silva family and the captain of the Silver Eagles.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'zagred', 'Zagred is a high-ranking devil who plays with reality using spoken words.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'asta', 'Asta wields a rare five-leaf grimoire whose anti-magic cancels spells, and he swings the Demon-Slayer Sword.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'asta', 'Asta is voiced by Gakuto Kajiwara in Japanese and by Dallas Reid in the English dub.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'yuno-grinberryall', 'Yuno commands Wind Magic and holds a four-leaf grimoire, and the wind spirit Sylph chose him as partner.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'yuno-grinberryall', 'The reason behind Yuno''s four-leaf grimoire is that he houses the reborn soul of the elf Licht''s unborn child.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'yuno-grinberryall', 'Yuno is later revealed to be a prince of the former royal family of the Spade Kingdom, House Grinberryall.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'yuno-grinberryall', 'Yuno is voiced by Nobunaga Shimazaki in Japanese and by Micah Solusod in the English dub.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'noelle-silva', 'Noelle has huge mana and Water Magic, but at first she cannot control it because of a childhood trauma.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'noelle-silva', 'Noelle is voiced by Kana Yūki in Japanese and by Jill Harris in the English dub.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'noelle-silva', 'Noelle''s mother Acier died at the hands of the devil Megicula.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'yami-sukehiro', 'Yami is nicknamed the Lord of Destruction and wields Dark Magic that can cancel other spells.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'yami-sukehiro', 'Yami is voiced by Junichi Suwabe in Japanese and by Christopher Sabat in the English dub.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'yami-sukehiro', 'Yami comes from a country called the Land of the Sun.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'finral-roulacase', 'Finral''s Spatial Magic is used to carry people around, though he starts out cowardly and a womanizer.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'magna-swing', 'Magna rides a broom called Crazy Cyclone while hurling Fire Magic fireballs.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'magna-swing', 'Magna was a delinquent in Rayaka Village before he joined the Magic Knights.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'luck-voltia', 'Luck is nicknamed the Cheery Berserker for smiling constantly while he fights.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'luck-voltia', 'Luck''s Lightning Magic forms gloves and boots that make him extremely fast.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'gauche-adlai', 'Gauche casts Mirror Magic through an artificial left eye.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'charmy-pappitson', 'Charmy makes sheep out of cotton for cooking and fighting, and the food she makes restores magical power.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'charmy-pappitson', 'Charmy is half dwarf and can change into an adult form that boosts her power.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'vanessa-enoteca', 'Vanessa moves unseen threads with Thread Magic, and her cat Rouge, the Red Thread of Fate, changes bad outcomes.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'gordon-agrippa', 'Gordon''s magic is built on poison and curses.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'zora-ideale', 'Zora''s Ash Magic sets trap spells that bounce attacks back with twice the power.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('black-clover', 'character', 'secre-swallowtail', 'Secre goes by the name Nero, and she accompanies Asta after they first meet.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'secre-swallowtail', 'Secre used Sealing Magic to imprison the devil Zagred, and the spell cursed her with horns.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'secre-swallowtail', 'Secre was a servant of the first Wizard King, Lumiere, five hundred years in the past.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'nacht-faust', 'Nacht wields Shadow Magic and borrows the power of four devils through contracts.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'nacht-faust', 'Nacht carries guilt over the death of his twin brother Morgen in a failed ritual.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'julius-novachrono', 'Julius is the 28th Wizard King and wields rare Time Magic.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'julius-novachrono', 'Julius is later revealed to be a second soul that shares a body with Lucius.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'julius-novachrono', 'Julius spends the last of his magic and gives his life to undo the damage of the final battle.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'william-vangeance', 'William wields World Tree Magic, which he uses to heal his squad.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'william-vangeance', 'William shares his body with the elf Patry.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'mimosa-vermillion', 'Mimosa is a member of the Golden Dawn, the squad Yuno joins.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'mimosa-vermillion', 'Mimosa heals with Plant Magic and judges people by merit rather than birth.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'fuegoleon-vermillion', 'Fuegoleon captains the Crimson Lion Kings and uses powerful Fire Magic.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'nozel-silva', 'Nozel controls liquid metal with Mercury Magic as the captain of the Silver Eagles.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'zagred', 'Zagred''s Word Soul Magic bends reality through speech, and his Reincarnation Magic moves souls between bodies.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'zagred', 'Zagred planned the massacre of the elves five hundred years before the main story.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'zagred', 'Asta finally destroys Zagred by cutting his heart in two.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('black-clover', 'character', 'finral-roulacase', 'Finral Roulacase is voiced in Japanese by Jun Fukuyama.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Black_Clover_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The Japanese title is the single word BLEACH in capitals, read Burīchi, as in the Japanese name of the Thousand-Year Blood War sequel.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Tite Kubo both wrote and drew the Bleach manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(manga)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Bleach ran in Shueisha''s Weekly Shōnen Jump for fifteen years, from August 2001 until August 2016.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(manga)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The finished manga was collected in 74 tankōbon volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(manga)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The first Bleach anime was made by Pierrot under director Noriyuki Abe and aired on TV Tokyo for 366 episodes, from October 2004 to March 2012.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The sequel series Thousand-Year Blood War began on TV Tokyo on October 11, 2022, with Tomohisa Taguchi taking over as director from Noriyuki Abe.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The anime added four story arcs of its own that are not in the manga: the Bounts, Amagai, the rebelling Zanpakutō and the Reigai copies.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The 2004 to 2012 anime used fifteen opening songs, each running for about two dozen episodes.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_soundtracks', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The first fifteen of the thirty ending songs of the original anime, from Rie fu to Kansha.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_soundtracks', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The last fifteen ending songs of the original anime, running to the final episode 366.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_soundtracks', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Four animated Bleach films came out between 2006 and 2010, all directed by Noriyuki Abe with original characters designed by Kubo.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'ichigo-kurosaki', 'Ichigo becomes a Soul Reaper when Rukia Kuchiki hands her powers to him.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(manga)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'ichigo-kurosaki', 'Ichigo Kurosaki is a main character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'rukia-kuchiki', 'Rukia Kuchiki is a main character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'orihime-inoue', 'Orihime Inoue is a main character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'uryu-ishida', 'Uryū Ishida is a main character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'yasutora-sado', 'Yasutora Sado is a main character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'kisuke-urahara', 'Kisuke Urahara is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'isshin-kurosaki', 'Isshin Kurosaki is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'kon', 'Kon is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'karin-kurosaki', 'Karin Kurosaki is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'tatsuki-arisawa', 'Tatsuki Arisawa is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'renji-abarai', 'Renji Abarai is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'yoruichi-shihoin', 'Yoruichi Shihōin is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'ganju-shiba', 'Ganju Shiba is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'kukaku-shiba', 'Kūkaku Shiba is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'sousuke-aizen', 'Sousuke Aizen is an antagonist of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'jin-kariya', 'Jin Kariya is an antagonist of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'shinji-hirako', 'Shinji Hirako is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'nozomi-kujo', 'Nozomi Kujō is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'kugo-ginjo', 'Kūgo Ginjō is an antagonist of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'yhwach', 'Yhwach is an antagonist of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'karin-kurosaki', 'Karin Kurosaki and her twin Yuzu are the two little sisters in Ichigo''s household.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'isshin-kurosaki', 'When the story opens, Isshin Kurosaki is the easygoing dad of Ichigo and his sisters and runs the family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'tatsuki-arisawa', 'Tatsuki Arisawa is a childhood friend who spars with Ichigo at karate and looks out for Orihime; she is no relative of his.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'kisuke-urahara', 'Kisuke Urahara is a shopkeeper in Karakura Town, not a student, and sells sweets and spirit gear.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Tessai Tsukabishi is the big, mustached helper who works beside Kisuke at the shop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'kon', 'Kon is the first Mod-Soul shown in the story, a comic character who lives in a lion plush toy.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Kurōdo is a timid Mod-Soul who can copy other people''s powers and sometimes lives in a rabbit-like purse.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Ririn leads the group of Mod-Souls who show up in the anime-only Bount storyline.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'jin-kariya', 'Jin Kariya heads the Bounts, a clan of long-lived humans who wield Dolls.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'uryu-ishida', 'Uryū Ishida comes from the Quincy, a nearly extinct line of spirit archers.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'yoruichi-shihoin', 'Yoruichi Shihōin helped Urahara, Tessai and the Vizards flee the Soul Society a century ago, so she is their ally rather than a member.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'A gigai is a made-up body that a Soul Reaper wears to move around the human world; it is not a sword.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Keigo Asano is a loud, excitable boy from Ichigo''s school class.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Mizuiro Kojima, a soft-spoken boy with a taste for older women, sits in Ichigo''s class.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Chizuru Honshō goes to school with Ichigo and is forever chasing Orihime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Jinta Hanakari is a red-haired kid who is meant to do the cleaning at the shop but often slacks off.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Ururu Tsumugiya is a quiet girl who carries out most of the heavy chores at the shop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Gō Koga is a friend of Kariya and the one Bount who outlives the clan''s defeat.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Yoshino Sōma is a Bount and the former wife of Kariya, and her Doll is a fire figure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Ryūken Ishida, Uryū''s father, is a Quincy who runs a hospital and scorns his own people.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Sōken Ishida, the grandfather, taught young Uryū the Quincy arts.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'shinji-hirako', 'Shinji Hirako heads the Vizards, a masked band of Soul Reapers who gained hollow powers, and has known Urahara for ages.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Kensei Muguruma, once a squad captain, was among the first Soul Reapers made into a Vizard.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Hachigen Ushōda, nicknamed Hachi, is the biggest of the Vizards and puts up barriers for them.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'renji-abarai', 'Zabimaru, with a snake-tail design, is the sword spirit that fights for Renji Abarai.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Hyōrinmaru is an ice dragon spirit and the sword of the young captain Tōshirō Hitsugaya.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Katen Kyōkotsu is the twin-bladed zanpakutō of Shunsui Kyōraku.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'The Japanese title ブルーロック is read Burū Rokku, a katakana rendering of Blue Lock.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Lock', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'Muneyuki Kaneshiro writes the story and Yusuke Nomura draws the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Lock', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'Kodansha''s Weekly Shōnen Magazine has carried the manga since August 2018.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Lock', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'The collected edition stood at forty volumes in August 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Lock', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'The manga won the shōnen prize at the 45th Kodansha Manga Award in 2021.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Lock', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'Studio Eight Bit animates the series with Tetsuaki Watanabe as director.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Lock', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'The first season ran twenty-four episodes between October 9, 2022 and March 26, 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_episodes', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'A third season adapting the Neo Egoist League arc was announced on September 28, 2025 at Blue Lock Egoist Fest 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_episodes', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'A film adapting the Episode Nagi spin-off manga reached Japanese cinemas on April 19, 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_episodes', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'Season one used two openings, Chaos ga Kiwamaru and Judgement, and two endings, Winner and Numbness Like a Ginger.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_episodes', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'Season two opens with Bōjaku no Charisma by Unison Square Garden and ends with One by Snow Man.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_episodes', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'The Blue Lock program is a harsh training scheme aimed at creating the most egotistical striker in the world.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Lock', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'yoichi-isagi', 'Yoichi Isagi is a main character of Blue Lock.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'meguru-bachira', 'Meguru Bachira is a supporting character of Blue Lock.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'seishiro-nagi', 'Seishirō Nagi is a supporting character of Blue Lock.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'reo-mikage', 'Reo Mikage is a supporting character of Blue Lock.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'rensuke-kunigami', 'Rensuke Kunigami is a supporting character of Blue Lock.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'shoei-barou', 'Shōei Barō is a supporting character of Blue Lock.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'rin-itoshi', 'Rin Itoshi is a main character of Blue Lock.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'jinpachi-ego', 'Jinpachi Ego is a supporting character of Blue Lock.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'anri-teieri', 'Anri Teieri is a supporting character of Blue Lock.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'ryusei-shidou', 'Ryūsei Shidou is a supporting character of Blue Lock.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'sae-itoshi', 'Sae Itoshi is a supporting character of Blue Lock.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('blue-lock', 'character', 'michael-kaiser', 'Michael Kaiser is a supporting character of Blue Lock.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'yoichi-isagi', 'Isagi starts out near the bottom of a crowd of 300 hopefuls who all fight for one place as the top striker.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'The story opens after the national side ends in 16th place at the 2018 World Cup, which is why the football association calls in Ego.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Lock', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'jinpachi-ego', 'Ego plans to reshape the national teams so that Japan can win the 2022 World Cup of the full men''s game, after an earlier youth title.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'reo-mikage', 'Reo''s trademark skill is to mimic rivals'' moves, and in the U-20 exhibition game his copies get as close as 99 percent.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'seishiro-nagi', 'Nagi proves himself so well that he lands among the 6 best players in the whole Blue Lock program.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'ryusei-shidou', 'Shidou is brought on after the break against Japan U-20 and stands out as the only scorer of 2 goals.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'sae-itoshi', 'Sae Itoshi is a member of an elite club of the 11 best young players on the planet, known as the World''s 11.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'character', 'michael-kaiser', 'Kaiser''s trademark shot, the Kaiser Impact, comes in 3 variations: a bicycle kick, an accelerated shot and a curved one.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'Julian Loki is the youngest Master Striker in the story, and he plays at the top level at only 17 years old.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('blue-lock', 'series', 'blue-lock', 'Ikki Niko stands 15th in the league table when round five closes, good enough for a seat in the new national squad.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Blue_Lock_characters', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The Japanese title is written ぼっち・ざ・ろっく！ and read Botchi Za Rokku!, a spelling of the English name that keeps the rock band pun in the sound.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'Aki Hamazi writes and draws the four panel manga, and the anime was adapted from it.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The manga runs in the seinen magazine Manga Time Kirara Max.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'Houbunsha publishes the original manga in Japan, and Yen Press brought it to English readers.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The first chapter appeared on December 19, 2017, as a one-off guest work in Manga Time Kirara Max.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'A full weekly run in Manga Time Kirara Max started a few months after the guest chapter, on March 19, 2018.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'As of November 2025 the manga fills eight tankobon volumes, and the series is still running.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The anime started airing on October 9, 2022, on Tokyo MX and other stations.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bocchi_the_Rock!_episodes', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The twelve episode run ended on December 25, 2022, so it fit into a single autumn season.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The first season is twelve episodes long, one per week, and the finale aired on Christmas Day 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bocchi_the_Rock!_episodes', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'CloverWorks animated the TV series, with Aniplex behind the home video releases.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'Keiichirō Saitō directed the first season while Yūsuke Yamamoto worked as assistant director.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'A second season was announced on February 15, 2025, with former assistant director Yūsuke Yamamoto taking over as director.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'Tomoki Kikuya composed the score of the anime.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'Erika Yoshida wrote the series scripts and Kerorira handled the character designs.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The only opening theme of season one is Seishun Complex, performed by the fictional band Kessoku Band, voiced by the main cast.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bocchi_the_Rock!_episodes', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The ending song changes four times: Distortion!!, Karakara, What Is Wrong With, and a cover of an Asian Kung-Fu Generation song for the finale.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bocchi_the_Rock!_episodes', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The album Kessoku Band, with 14 songs, came out on CD on December 28, 2022, after a digital release three days earlier.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kessoku_Band_(album)', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The Kessoku Band album went straight to the top of the Oricon albums chart and was later certified platinum in Japan.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kessoku_Band_(album)', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The finale''s ending song is a cover of an Asian Kung-Fu Generation track, which fits a show whose episode titles borrow from that band.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kessoku_Band_(album)', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The name Kessoku Band literally means zip tie band, and it is also a pun on the idea of a united band.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The Kessoku Band members borrow their family names from the members of the real band Asian Kung-Fu Generation, and each plays the same kind of instrument.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'Rival bands also borrow real surnames: Sick Hack takes them from the group 88Kasyo Junrei and Sideros from Kinniku Shōjo Tai.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The twelve episodes are titled Lonely Rolling Bocchi, See You Tomorrow, Be Right There, Jumping Girl(s), Flightless Fish, Eight Views, To Your House, Bocchi the Rock, Enoshima Escar, After Dark, Duodecimal Sunset and Morning Light Falls on You.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bocchi_the_Rock!_episodes', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'Every episode name twists the title of a track by the real rock group Asian Kung-Fu Generation.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bocchi_the_Rock!_episodes', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The live house Starry is based on a real venue called Shelter in the Tokyo district of Shimokitazawa, which saw a wave of fan visits.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'After the anime aired, demand for guitars jumped and models used by the characters went out of stock.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'At Comiket 101 in December 2022 the line at the mangaka''s booth grew so long that her wares were sold out by early afternoon.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'A spin-off manga by Kumichou, titled Kikuri Hiroi''s Heavy-Drinking Diary, puts the band''s hard-drinking bassist in the lead role.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'A stage play version called Live Stage Bocchi the Rock! was performed at the Theater Milano-Za in Tokyo in 2023.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'Yen Press licensed the manga for English publication, and Crunchyroll streamed the anime outside Asia.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'The story follows a painfully shy girl who practices guitar alone for years and finally gets pulled into a real band.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'series', 'bocchi-the-rock', 'In 2019 the manga placed eighth in the print category of the fifth Next Manga Awards.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'hitori-goto', 'Hitori Gotō, nicknamed Bocchi, is the shy lead guitarist and lyricist at the center of the story.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'hitori-goto', 'Her nickname Bocchi plays on hitoribocchi, a Japanese word for being alone.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'hitori-goto', 'Online she is a small star under the username Guitarhero, even though she cannot make friends in person.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'hitori-goto', 'Guitar was self-taught: she started in the first year of middle school, encouraged by her father and a TV interview.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'hitori-goto', 'She is usually dressed in a pink tracksuit, which she even wears over her school uniform.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'hitori-goto', 'Her main guitar is an ebony Gibson Les Paul Custom, and she later buys a black Yamaha Pacifica.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'hitori-goto', 'Her surname comes from Masafumi Gotoh, the vocalist of Asian Kung-Fu Generation.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'hitori-goto', 'Yoshino Aoyama voices Hitori in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'nijika-ijichi', 'Nijika Ijichi is the cheerful drummer who founds Kessoku Band and keeps it together.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'nijika-ijichi', 'Nijika''s big sister Seika is the boss of Starry, the venue the band keeps returning to, and the girls lost their mother young.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'nijika-ijichi', 'Nijika drums on a Tama Imperialstar kit in vintage red.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'nijika-ijichi', 'Sayumi Suzushiro voices Nijika in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'ryo-yamada', 'Ryō Yamada is the cool, aloof bassist and composer of the band.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'ryo-yamada', 'She spends her allowance on music gear, so she borrows money and sometimes even eats weeds.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'ryo-yamada', 'Ryō''s bass is a white Fender Precision.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'ryo-yamada', 'Saku Mizuno voices Ryō in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'ikuyo-kita', 'Ikuyo Kita sings and plays rhythm guitar in Kessoku Band, and she is the outgoing, popular one of the group.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'ikuyo-kita', 'She first joined because she had a crush on Ryō, then fled after bluffing about how well she plays guitar.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'ikuyo-kita', 'She dislikes her given name because it sounds like a phrase meaning I am here, let us go.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'ikuyo-kita', 'Ikumi Hasegawa voices Ikuyo in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'seika-ijichi', 'Seika Ijichi is Nijika''s older sister and the manager of the live house Starry.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'seika-ijichi', 'Maaya Uchida voices Seika in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'pa-san', 'PA-san is the nameless sound engineer of Starry, who looks intimidating but is kind.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'pa-san', 'Her goth look and piercings make her seem scary, but she has a kind nature.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'pa-san', 'Kotori Koiwai voices PA-san and also the family dog JimiHen.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'kikuri-hiroi', 'Kikuri Hiroi is the bassist and vocalist of the psychedelic rock band Sick Hack.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'kikuri-hiroi', 'She spends most of her money on alcohol, especially boxes of Onikoroshi sake.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'kikuri-hiroi', 'Kikuri''s bass has a name of its own, Shuten-dōji EX, borrowed from a demon of Japanese legend.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'kikuri-hiroi', 'Sayaka Senbongi voices Kikuri in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'eliza-shimizu', 'Eliza Shimizu is the English born guitarist of Sick Hack.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'eliza-shimizu', 'Eliza is not from Japan: she came over from England meaning to visit Comiket and join an anime cover band.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'eliza-shimizu', 'Sally Amaki voices Eliza in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'shima-iwashita', 'Shima Iwashita is the drummer of Sick Hack.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'yoyoko-otsuki', 'Yoyoko Ōtsuki leads the metal band Sideros and is obsessed with rankings.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'futari-goto', 'Futari Gotō is Hitori''s outgoing younger sister.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'futari-goto', 'Her given name Futari means two people, set against her big sister''s name Hitori, which means one person.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'futari-goto', 'Misaki Watada voices Futari in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'michiyo-goto', 'Michiyo Gotō is Hitori''s gentle mother, who accepts her daughter''s anxiety.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'naoki-goto', 'Naoki Gotō is Hitori''s father, whose face is never shown on screen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'naoki-goto', 'Naoki once wanted to make it as a musician too, and his old guitar eventually passed to Hitori.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'jimihen', 'JimiHen is the Gotō family''s pet Shiba Inu.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'jimihen', 'The family dog is named after the guitarist Jimi Hendrix.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('bocchi-the-rock', 'character', 'jimihen', 'The dog shares a voice actress with PA-san, Kotori Koiwai.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bocchi_the_Rock!', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The Japanese title is チェンソーマン, which is read Chensō Man.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Tatsuki Fujimoto both wrote and drew the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The manga began on 3 December 2018 and its serialization ended on 25 March 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The chapters are collected in 24 volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Honors include the 66th Shogakukan Manga Award for shonen manga in 2021, plus Harvey Awards for the best manga every year from 2021 to 2023.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'MAPPA produced the television anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The television anime ran for 12 episodes, from 12 October to 28 December 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The Reze Arc was turned into a film, Chainsaw Man - The Movie: Reze Arc, which premiered in Japan on 19 September 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The Assassins Arc is the announced next anime adaptation, and the official site lists it next to the series and the film.', 'history', 'official', 'https://chainsawman.dog/', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Part 2 of the manga is the School Arc, which follows Asa Mitaka and is not yet adapted into the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The opening theme of the series is Kick Back by Kenshi Yonezu.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Every episode has its own ending song by a different artist, from Chainsaw Blood by Vaundy in episode 1 to Zanki by Zutomayo in episode 12.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'denji', 'Denji carries a huge debt that his father left to the yakuza.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'yoru', 'Yoru is a War Devil in a weakened state and counts among the four Horsemen.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'denji', 'Denji is a main character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'pochita', 'Pochita is a main character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'power', 'Power is a main character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'aki-hayakawa', 'Aki Hayakawa is a main character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'makima', 'Makima is a main character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'kobeni-higashiyama', 'Kobeni Higashiyama is a supporting character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'himeno', 'Himeno is a supporting character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'kishibe', 'Kishibe is a supporting character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'angel-devil', 'Angel Devil is a supporting character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_c