', 'yoshida', 'Yoshida is a supporting character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'kishibe', 'Kishibe has made deals with a few devils, such as the Knife Devil, the Needle Devil and the Claw Devil.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'aki-hayakawa', 'Aki fights through deals with the Fox Devil and the Curse Devil, and later gets a peek at what comes next from the Future Devil.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'himeno', 'Himeno borrows the power of the Ghost Devil, using its unseen hand from far away.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The Curse Devil is born from people dreading curses.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The Future Devil is born from people dreading what lies ahead.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The Bat Devil is born from people dreading bats.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The Fox Devil is born from people dreading foxes.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The Spider Devil, a half-human half-spider woman named Princi, is born from people dreading spiders.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The Eternity Devil is born from people dreading eternity.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'kobeni-higashiyama', 'Kobeni Higashiyama is a human Devil Hunter, drafted into the experimental squad that Makima runs.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'aki-hayakawa', 'Aki Hayakawa hunts devils for Tokyo Special Division 4.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'kishibe', 'Kishibe moved over to Division 4, where he coaches Denji and Power.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Michiko Tendo comes from Kyoto Special Division 1 and is sent to Tokyo to coach the Division 4 hunters.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Before Chainsaw Man, Fujimoto drew another serialized manga called Fire Punch.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tatsuki_Fujimoto', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Look Back is a one-shot chapter by Fujimoto, released on Shonen Jump+.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tatsuki_Fujimoto', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Goodbye, Eri is a longer one-shot by Fujimoto, also put out on Shonen Jump+.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tatsuki_Fujimoto', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'A 1974 horror film, The Texas Chain Saw Massacre, gave Fujimoto the spark for his chainsaw hero.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'power', 'Power is a Blood Fiend who works as a Public Safety Devil Hunter for Makima.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'angel-devil', 'Angel Devil is a devil who joins Public Safety as a Devil Hunter and becomes Aki''s partner.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'katana-man', 'Katana Man, also called Samurai Sword, is a hybrid born into the yakuza and the grandson of their boss.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Weekly Shonen Jump is the Shueisha magazine that carried the first arc of the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Shonen Jump+ is the Shueisha app and website where the second arc ran.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Shueisha also offers the manga on its own platform, Manga Plus.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'In North America the English print and digital editions come from Viz Media.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'beam', 'Beam is the Shark Fiend, a devil living in a body.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'galgali', 'Galgali is the Violence Fiend, a devil living in a body.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'angel-devil', 'Angel Devil is a devil of its own, the embodiment of the fear of angels, and not a fiend inside a borrowed body.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Madoka is a hunter of Tokyo Special Division 4 who quits after surviving a hit aimed at the team.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Kenshi Yonezu performed Iris Out, the theme song of the Chainsaw Man anime film.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man_%E2%80%93_The_Movie:_Reze_Arc', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'Jane Doe, the closing song of the Chainsaw Man anime film, is a duet of Kenshi Yonezu and Hikaru Utada.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man_%E2%80%93_The_Movie:_Reze_Arc', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'series', 'chainsaw-man', 'The Zombie Devil is the devil that the yakuza strike a deal with when they want Denji dead.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'The Japanese title is コードギアス 反逆のルルーシュ, read Kōdo Giasu: Hangyaku no Rurūshu, and it means Code Geass: Lelouch of the Rebellion.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'The anime was made at the studio Sunrise.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'Gorō Taniguchi directed the Code Geass anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'Ichirō Ōkouchi handled the series composition of the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'The original character designs come from the manga group Clamp.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'Code Geass was the first anime series for which Clamp had ever been asked to design the characters.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'Kōtarō Nakagawa and Hitomi Kuroishi composed the music of the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'The idea took shape at Sunrise, where Ichirō Ōkouchi and Gorō Taniguchi pitched it to the producer Yoshitaka Kawaguchi.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'Its name may be taken from old Irish and Welsh stories about a geas, also spelled geis.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'The first season, Lelouch of the Rebellion, has 25 episodes and aired from October 2006 to July 2007.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'The second season, called R2, has 25 episodes and aired from April to September 2008.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_season_2_episodes', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'Both seasons together add up to 50 television episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'The film Lelouch of the Re;surrection opened in Japanese cinemas on February 9, 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass_Lelouch_of_the_Re;surrection', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'Lelouch of the Re;surrection opens a year after the Zero Requiem, the scheme that ended the story of the television series.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass_Lelouch_of_the_Re;surrection', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'The Akito the Exiled OVA series started in August 2012.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass:_Akito_the_Exiled', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'Rozé of the Recapture is a film series in four parts.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass:_Roz%C3%A9_of_the_Recapture', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'The Holy Britannian Empire has conquered Japan and renamed it Area 11.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'Geass is called the Power of Kings, and it gives its holder the power to demand absolute obedience.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'The English dub was shown in the United States on Adult Swim.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'Code Geass won the best television anime prize at the sixth annual Tokyo Anime Awards.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'series', 'code-geass', 'Lost Colors, a Code Geass game, was developed for the PlayStation Portable and the PlayStation 2.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_Geass', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'theme', 'op-1', 'The first opening of the anime is Colors, by the band FLOW.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_season_1_episodes', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'theme', 'op-2', 'Kaidoku Funō, by Jinn, is the second opening of the first season.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_season_1_episodes', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'theme', 'op-3', 'The first season finishes with the opening Hitomi no Tsubasa, performed by Access.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_season_1_episodes', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'theme', 'ed-1', 'The first ending of the anime is Yūkyō Seishunka, by Ali Project.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_season_1_episodes', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'theme', 'ed-2', 'Mosaic Kakera, by SunSet Swish, is the second ending of the first season.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_season_1_episodes', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'theme', 'op-4', 'R2 begins with the opening O2, performed by Orange Range.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_season_2_episodes', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'theme', 'op-5', 'World End, by FLOW, is the second opening of R2.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_season_2_episodes', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'theme', 'ed-3', 'The first ending of R2 is Shiawase Neiro, also performed by Orange Range.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_season_2_episodes', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'theme', 'ed-4', 'R2 closes with the ending Waga Rōtashi Aku no Hana, by Ali Project.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_season_2_episodes', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'lelouch-lamperouge', 'Lelouch Lamperouge, also Lelouch vi Britannia, is written ルルーシュ・ランペルージ in Japanese and leads the rebellion as Zero.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'suzaku-kururugi', 'Suzaku Kururugi is written 枢木スザク in Japanese and is the childhood friend of Lelouch.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'cc', 'C.C. is written シー・ツー in Japanese and is the immortal witch who grants Geass.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'kallen-stadtfeld', 'Kallen Stadtfeld, who is also Kallen Kouzuki, is written カレン・シュタットフェルト in Japanese and belongs to the Black Knights.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'nunnally-lamperouge', 'Nunnally Lamperouge, also Nunnally vi Britannia, is written ナナリー・ランペルージ in Japanese and is the younger sister of Lelouch.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'shirley-fenette', 'Shirley Fenette is written シャーリー・フェネット in Japanese and is a student at Ashford Academy.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'milly-ashford', 'Milly Ashford is written ミレイ・アッシュフォード in Japanese and is the Student Council president at Ashford Academy.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'rivalz-cardemonde', 'Rivalz Cardemonde is written リヴァル・カルデモンド in Japanese and is a student at Ashford Academy.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'nina-einstein', 'Nina Einstein is written ニーナ・アインシュタイン in Japanese and is a science student at Ashford Academy.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'euphemia-li-britannia', 'Euphemia li Britannia is written ユーフェミア・リ・ブリタニア in Japanese and is a princess of the imperial family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'cornelia-li-britannia', 'Cornelia li Britannia is written コーネリア・リ・ブリタニア in Japanese and is a princess of the imperial family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'schneizel-el-britannia', 'Schneizel el Britannia is written シュナイゼル・エル・ブリタニア in Japanese and is a prince of the imperial family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'charles-zi-britannia', 'Charles zi Britannia is written シャルル・ジ・ブリタニア in Japanese and is the Emperor of Britannia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'jeremiah-gottwald', 'Jeremiah Gottwald is written ジェレミア・ゴットワルド in Japanese and is an officer of the Britannian Army.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'rolo-lamperouge', 'Rolo Lamperouge is written ロロ・ランペルージ in Japanese and lives with Lelouch and Nunnally.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'lloyd-asplund', 'Lloyd Asplund is written ロイド・アスプルンド in Japanese and is a scientist of the Britannian Army.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'kaguya-sumeragi', 'Kaguya Sumeragi is written 皇神楽耶 in Japanese and is the head of the Kyōto House.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'kyoshiro-tohdoh', 'Kyoshiro Tohdoh is written 藤堂鏡志朗 in Japanese and is the head of military operations of the Black Knights.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('code-geass', 'character', 'diethard-ried', 'Diethard Ried is written ディートハルト・リート in Japanese and is the head of information and public relations of the Black Knights.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'bismarck-waldstein', 'Bismarck Waldstein is written ビスマルク・ヴァルトシュタイン in Japanese and is the Knight of One of the Knights of the Round.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'lelouch-lamperouge', 'Lelouch''s Geass allows him to order any person to obey the next thing he says.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'lelouch-lamperouge', 'In the later story, Lelouch pilots a Knightmare Frame named Shinkirō.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'suzaku-kururugi', 'Suzaku becomes the Knight of Seven among the Knights of the Round.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'suzaku-kururugi', 'Suzaku pilots the Knightmare Frame called Lancelot.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'cc', 'C.C. is the one who gives the power of Geass to others, Lelouch among them.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'kallen-stadtfeld', 'Kallen pilots the Knightmare Frame named Guren.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'nunnally-lamperouge', 'Nunnally is blind and uses a wheelchair.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'nina-einstein', 'Nina invents a powerful weapon known as the F.L.E.I.J.A. bomb.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'euphemia-li-britannia', 'Euphemia holds the post of Sub-Viceroy of Area 11.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'cornelia-li-britannia', 'Cornelia is the Viceroy of Area 11 and also the Commander-in-Chief.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'schneizel-el-britannia', 'Schneizel is the only person whom Lelouch could not defeat in a game of chess.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'charles-zi-britannia', 'Charles is the 98th emperor of Britannia and has 108 consorts.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'jeremiah-gottwald', 'Jeremiah''s Geass Canceler nullifies the effects that another Geass has had on a person.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'rolo-lamperouge', 'Rolo''s Geass lets him freeze time for a short while.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'lloyd-asplund', 'Lloyd is the scientist who created the Lancelot frame.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'kaguya-sumeragi', 'Kaguya becomes chair of the supreme council of the UFN.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'kyoshiro-tohdoh', 'Tohdoh has the nickname Tohdoh of Miracles.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'diethard-ried', 'Before he joins the Black Knights, Diethard worked as a television producer.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'bismarck-waldstein', 'Bismarck has a Geass that lets him see a few seconds into the future.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'milly-ashford', 'Milly is the president of the Student Council.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'shirley-fenette', 'Shirley is a member of the swimming team and of the Student Council.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'rivalz-cardemonde', 'Rivalz often gives Lelouch a lift on his motorbike.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'cc', 'C.C. keeps ordering pizza on Lelouch''s credit card, and the chain Pizza Hut sponsored Code Geass in Japan.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'suzaku-kururugi', 'Suzaku Kururugi is voiced in Japanese by Takahiro Sakurai.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('code-geass', 'character', 'lelouch-lamperouge', 'Lelouch Lamperouge is voiced in Japanese by Jun Fukuyama.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Code_Geass_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'In Japanese the title is カウボーイビバップ, read Kaubōi Bibappu, a katakana version of Cowboy Bebop.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'Sunrise made the series, with Shinichirō Watanabe leading the team as director.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'The credited creator Hajime Yatate is not one person but a shared pen name for the Sunrise staff.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'The series is a single season of 26 episodes, which the show calls sessions.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'TV Tokyo aired the show first, from 3 April to 26 June 1998, before the full run reached Wowow.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_episodes', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'Satellite channel Wowow showed all of it from 23 October 1998 to 24 April 1999.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_episodes', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'In 2071 a crew of bounty hunters, nicknamed cowboys, chase criminals around the Solar System from a ship called the Bebop.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'Yoko Kanno scored the show in a jazz-heavy style and formed the band Seatbelts to play it.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'theme', 'op-1', 'The opening, Tank!, is a mostly instrumental big band number with a long alto saxophone solo by Masato Honda.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'theme', 'ed-1', 'The first ending theme has vocals by Mai Yamane, and it is one of the few songs in the series sung in Japanese.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'The film, called Knockin'' on Heaven''s Door in Japan, opened on 1 September 2001, takes place between episodes 22 and 23, and was animated by Bones for Sunrise.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop:_The_Movie', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'When Adult Swim launched on 2 September 2001, Cowboy Bebop was the first anime on its schedule, at midnight Eastern.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'Because the film sits between episodes 22 and 23, the story here runs sessions 1 to 22, then the film, then sessions 23 to 26.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_episodes', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'spike-spiegel', 'Spike Spiegel is a main character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'jet-black', 'Jet Black is a main character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'faye-valentine', 'Faye Valentine is a main character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'ed', 'Edward Wong Hau Pepelu Tivrusky IV is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'ein', 'Ein is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'vicious', 'Vicious is an antagonist of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'julia', 'Julia is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'andy-von-de-oniyate', 'Andy von de Oniyate is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'laughing-bull', 'Laughing Bull is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'gren', 'Gren Eckener is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'vincent-volaju', 'Vincent Volaju is an antagonist of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'electra-ovilo', 'Electra Ovilo is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'spike-spiegel', 'Spike Spiegel is 27 years old, a lanky bounty hunter who was born on Mars.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'jet-black', 'Jet Black, the ex-cop from Ganymede who owns the Bebop, is 36 years old.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'ed', 'Radical Edward, the whiz-kid hacker, is a girl of roughly 13 years.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'faye-valentine', 'Faye looks barely older than twenty, yet after her long freeze she is really about 77 years old.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'ein', 'Ein shows he can talk with other animals in session 17, Mushroom Samba, where he swaps words with a cow.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'The director split his own series into 80 percent serious drama and 20 percent humour.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'In the film, Mars puts up a reward of 300 million woolongs to catch the culprit behind the pathogen attack.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop:_The_Movie', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'faye-valentine', 'Faye Valentine is voiced in Japanese by Megumi Hayashibara.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'spike-spiegel', 'Spike Spiegel is voiced in Japanese by Kōichi Yamadera.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'faye-valentine', 'The official character page lists Faye Valentine at 23 years old, the age she seems to be.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'The title is written ダンダダン in Japanese, and English editions also render it as Dan Da Dan.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'Yukinobu Tatsu alone writes and draws the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'The manga began on Shueisha''s Shōnen Jump+ platform on April 6, 2021 and is still running.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'The collected edition had reached twenty-five volumes by early September 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'At Manga Barcelona in 2025 the series won the shōnen category, at the festival''s 31st edition.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'Studio Science Saru animated the show, and Fūga Yamashiro directed the first season.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'Season one ran twelve episodes and began on October 3, 2024, in a Thursday slot just after midnight.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_episodes', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'Season two ran twelve episodes and began on July 3, 2025, again in a Thursday slot just after midnight.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_episodes', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'A third season was announced once season two ended, with a premiere planned for 2027.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_episodes', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'Season one opens with Otonoke by Creepy Nuts and closes with Taidada by Zutomayo.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_episodes', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'Season two opens with Kakumei Dōchū by Aina the End and closes with Doukashiteru by WurtS.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandada