', 'peeny-weeny', 'Peeny-Weeny is a supporting character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'evil-eye', 'Evil Eye is an antagonist of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'kinta-sakata', 'Kinta Sakata is a supporting character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'rin-sawaki', 'Rin Sawaki is a supporting character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'chiquitita', 'Chiquitita is a supporting character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'taro', 'Taro is a supporting character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'vamola', 'Vamola is a supporting character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'ludris', 'Ludris is a supporting character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'reiko-kashima', 'Reiko Kashima is an antagonist of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'count-saint-germain', 'Count Saint-Germain is an antagonist of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'unji-zuma', 'Unji Zuma is an antagonist of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'kouki-yukishiro', 'Kouki Yukishiro is an antagonist of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'seiko-ayase', 'In the Japanese version, Seiko Ayase is played by the singer and actress Nana Mizuki.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'seiko-ayase', 'Seiko fronts her own TV show, reads fortunes there for real, and the show has made her rich.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'turbo-granny', 'The Japanese voice of Turbo Granny is Mayumi Tanaka.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'turbo-granny', 'After her defeat, Seiko locks her spirit inside a lucky cat figure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'alien-serpo', 'Kazuya Nakai is the Japanese voice behind the Serpo aliens.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('dandadan', 'character', 'alien-serpo', 'There are no females among these aliens, who hail from a planet that shares their name.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'alien-serpo', 'Because they cannot reproduce naturally, they kidnap people from Earth to get the body parts they lack.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'aira-shiratori', 'Ayane Sakura voices Aira in the Japanese version.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'aira-shiratori', 'At Kami High, Aira is the girl everybody treats as the idol of the school.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'jin-enjoji', 'Kaito Ishikawa gives Jiji his voice in the Japanese version.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'jin-enjoji', 'Jiji passes for a handsome athlete, yet underneath he is a goofy soul who compliments everyone and sees good in all.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'jin-enjoji', 'Jiji knew Momo as a small child, and after trouble at his own house he ends up living with her and her grandmother.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'evil-eye', 'In Japanese, Evil Eye is voiced by Mutsumi Tamura.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'evil-eye', 'A bath of hot water tames this yokai, while cold brings his power back.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'evil-eye', 'This yokai''s birth lies in a person offered up in a sacrifice, and he grew vengeful afterwards.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'kinta-sakata', 'Daichi Fujiwara is the Japanese voice of Kinta.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'kinta-sakata', 'Kinta keeps hitting on girls in an awkward way, and they turn him down almost every time.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'kinta-sakata', 'His fixation on aliens and the paranormal makes Kinta the person who handles nanoskin best.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'taro', 'Tomokazu Sugita provides the Japanese voice of Taro.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'taro', 'Taro is a living anatomy model that has made its home in the school of Momo and Okarun.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'taro', 'Taro is head over heels for Hana.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'rin-sawaki', 'Manaka Iwami gives Rin her voice in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'rin-sawaki', 'Rin runs her class with a firm hand, but in private she is a fan of vampires.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'rin-sawaki', 'Rin''s power over gravity is bound to her singing voice.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'seiko-ayase', 'Seiko is a grandmother, yet she looks like a woman of twenty or so.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'turbo-granny', 'Long ago this yokai was a gentle presence for the ghosts of girls who met a terrible end.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'aira-shiratori', 'Aira is sure that heaven picked her to drive out spirits, and that conviction sets her against Momo and Okarun.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'ken-takakura', 'Ken Takakura is voiced in Japanese by Natsuki Hanae.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'The Japanese title is written デスノート, read Desu Nōto, which is simply the English name spelled in katakana.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/DEATH_NOTE', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'The manga pairs writer Tsugumi Ohba with artist Takeshi Obata.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Shueisha serialized the story in Weekly Shōnen Jump, starting in December 2003 and wrapping up in May 2006.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'The weekly chapters, 108 in all, were gathered into twelve tankōbon volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_chapters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'The anime ran for 37 episodes on Nippon Television, from the autumn of 2006 to the summer of 2007.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Two bands share the anime''s songs: Nightmare opens and closes the first half, then Maximum the Hormone takes over both slots, and the last episode ends on a short piece by the composer.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note_(2006_TV_series)', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Writer Ohba picked names that sound plausible yet are not found in real life, since so many of the characters are criminals or victims.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Circulation passed thirty million copies by spring 2015, which ranks the manga among the best sellers of its kind.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'A victim dies only if the writer pictures the face while writing the name, so a name alone is not enough.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'ryuk', 'Ryuk, the Shinigami who loses his notebook, has a weakness for apples.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'l', 'L is a scrawny detective who crouches in his chair and eats sweets without end.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'watari', 'On the surface Watari is Quillsh Wammy, an inventor who founded Wammy''s House, a home for gifted orphans in Winchester, England.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'mello', 'Mello has blond hair, flashy clothes and almost always carries a chocolate bar.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'A prose novel by Nisio Isin, Another Note, came out in 2006 as a spin-off of the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'An American film version premiered only on Netflix in August 2017.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'In North America Viz Media holds the license for the Death Note books and anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'light-yagami', 'Light Yagami is a main character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'l', 'L is a main character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'ryuk', 'Ryuk is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'misa-amane', 'Misa Amane is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'soichiro-yagami', 'Soichiro Yagami is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'touta-matsuda', 'Touta Matsuda is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'sayu-yagami', 'Sayu Yagami is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'ht