iki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'teru-mikami', 'Teru Mikami is an antagonist of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'near', 'Near is a main character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'mello', 'Mello is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'ryuk', 'Ryuk is a Shinigami, a death god who gets bored and drops his Death Note into the human world just for fun.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'rem', 'Rem is the Shinigami who hands Misa her Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'sidoh', 'Sidoh is a Shinigami, and the notebook that Ryuk stole from him ends up with a mafia gang.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'The Yotsuba Group is a board of eight company executives, and Shingo Mido, Reiji Namikawa and Eiichi Takahashi sit on it.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Hitoshi Demegawa runs the television station Sakura TV, where the tapes of the second Kira are shown.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Matt, a friend of Mello, is known for chain smoking and playing video games rather than for any favourite food.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'raye-penber', 'Raye Penber is an American investigator who works for the FBI.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'naomi-misora', 'Naomi Misora used to be a top FBI agent and is the fiancee of Raye Penber.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Steve Mason is the head of the FBI who helps L and later helps Near start the SPK.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'soichiro-yagami', 'Soichiro Yagami is a detective superintendent of Japan''s National Police Agency and leads the first investigation team.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Near leads the SPK, a small anti-Kira team whose members include Anthony Rester, Halle Lidner and Stephen Gevanni.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'kanzo-mogi', 'Kanzo Mogi is a quiet but dedicated member of the Japanese Kira investigation team.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Sanami is a Task Force member who exists only in the live-action Death Note films, where she is the one woman on the team.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Beyond Birthday, called BB, is a killer who appears only in the prequel novel Another Note and never in the manga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Aiber is a professional con man hired by L, who plays the detective alias Eraldo Coil.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'L, Mello, Matt and Near all lived in Wammy''s House, and so did the novel killer Beyond Birthday.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Kyosuke Higuchi is the third person to act as Kira, handed the notebook by Rem.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'misa-amane', 'Misa Amane is the second Kira, and she carries the eyes of a Shinigami.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'teru-mikami', 'Teru Mikami is a prosecutor whom Light picks to be the fourth Kira.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'The live-action sequel The Last Name premiered in 2006, and the spin-off film L: Change the World followed in Japan in 2008.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'touta-matsuda', 'Touta Matsuda is the rookie of the Japanese task force chasing Kira, the youngest man on the squad.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'shuichi-aizawa', 'Shuichi Aizawa is a Japanese task force detective who steps up as its leader after L is gone.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'hideki-ide', 'Hideki Ide is a Japanese police officer who sticks with Soichiro through the Kira case.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'light-yagami', 'In the Japanese cast of the Death Note anime, Light Yagami is voiced by Mamoru Miyano.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note_(2006_TV_series)', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'The Japanese title 鬼滅の刃, Kimetsu no Yaiba, can be roughly translated as Blade of Demon Destruction.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Koyoharu Gotouge both wrote and drew the Demon Slayer manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Shueisha''s Weekly Shonen Jump carried the manga between 15 February 2016 and 18 May 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Shueisha gathered the manga into 23 collected volumes, released between June 2016 and December 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Studio Ufotable produced the TV anime, with Haruo Sotozaki as its director.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'The TV anime launched on April 6, 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Counting only the main TV series, not the films or compilation films, there are 63 episodes in 4 seasons (the usual Wikipedia grouping), aired from 2019 to 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Ahead of the TV broadcast, the first five episodes had a two-week cinema run in Japan starting March 29, 2019, billed as Sibling''s Bond.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_season_1', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'On October 16, 2020, the Mugen Train film opened in Japan, and it went on to be the top-grossing film of 2020 worldwide.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_%E2%80%93_The_Movie:_Mugen_Train', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Season 4, the Hashira Training Arc, opened on May 12, 2024, ran for eight episodes and adapts manga chapters 128-139.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_season_4', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'The Infinity Castle story is being adapted as a film trilogy, and its first film reached Japanese cinemas on July 18, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_%E2%80%93_The_Movie:_Infinity_Castle', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Two composers, Yuki Kajiura and Go Shiina, share the music of the TV anime.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'LiSA''s Gurenge, the first opening theme, took the best theme song prize at the 2019 Newtype Anime Awards.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gurenge', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'tanjiro-kamado', 'Tanjiro''s unusually sharp sense of smell helps him track demons and sense how other people feel.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'nezuko-kamado', 'Nezuko does not feed on people; she keeps up her strength by sleeping instead.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'zenitsu-agatsuma', 'Zenitsu knows just one form of Thunder Breathing, yet he has honed it to a remarkable level.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'inosuke-hashibira', 'Inosuke grew up among boars and usually wears the head of his late boar mother as a mask.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published');
