n_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'genya-shinazugawa', 'Genya Shinazugawa is a supporting character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'doma', 'Doma is an antagonist of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'kokushibo', 'Kokushibo is an antagonist of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'hantengu', 'Hantengu is an antagonist of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'gyokko', 'Gyokko is an antagonist of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'muzan-kibutsuji', 'Muzan Kibutsuji, the very first demon, is the villain whose attack on the Kamado family left Nezuko transformed.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'nezuko-kamado', 'Nezuko journeys at her brother Tanjiro''s side, riding on his back inside a purpose-built wooden box.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'zenitsu-agatsuma', 'Zenitsu entered the Demon Slayer Corps at the same time as Tanjiro and fights as his comrade.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'inosuke-hashibira', 'Boar-raised Inosuke starts out wild, yet he grows into one of the trusted companions around Tanjiro.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'tanjiro-kamado', 'The Breathing style that Tanjiro trains in at the start of his journey is Water Breathing.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'inosuke-hashibira', 'Inosuke made up his own fighting method, which he named Beast Breathing.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'kanao-tsuyuri', 'Kanao Tsuyuri practises Flower Breathing and carries a light pink Nichirin sword.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'nezuko-kamado', 'Among the powers Nezuko has as a demon is Exploding Blood, a Blood Demon Art that makes flames which hurt demons.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'giyu-tomioka', 'Giyu Tomioka holds the title of Water Hashira and is the first Demon Slayer whom Tanjiro meets.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'shinobu-kocho', 'Shinobu Kocho is the Hashira with the Insect title, and her name means butterfly.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'sanemi-shinazugawa', 'Sanemi Shinazugawa is the Wind Hashira, a harsh fighter who refuses to accept the Kamado siblings.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'kanao-tsuyuri', 'Kanao Tsuyuri is Shinobu''s adopted sister and a trained tsuguko, a Demon Slayer who does not hold a Hashira title.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'akaza', 'Akaza sits at the third place among the Upper Ranks of the Twelve Kizuki.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'daki', 'Daki is an Upper Rank demon who holds the sixth seat jointly with her brother.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'gyutaro', 'Gyutaro holds the sixth Upper Rank seat together with his younger sister Daki.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'enmu', 'Enmu, the foe of the Mugen Train story, is the top-ranked of the Lower Ranks.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'zenitsu-agatsuma', 'Zenitsu''s sense of hearing is so sharp that he can tell what people truly intend and follow demons by sound.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'inosuke-hashibira', 'Inosuke feels vibrations in the air with his skin, and that is how he locates opponents.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'mitsuri-kanroji', 'Mitsuri Kanroji gets her fighting edge from a very muscular body that is both unusually flexible and strong.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'genya-shinazugawa', 'Genya Shinazugawa is a Demon Slayer who cannot use any breathing technique, and instead gains demon powers for a while by eating demon flesh.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'tanjiro-kamado', 'The first blade made for Tanjiro is a Nichirin sword with a black blade.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'shinobu-kocho', 'Shinobu fights with a slender, needle-like Nichirin sword that delivers a wisteria poison.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'mitsuri-kanroji', 'Mitsuri uses a Nichirin sword that moves more like a lash than a straight blade.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'gyomei-himejima', 'Gyomei Himejima, the Stone Hashira, swings a huge kusarigama rather than an ordinary Nichirin sword.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'hotaru-haganezuka', 'Hotaru Haganezuka is a swordsmith who makes blades for the Corps and is given the job of forging Tanjiro''s.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'rui', 'The child-like demon Rui is brought down by Giyu in the end.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'gyokko', 'Gyokko raids the Swordsmith Village with Hantengu, but Muichiro is the one who ends him.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'muichiro-tokito', 'Muichiro Tokito is the Hashira of Mist and a descendant of earlier Demon Slayers.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Kozo Kanamori is a Swordsmith Village smith who made the blades of Inosuke and was later given Muichiro''s.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'The Spider Demon who plays the Father of the spider family dies when Giyu steps in.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Kyogai, the Drum Demon who haunts the Tsuzumi Mansion, is slain by Tanjiro after a long fight.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Tecchin Tecchikawahara, a skilled senior smith with a mild temper, leads the village where the Corps'' swords are forged.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Aoi Kanzaki, though a Demon Slayer, is too frightened to fight and instead looks after wounded slayers at the Butterfly Mansion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'inosuke-hashibira', 'Inosuke Hashibira is voiced in Japanese by Yoshitsugu Matsuoka.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'The Japanese title 名探偵コナン is read Meitantei Konan, and the English releases of the manga were renamed Case Closed.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Gosho Aoyama writes and draws the manga that the anime is based on.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'The manga runs in Shogakukan''s Weekly Shōnen Sunday.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Shogakukan publishes the manga in Japan.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'The manga began on January 5, 1994, and is still running.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'As of October 2026 the manga has been collected in 109 tankobon volumes, and more keep coming.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'The TV anime premiered on January 8, 1996, and it is still on the air.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'TMS Entertainment animates the TV series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Yomiuri Telecasting Corporation co-produces the anime together with TMS Entertainment.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Katsuo Ōno composed the original music of the TV series.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'The anime has had five directors over the years, among them Kenji Kodama and Yasuichiro Yamamoto.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Masatomo Sudo has designed the characters of the anime from the beginning.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'The first Detective Conan film, The Time Bombed Skyscraper, opened in 1997.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'As of April 2026 there have been 29 Detective Conan films, one almost every year since 1997 except 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'The latest film listed is Detective Conan: Fallen Angel of the Highway, which opened on April 10, 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Mai Kuraki holds a Guinness World Record: nobody else has sung as many themes for a single anime.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'The very first opening theme was Mune ga Dokidoki by The High-Lows, used from episode 1 on January 8, 1996.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'The first ending theme, Step by Step by Ziggy, covered the first 26 episodes.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Mai Kuraki''s Secret of My Heart was an ending theme in the year 2000, for episodes 180 to 204.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Aoyama took inspiration from Arsène Lupin, Sherlock Holmes stories and the samurai films of Akira Kurosawa.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Aoyama''s team needs about four hours to script a simple puzzle and about twelve for a complex one, and his brother, a scientist, helps with the tricks.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'In 2015 Aoyama had surgery, which caused the first long hiatus of the manga in 21 years.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'The 46th Shogakukan Manga Award, handed out in 2001, went to Detective Conan in the shonen section.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Because of legal problems with the name Detective Conan, several American English releases were renamed Case Closed.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Funimation dubbed the anime in English as Case Closed and began releasing it on DVD in August 2004.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Anime-only stories are common: 23 of the 39 episodes shown in 2025 were made by the anime staff rather than adapted from the manga.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'Aoyama''s hometown Hokuei in Tottori has a museum of his work, and the town markets itself as Conan Town.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'A crossover special, Lupin the 3rd vs. Detective Conan, aired on March 27, 2009, and set a household rating record of 19.5.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'In the first live-action specials, Shun Oguri played the teenage Shinichi Kudo.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'A spin-off manga, Zero''s Tea Time, follows the agent Toru Amuro, also known as Rei Furuya.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Case_Closed', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'series', 'detective-conan', 'The episode lists are split into three groups: seasons 1 to 15, seasons 16 to 30 and seasons 31 and later.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lists_of_Case_Closed_episodes', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'conan-edogawa', 'Conan Edogawa is the alias of Shinichi Kudo, a high school detective whose body has been shrunk to that of a child.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'conan-edogawa', 'He hides his identity by living with Ran, and by sedating Kogoro and imitating his voice, he helps solve cases.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'conan-edogawa', 'Minami Takayama has voiced Conan Edogawa in the TV series since 1996.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minami_Takayama', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'ran-mori', 'Ran Mori is Shinichi''s childhood friend and a skilled karate fighter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'ran-mori', 'Aoyama chose karate for Ran because he considered it cooler than kendo or judo.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('detective-conan', 'character', 'ran-mori', 'Wakana Yamazaki voiced Ran from 1996 for many years.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'kogoro-mori', 'Kogoro Mori is Ran''s father, a private detective who became famous because Conan secretly solves his cases.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'kogoro-mori', 'Akira Kamiya was the first voice of Kogoro, followed by Rikiya Koyama in 2009.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'heiji-hattori', 'Heiji Hattori is a high school detective from Osaka and a rival of Shinichi Kudo.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'heiji-hattori', 'Aoyama gave Heiji a Kansai dialect and dark skin to make him very different from Shinichi.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'heiji-hattori', 'Ryo Horikawa voices Heiji in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'kazuha-toyama', 'Kazuha Toyama is Heiji''s childhood friend, and her bond with him mirrors the one between Ran and Shinichi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'kazuha-toyama', 'Yūko Miyamura voices Kazuha in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'ai-haibara', 'Ai Haibara is the alias of Shiho Miyano, a former member of the Black Organization who joined the Junior Detective League.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'ai-haibara', 'As a gifted chemist she invented APTX 4869, the poison that shrank Shinichi Kudo.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'ai-haibara', 'Megumi Hayashibara voices Ai in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'hiroshi-agasa', 'Hiroshi Agasa is the absent-minded professor next door, who invents gadgets and knows Conan''s secret.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'hiroshi-agasa', 'Kenichi Ogata voices Professor Agasa in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'genta-kojima', 'Genta Kojima loves food and calls himself the head of the Junior Detective League.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'genta-kojima', 'Genta is voiced by Wataru Takagi, the actor who shares his name with the police officer Wataru Takagi.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'mitsuhiko-tsuburaya', 'Mitsuhiko Tsuburaya is the bright, well-read member of the Junior Detective League who likes science books.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'mitsuhiko-tsuburaya', 'Ikue Ōtani voices Mitsuhiko in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'ayumi-yoshida', 'Ayumi Yoshida is a classmate of Conan and the only girl of the Junior Detective League until Ai joins.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'ayumi-yoshida', 'Yukiko Iwai voices Ayumi in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'juzo-megure', 'Juzo Megure is the veteran police inspector who heads most murder investigations.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'juzo-megure', 'Chafurin voices Inspector Megure in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'wataru-takagi', 'Wataru Takagi is an officer under Inspector Megure who has feelings for Miwako Sato.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'wataru-takagi', 'The officer Takagi is voiced by the actor Wataru Takagi, who has the same name.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'miwako-sato', 'Miwako Sato is a smart, athletic police officer who is popular with her male colleagues.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'miwako-sato', 'Atsuko Yuya voices Miwako Sato in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'ninzaburo-shiratori', 'Ninzaburo Shiratori is a promoted officer who has unrequited feelings for Miwako Sato.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'kaito-kid', 'Kaito Kid is a gentleman thief and master of disguise who steals gems using magic tricks.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'kaito-kid', 'Kid was originally the star of Aoyama''s earlier series Magic Kaito.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'gin', 'Gin is a high-ranking and merciless agent of the Black Organization, the man who made Shinichi swallow the drug.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'gin', 'A black Porsche 356A is the car Gin likes to use.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'gin', 'Yukitoshi Hori voices Gin in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'vermouth', 'Vermouth is a mysterious member of the Black Organization who never seems to age.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'vermouth', 'Mami Koyama voices Vermouth in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'masumi-sera', 'Masumi Sera is a teenage female detective who joins the high school of Shinichi and Ran.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'masumi-sera', 'Masumi''s two older brothers are Shuichi Akai and Shukichi Haneda.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'yusaku-kudo', 'Yusaku Kudo is Shinichi''s father, a famous mystery author who created the Night Baron.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'yukiko-kudo', 'Yukiko Kudo is Shinichi''s mother, a former actress who learned disguise from Toichi Kuroba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'subaru-okiya', 'Subaru Okiya is a blond graduate student with glasses who lives in the Kudo house.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'subaru-okiya', 'Subaru Okiya is revealed to be the FBI agent Shuichi Akai in disguise.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'rum', 'Rum is the second in command of the Black Organization and is close to its Boss.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'toru-amuro', 'Toru Amuro is the alias of Rei Furuya, a public security agent who infiltrated the Black Organization as Bourbon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'jodie-starling', 'Jodie Starling is Ran''s new English teacher who turns out to be an FBI agent with a grudge against Vermouth.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'james-black', 'James Black leads the FBI operation against the Black Organization in Japan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'sonoko-suzuki', 'Sonoko Suzuki is Ran''s best friend and comes from a rich family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'makoto-kyogoku', 'Makoto Kyogoku is a karate champion known as the Prince of Kicks and the boyfriend of Sonoko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('detective-conan', 'character', 'eri-kisaki', 'Eri Kisaki is Ran''s mother, a lawyer nicknamed the Queen of the legal world.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Case_Closed_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The title is written in capitals as Dr.STONE in Japan, and English texts use the spaced form Dr. Stone.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Riichiro Inagaki wrote the story of the manga and the South Korean artist Boichi drew every page.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The manga ran in Weekly Shōnen Jump for the whole of its serialization.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Shueisha is the Japanese publisher of the collected volumes, which appear under its Jump Comics imprint.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The first chapter appeared in Weekly Shōnen Jump on March 6, 2017.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Serialization lasted five years: it began on March 6, 2017 and finished on March 7, 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The manga fills 27 collected volumes, the last of them published in April 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The 232 weekly chapters of the main story were first collected in 26 volumes between July 2017 and July 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'A green flash turns the whole human race to stone, and the story begins about 3,700 years later when a teenage genius wakes up alone.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Inagaki says the personality of Senku was meant to resemble Agon Kongo, a character from his earlier sports manga Eyeshield 21.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The author names the older manga Video Girl Ai as a major influence on how the story developed.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Dr. Stone was one of several story pitches Inagaki showed his editor, who picked it because he could not guess where it would go.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Boichi was asked to draw the series around the time Inagaki finished the storyboards of the third chapter, and Inagaki was already a fan of his art.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'In 2019 the manga won the 64th Shogakukan Manga Award in the shonen category.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'As of March 2026 the manga had more than 20 million copies in circulation.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'In 2020 the 4th Crunchyroll Anime Awards named Senku the Best Protagonist.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Senku''s signature cry of excitement made the 2019 anime buzzword list compiled by Gadget Tsūshin.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Dr. Stone ranked eighth among the anime series that Japanese Netflix viewers watched the most in 2019.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Viz Media licensed the manga for North America, and its 26 first volumes came out from September 2018 to July 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Shueisha began publishing the manga in English at the same time as in Japan on its Manga Plus site and app in January 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The anime adaptation premiered on July 5, 2019, on Tokyo MX and other networks.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'TMS Entertainment produced the anime, with 8PAN and later Die4Studio also credited on some seasons.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Shinya Iino directed the first two seasons, then Shūhei Matsushita took over for the special and for seasons three and four.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Weekly Shōnen Jump announced the anime adaptation on November 19, 2018.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'A trio of composers wrote the score together: Tatsuya Kato, Hiroaki Tsutsumi and Yuki Kanesaka.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The first season ran for 24 episodes, from July 5 to December 13, 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_episodes', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The second season, Stone Wars, has 11 episodes and aired from January 14 to March 25, 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'A television special about Ryusui Nanami aired on July 10, 2022, between the second and third seasons.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_episodes', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The third season, New World, has 22 episodes in two cours: April to June 2023 and October to December 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_episodes', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The fourth and final season, Science Future, has 37 episodes in three cours between January 2025 and June 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_episodes', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The anime runs for 4 seasons and 94 episodes in all, plus one television special.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The last episode of the anime aired on June 25, 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_episodes', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'For the very last episode the ending song was the show''s first opening, Good Morning World!, according to the encyclopedia of Anime News Network.', 'music', 'press', 'https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/encyclopedia/anime.php?id=37873', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'A nine chapter spin-off, Reboot: Byakuya, ran in Weekly Shōnen Jump between October 28 and December 23, 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'A three chapter follow-up, 4D Science, set after the finale ran from November 6 to December 25, 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'In October 2026 a new anime was announced that will adapt the Terraforming one-shot, which is set after the main story.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'A strategy smartphone game, Battle Craft, was released in Japan on September 1, 2021 by Poppin Games Japan.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The English dub began on Adult Swim''s Toonami block on August 25, 2019, and Crunchyroll streams the series worldwide outside Asia.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Season one used Good Morning World! and then Sangenshoku as openings, with Life and Yume no Youna as endings.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Stone Wars was opened by Rakuen of Fujifabric and closed by Koe? of Hatena.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'New World had two cours with two song pairs: Wasuregataki with Where Do We Go?, then Haruka with Suki ni Shinayo.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Science Future had three cours of songs, from Casanova Posse up to Skins by Asian Kung-Fu Generation and Rocket by Burnout Syndromes.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The anime is cut into five parts: season one, Stone Wars, a television special, New World and Science Future.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_episodes', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'senku-ishigami', 'Senku Ishigami is a teenage prodigy of science who sets out to rebuild civilization after waking in the Stone World.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'senku-ishigami', 'Astronomy and exploring space are the favorite fields of science for Senku.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'senku-ishigami', 'Yūsuke Kobayashi voices Senku in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'taiju-oki', 'Taiju Oki is Senku''s best friend, a gentle giant whom Senku teases as a big oaf.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'taiju-oki', 'Makoto Furukawa voices Taiju in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'yuzuriha-ogawa', 'Yuzuriha Ogawa is a cheerful girl from the handicrafts club who dreams of becoming a fashion designer.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'tsukasa-shishio', 'Tsukasa Shishio is a young mixed martial arts star nicknamed the strongest primate high schooler, and he can fell a lion with a single blow.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'tsukasa-shishio', 'Tsukasa drapes himself in the skin of a male lion that he hunted down himself.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'tsukasa-shishio', 'Yuichi Nakamura voices Tsukasa in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'kohaku', 'Kohaku is the strongest warrior of Ishigami Village and the first villager that Senku meets.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'chrome', 'Chrome is a boy of Ishigami Village who calls himself a sorcerer after mistaking basic science for magic.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('dr-stone', 'character', 'chrome', 'Chrome likes collecting rocks and managing chemical reactions.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'suika', 'Suika is a young girl who keeps a watermelon on her head to hide her fuzzy sickness.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'gen-asagiri', 'Gen Asagiri is a silver-tongued mentalist from the old world who always walks barefoot in a yukata.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'gen-asagiri', 'Kengo Kawanishi voices Gen in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'ryusui-nanami', 'Ryusui Nanami is the rich heir of the Nanami Conglomerate and an expert sailor who captains the ship Perseus.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'ryusui-nanami', 'Model ships are what Ryusui buys with his pocket money.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'hyoga-akatsuki', 'Hyoga Akatsuki is a tall spear fighter of the Tsukasa Empire who believes in social Darwinism.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'hyoga-akatsuki', 'Akira Ishida voices Hyoga in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'ukyo-saionji', 'Ukyo Saionji is a former navy sonar operator with sensitive hearing and a talent for languages who became an expert archer.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'francois', 'Francois is the butler and chef of Ryusui, who baked the first bread of the Stone World.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'kaseki', 'Kaseki is a muscular elderly craftsman who builds glass and engines from the drawings of Senku.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'ruri', 'Ruri is the high priestess of Ishigami Village and the older sister of Kohaku, whose illness drives the first goal of the Kingdom of Science.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'kokuyo', 'Kokuyo is the bearded village chief when Senku wakes up, and the father of Kohaku and Ruri.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'byakuya-ishigami', 'Byakuya Ishigami is Senku''s adoptive father, an astronaut on the International Space Station who founded Ishigami Village.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'dr-xeno', 'Dr. Xeno is a former NASA scientist who leads the colony in the United States and rivals Senku in genius.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'stanley-snyder', 'Stanley Snyder is a soldier and the second in command of Dr. Xeno.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'mirai-shishio', 'Mirai Shishio is the younger sister of Tsukasa, who was brain-dead from an accident before the petrification.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'why-man', 'Why-Man is the name Ryusui gives to whoever petrifies humanity from the surface of the Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The first three episodes are titled Stone World, King of the Stone World and Weapons of Science.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_episodes', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The anime ends with two episodes titled Why-Man and Ushers of an Exhilarating Future.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_episodes', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'On a nearby island, a stock of platinum left by Senku''s adoptive father can serve as a catalyst to mass-produce the revival fluid.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'Late in the story the Kingdom of Science builds a rocket so that a crew can travel to the Moon and find the source of the petrification.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'suika', 'After a second worldwide petrification, only Suika remains awake, revived by the forces of nature, and she works for years to learn how to make nitric acid.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'why-man', 'Why-Man turns out to be the shared consciousness of all the thinking petrification devices that crossed the galaxy for ages.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'tsukasa-shishio', 'Tsukasa wants a world order ruled by power and strength, and he smashes the petrified adults he meets so that they cannot get in his way.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'senku-ishigami', 'Senku fakes his own death so that Tsukasa stops hunting him, and then befriends the people of Ishigami Village.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'gen-asagiri', 'Gen was revived by Tsukasa to confirm Senku''s death, but after seeing what Senku achieves he joins the Kingdom of Science.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'ibara', 'Ibara is the minister of the Petrification Kingdom, who seized power and used the Petrification Device against anyone who threatened him.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'soyuz', 'Soyuz is a barefoot strongman with a photographic memory and an X-shaped scar, and he later leads the Petrification Kingdom.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'taiju-oki', 'Taiju has enormous strength and almost endless stamina, yet he is a pacifist who has never thrown a punch.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'taiju-oki', 'Taiju has fallen for Yuzuriha, and there is nothing he would not do to look after her.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'yuzuriha-ogawa', 'Yuzuriha is exceptionally good at crafts such as sewing and working with cloth.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'kohaku', 'A running joke has people insult Kohaku''s femininity by comparing her to a gorilla or a lioness.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'kohaku', 'Kohaku is the younger sister of Ruri, the priestess of Ishigami Village.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'suika', 'Senku fits the watermelon helmet of Suika with lenses made to measure, and she often scouts for him.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'kaseki', 'Kaseki designed and built much of Ishigami Village, and he shapes items from Senku''s drawings such as glass, engines and vacuum tubes.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'ruri', 'Ruri keeps the Hundred Stories, the village legends, for future generations.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'character', 'chrome', 'Chrome learns of the wonders of old science and becomes the partner of Senku in rediscovering them.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dr._Stone_characters', 'published'), ('dr-stone', 'series', 'dr-stone', 'The anime ran for four TV seasons, the last of which, Science Future, wrapped up in June 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr._Stone', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'The franchise is called ドラゴンボール in Japan, read Doragon Bōru, and Dragon Ball is how it is written in English.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Akira Toriyama created the franchise and wrote and drew the original manga on his own.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'The original manga ran for a little over ten years in Weekly Shonen Jump, from November 1984 to May 1995 by release date.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'The first anime ran for 153 episodes, from February 26, 1986 to April 1989, on Fuji Television.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Dragon Ball Z started in April 1989 and aired 291 episodes before ending in January 1996.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball_Z', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'After a long gap, Dragon Ball Super returned to television in July 2015 and ran for 131 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball_Super_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Daima aired its 20 episodes between October 2024 and February 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball_Daima', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Toei Animation produced the anime television series of the franchise.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball_Z', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'The Dragon Ball Super manga is drawn by Toyotarou and runs in V Jump rather than in Weekly Shonen Jump.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball_Super', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'The story was inspired by the Chinese novel Journey to the West, with Hong Kong kung fu films mixed in.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'goku', 'Goku''s Japanese name, Son Goku, is how the Monkey King Sun Wukong of Journey to the West is read in Japanese.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Daima is the last new anime story that Akira Toriyama conceived, and he died shortly before it aired.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball_Daima', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'The Dragon Ball Super manga went on hiatus after Akira Toriyama died in March 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball_Super', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'frieza', 'The name Frieza is a pun on freezer, and his Ginyu Force henchmen are named after fridge items.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'The film Dragon Ball Super: Broly, set mostly after the Universe Survival Saga, arrived in Japan on 14 December 2018.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball_Super', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Super Hero is the second Dragon Ball Super film, and its Japanese release came on 11 June 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball_Super', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Dragon Ball Z Kai is a re-edited version of Dragon Ball Z that aired from 2009 to 2015.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball_Z', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'goku', 'Goku is a main character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'bulma', 'Bulma is a main character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'master-roshi', 'Master Roshi is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'yamcha', 'Yamcha is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'oolong', 'Oolong is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'chi-chi', 'Chi-Chi is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'emperor-pilaf', 'Emperor Pilaf is an antagonist of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'krillin', 'Krillin is a main character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'tien-shinhan', 'Tien Shinhan is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'king-piccolo', 'King Piccolo is an antagonist of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'piccolo', 'Piccolo is a main character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'raditz', 'Raditz is an antagonist of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'vegeta', 'Vegeta is a main character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'gohan', 'Gohan is a main character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'frieza', 'Frieza is an antagonist of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'dende', 'Dende is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'trunks', 'Trunks is a main character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'android-18', 'Android 18 is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'cell', 'Cell is an antagonist of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'mr-satan', 'Mr. Satan is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'goten', 'Goten is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'videl', 'Videl is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'majin-buu', 'Majin Buu is an antagonist of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'beerus', 'Beerus is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'whis', 'Whis is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'hit', 'Hit is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'zamasu', 'Zamasu is an antagonist of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'jiren', 'Jiren is an antagonist of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'gomah', 'Gomah is an antagonist of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'glorio', 'Glorio is a supporting character of Dragon Ball.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'emperor-pilaf', 'Emperor Pilaf heads his own little crew of schemers and hunts the Dragon Balls to rule the world.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Shu the ninja dog and Mai the gadget expert are the two henchmen who work for Pilaf.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'oolong', 'Oolong is a pig who changes shape, joins Goku and Bulma, and makes his own wish before Pilaf can make one.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Dr. Slump is an earlier Toriyama manga, and Dragon Ball is set in the very same fictional world.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Dragon Ball GT is a sequel series made only for anime, produced by Toei after Dragon Ball Z.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon_Ball', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'krillin', 'Krillin is Goku''s best friend, and both boys study martial arts together under Master Roshi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'yamcha', 'Yamcha starts as a desert bandit, then turns into an ally and eventually studies under Master Roshi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'tien-shinhan', 'Tien Shinhan first shows up as a rival, trained by Master Shen, the rival of Master Roshi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Toriyama likes wordplay: Saiyan names are veggie jokes, while Bulma and her family are named for underwear.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'raditz', 'Raditz belongs to the Saiyan race and is the older brother of Goku.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Nappa is a Saiyan elite who survived the destruction of Planet Vegeta and fights with Saibamen helpers.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'vegeta', 'Vegeta is the prince of the Saiyans, the fourth in his royal line to carry that name.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'piccolo', 'Piccolo turns out to belong to the green-skinned Namekian people.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'dende', 'Dende is a young Namekian who ends up as Earth''s new guardian god.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Kami, who guards Earth, was once one being with King Piccolo and is a Namekian too.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'krillin', 'Krillin is an Earthling monk, counted among the best martial artists on the planet.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'The Ginyu Force is Frieza''s elite squad of five hired fighters, known for silly poses.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Guldo, a short Ginyu Force fighter with four eyes, can stop time while he holds his breath.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Recoome is the Ginyu Force brute with orange hair who names his attacks after himself.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Burter, a blue Ginyu Force member, brags that nobody in the universe moves faster than him.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Zarbon, a handsome long-haired alien, is one of Frieza''s top henchmen next to Dodoria, outside the five-man squad.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'chi-chi', 'Chi-Chi is married to Goku and has two sons with him.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'gohan', 'Gohan is the first son born to Goku and Chi-Chi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'goten', 'Goten is the second and younger son of Goku and Chi-Chi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'trunks', 'Trunks comes from another house: he is the child of Vegeta and Bulma, a traveller from the future.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Vados is Whis''s sister, an Angel who waits on Champa and also teaches him martial arts.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Mr. Popo is a genie-like being who waits on whoever guards the Earth.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'master-roshi', 'Master Roshi lives on a small island as an elderly martial arts teacher, not as anyone''s attendant.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'goku', 'Goku can turn into a huge ape, and in the early story it happens by accident.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'goku', 'Goku first becomes a Super Saiyan during his fight on Namek, after Krillin is killed.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'goku', 'Goku takes the Super Saiyan God form when he faces the god Beerus.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Goten and Trunks join through a fusion technique into one new fighter called Gotenks.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'hit', 'Hit is a feared assassin who comes from Universe 6.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Cabba is a polite Saiyan from Planet Sadala who joins the team of Universe 6.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'whis', 'Whis is an Angel, one of the beings bound to serve a God of Destruction as guide and attendant.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'series', 'dragon-ball', 'Champa is the twin of Beerus and the one who watches over Universe 6 as its God of Destruction.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('dragon-ball', 'character', 'beerus', 'Beerus picks the Universe 7 team for the Tournament of Power, as the god who looks after that universe.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dragon_Ball_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'Neon Genesis Evangelion is Shin Seiki Evangerion in Japanese, New Century Evangelion in plain terms, while the Greek wording of the title is read as New Beginning Gospel.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'The 1995 series was animated by Gainax together with Tatsunoko Production, with Hideaki Anno in the director''s chair.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'Evangelion aired as a single season of 26 episodes on TV Tokyo, starting on October 4, 1995 and finishing on March 27, 1996.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_episodes', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'The year is 2015 and the stage is Tokyo-3, a heavily defended city of the future, built in the wake of a catastrophe that hit the planet 15 years earlier.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'The opening theme, A Cruel Angel''s Thesis, is sung by Yoko Takahashi, and it took an Animage award for best song in 1996.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'The credits roll to Fly Me to the Moon, a cover with British singer Claire Littley in the lead and several of the leading voice actors.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'No source names story arcs, so this quiz splits the franchise at the TV series tone shift in episode 16, then the two TV finale episodes, the 1997 film and the Rebuild films.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_episodes', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'The End of Evangelion reached Japanese cinemas on July 19, 1997; Gainax and Production I.G made it as a new take on the last two TV episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_End_of_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'Studio Khara reboots the story in four Rebuild of Evangelion films, the first shown on 1 September 2007 and the last on 8 March 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rebuild_of_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'Hideaki Anno began shaping the project in 1993, after a depression that followed his earlier work, with the idea of a hero who stops running away.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'Animage readers voted Evangelion their top Best Loved Series at the Anime Grand Prix in 1996, and again in 1997.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'Netflix brought the series to a global audience from June 21, 2019, but outside Japan the closing song Fly Me to the Moon is left out for licensing reasons.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'mari-illustrious-makinami', 'Mari is absent from the 1995 series and first shows up in the Rebuild film released in 2009, the second of four.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'rei-ayanami', 'Books with Rei on the cover sold so well that the press started calling her the Premium Girl.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'shinji-ikari', 'Shinji Ikari is a main character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'rei-ayanami', 'Rei Ayanami is a main character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'asuka-langley-soryu', 'Asuka Langley Soryu is a main character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'misato-katsuragi', 'Misato Katsuragi is a main character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'gendo-ikari', 'Gendo Ikari is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'ritsuko-akagi', 'Ritsuko Akagi is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'ryoji-kaji', 'Ryoji Kaji is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'kaworu-nagisa', 'Kaworu Nagisa is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'toji-suzuhara', 'Toji Suzuhara is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'kozo-fuyutsuki', 'Kozo Fuyutsuki is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'yui-ikari', 'Yui Ikari is a character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'mari-illustrious-makinami', 'Mari Illustrious Makinami is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'The alternate ending reached cinemas in steps: the Death & Rebirth preview came before The End of Evangelion, and Revival of Evangelion closed the sequence.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_episodes', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'In the TV series Sachiel carries the number 3 in the line of Angels.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angels_(Neon_Genesis_Evangelion)', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'In the TV series Shamshel carries the number 4 in the line of Angels.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angels_(Neon_Genesis_Evangelion)', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'In the TV series Ramiel carries the number 5 in the line of Angels.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angels_(Neon_Genesis_Evangelion)', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'In the TV series Gaghiel carries the number 6 in the line of Angels.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angels_(Neon_Genesis_Evangelion)', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'In the TV series Israfel carries the number 7 in the line of Angels.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angels_(Neon_Genesis_Evangelion)', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'In the TV series Sandalphon carries the number 8 in the line of Angels.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angels_(Neon_Genesis_Evangelion)', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'In the TV series Matarael carries the number 9 in the line of Angels.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angels_(Neon_Genesis_Evangelion)', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'In the TV series Sahaquiel carries the number 10 in the line of Angels.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angels_(Neon_Genesis_Evangelion)', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'In the TV series Ireul carries the number 11 in the line of Angels.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angels_(Neon_Genesis_Evangelion)', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'In the TV series Zeruel carries the number 14 in the line of Angels.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angels_(Neon_Genesis_Evangelion)', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'In the TV series Arael carries the number 15 in the line of Angels.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angels_(Neon_Genesis_Evangelion)', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'asuka-langley-soryu', 'Asuka Langley Soryu holds the pilot designation of Second Child.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'shinji-ikari', 'Shinji Ikari holds the pilot designation of Third Child.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'toji-suzuhara', 'Toji Suzuhara holds the pilot designation of Fourth Child.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'kaworu-nagisa', 'Kaworu Nagisa holds the pilot designation of Fifth Child.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'In episode 14 the director takes a closer look at Rei, the character he knew least well.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'Episode 16 is where the series swings from action toward inner struggles, and that tone stays for its second half.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_episodes', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'By episode 18 the show was a hit, and the rampage of Eva-01 drew complaints as unfit for a children''s audience.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_episodes', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'Readers of Animage ranked episode 24 first among single episodes, with episode 26 in second place.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_episodes', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'rei-ayanami', 'Rei Ayanami is voiced in Japanese by Megumi Hayashibara.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'ryoji-kaji', 'Ryoji Kaji is voiced in Japanese by Kōichi Yamadera.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'The first of the four Rebuild films, 1.0 You Are (Not) Alone, opened in Japanese cinemas on 1 September 2007.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rebuild_of_Evangelion', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The title is written in katakana as フェアリーテイル and read Fearī Teiru; the guild in the story is spelled 妖精の尻尾 in kanji, the tail of a fairy.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'Hiro Mashima both wrote and drew the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The manga appeared weekly in the magazine Weekly Shōnen Magazine, which belongs to the publisher Kodansha.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The weekly serialization started on August 2, 2006, and wrapped up on July 26, 2017.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'Its chapters were gathered into 63 tankōbon volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'A pilot one-shot named Fairy Tale, printed in Magazine Fresh, came years before the weekly series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'After finishing Rave Master, Mashima wanted his next manga to be full of fun, and drew on evenings of partying with friends in bars.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'Mashima swapped Tale for Tail in the title as a nod to a fairy''s tail, and hinted it might matter to the plot.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'TV Tokyo screened 175 episodes in the first season, which began on October 12, 2009, and ended on March 30, 2013.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_episodes', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'After a one year gap the series returned on April 5, 2014, and its 102 episodes ended on March 26, 2016.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_episodes', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The third and final season of the TV anime started on October 7, 2018, and finished on September 29, 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_episodes', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'Across all its seasons the TV anime adds up to 328 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'A-1 Pictures and Satelight animated the first TV series together.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_episodes', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'For the 2014 return Bridge took over from Satelight, and CloverWorks, once part of A-1 Pictures, joined for the final season.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'A-1 Pictures worked on all three seasons, Satelight only on the first, Bridge on the second and third, and CloverWorks only on the last.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'On Sirius Island Fairy Tail fights the dark guild Grimoire Heart, and the noise draws the black dragon Acnologia.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'Shinji Ishihira directed the TV anime and came back for the 2014 sequel series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'Yasuharu Takanashi composed and arranged the music of the anime, and four soundtrack CDs came out.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The first film, Phoenix Priestess, reached Japanese cinemas on August 18, 2012.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'A second film, Dragon Cry, premiered in Japan on May 6, 2017.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The sequel manga 100 Years Quest began on Magazine Pocket on July 25, 2018, with Mashima writing the storyboards and Atsuo Ueda drawing.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'Between July 2024 and January 2025 a follow-up anime named 100 Years Quest was broadcast.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'Mashima himself wrote a prequel, Fairy Tail Zero, which ran in a short-lived monthly magazine named after the series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'Mashima and Nakaba Suzuki, the creator of The Seven Deadly Sins, each drew a four-panel strip of the other''s series before a full crossover chapter.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The Japanese word behind wizard is madōshi, which sounds closer to a martial artist who follows a way, like judo, than to a Western wizard such as Merlin.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'Natsu travels the kingdom of Fiore looking for his missing adoptive father, the dragon Igneel.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'In the world of Earth-land, wizards join guilds that take paid job requests, and Fairy Tail is the guild the story follows.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The best known team of the guild starts with Natsu, Lucy and Happy and later adds Gray and Erza after shared missions.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'A Dragon Slayer is a wizard with a dragon like body and powers meant to fight dragons.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The guild ranks its strongest members as S-Class wizards, and Mashima says the S can stand for super or special.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'natsu-dragneel', 'Natsu''s motion sickness was borrowed from a friend of Mashima who feels ill whenever they ride in a taxi together.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'natsu-dragneel', 'Mashima named his hero with the Japanese word for summer because Western fantasy names seemed unfamiliar to Japanese readers.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'In 2008 Mashima wrote the script on Monday, sketched on Tuesday and inked from Wednesday to Friday, saving weekends for a monthly series named Monster Hunter Orage.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The Eisenwald Arc fills episodes 5 to 10 of the TV anime, and its ninth story arc, Edolas, ends with episode 95.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_episodes', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The last story arc, Alvarez, fills episodes 285 to 328, while the Tenrou Island Arc starts the second half at episode 96.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_episodes', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The first opening, Snow Fairy by Funkist, played for episodes 1 to 14, and the first thirteen openings end with Breakthrough.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'Opening 26, MORE THAN LiKE by BiSH, closed the run for episodes 316 to 328.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'The first ending, Kanpeki gu~no ne by Watarirouka Hashiritai, played for episodes 1 to 14.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'Ending 26, Exceed by Miyuna, rounded off the series for episodes 316 to 328.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'natsu-dragneel', 'Natsu is voiced by Tetsuya Kakihara in Japanese and by Todd Haberkorn in the English dub.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'lucy-heartfilia', 'Lucy is voiced by Aya Hirano in Japanese and by Cherami Leigh in the English dub.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'happy', 'Happy is voiced by Rie Kugimiya in Japanese and by Tia Ballard in the English dub.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'erza-scarlet', 'Erza is voiced by Sayaka Ohara in Japanese and by Colleen Clinkenbeard in the English dub.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'natsu-dragneel', 'Natsu Dragneel uses Fire Dragon Slayer Magic, which makes him immune to flames and lets him eat fire for energy.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'lucy-heartfilia', 'Lucy Heartfilia is a young celestial wizard who comes to Fairy Tail with dreams of joining the famous guild.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'happy', 'Happy is a blue cat who came from an egg that Natsu and Lisanna found, and he has been Natsu''s partner since the start.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'gray-fullbuster', 'Gray Fullbuster learned his ice magic from Ur and slips out of his clothes without noticing.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'erza-scarlet', 'Erza Scarlet got her surname from her childhood friend Jellal, who named her after the color of her hair.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'makarov-dreyar', 'Makarov Dreyar is the third master of Fairy Tail, and his name was chosen because Mashima wanted it to sound Russian.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'mirajane-strauss', 'Mirajane Strauss is the older sister of Lisanna and Elfman and works as the guild''s barmaid.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'elfman-strauss', 'Elfman Strauss is the brother of Mirajane and Lisanna, and his name was meant to sound somewhat cute.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'cana-alberona', 'Cana Alberona takes her name from the tarot word arcana and joined the guild at the age of six.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'levy-mcgarden', 'Levy McGarden bonds with Lucy over books and can translate ancient runic languages.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'loke', 'Loke is a nickname, and his name comes from the Norse god Loki.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'gajeel-redfox', 'Gajeel Redfox was the first Dragon Slayer besides Natsu to appear in the manga, created as a scary rival for Natsu.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'juvia-lockser', 'Juvia Lockser began in the Element 4, the elite quartet of the guild Phantom Lord.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'laxus-dreyar', 'Laxus Dreyar gets his name from lux, the unit that measures light.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'wendy-marvell', 'Wendy Marvell was raised by the dragon Grandeeney, and her name comes from the Japanese word for Wednesday.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'carla', 'Carla is a white Exceed who protects Wendy and inherited precognition from her mother.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'gildarts-clive', 'Gildarts Clive is the guild member whom everyone treats as the strongest, even though he is hardly ever there.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'mavis-vermillion', 'Mavis Vermillion is the first master of Fairy Tail, who first met Zeref at the age of thirteen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'zeref-dragneel', 'Zeref Dragneel is mentioned early in the series as the most evil wizard in history, the Black Wizard.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'acnologia', 'Acnologia is called the Dragon King for driving dragons close to extinction.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'natsu-dragneel', 'Across Fiore Natsu is known by the nickname Salamander.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'natsu-dragneel', 'Natsu is secretly the demon Etherious Natsu Dragneel, also called E.N.D., and the younger brother of Zeref.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'natsu-dragneel', 'Igneel sealed himself inside Natsu''s body, then was killed by Acnologia in front of Natsu.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'lucy-heartfilia', 'Lucy is a celestial wizard whose magical keys summon spirits, and the twelve golden keys are the zodiac spirits.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'lucy-heartfilia', 'Lucy dreams of being a writer and publishes her first novel, based on the guild, at the end of the series.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'happy', 'Happy can grow wings and fly with his Aera magic, and he is the only one Natsu can ride without feeling sick.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'happy', 'Happy turns out to be an Exceed from Edolas who was sent to Earth-land as an egg.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'gray-fullbuster', 'Gray''s Ice Make instantly forms ice into any weapon or object he pictures in his mind.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'gray-fullbuster', 'Gray strips without realizing it, a habit he picked up while training to endure the cold and which Mashima shares.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'erza-scarlet', 'Erza''s nickname Titania borrows the name of the fairy queen in Shakespeare''s A Midsummer Night''s Dream.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'erza-scarlet', 'Erza''s magic is called The Knight, which lets her requip, meaning swap, different armors and weapons at once.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'makarov-dreyar', 'Makarov is one of the Ten Wizard Saints, the ten wizards the Magic Council ranks highest in the land.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'makarov-dreyar', 'Makarov can enlarge his small body hugely with a magic called Giant.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'mirajane-strauss', 'Mirajane''s Satan Soul is a Takeover magic that lets her take on the forms of demons she has beaten.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'mirajane-strauss', 'Besides running the bar, Mirajane poses as a pin-up girl for the in-world magazine Weekly Sorcerer.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'elfman-strauss', 'Elfman''s Beast Soul magic takes over the strength of monsters, though he usually manages only his right arm.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'cana-alberona', 'Cana fights and tells fortunes with magic cards, and she drinks huge amounts of the guild''s alcohol.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'cana-alberona', 'Cana joined the guild to find her father, who turns out to be Gildarts.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'levy-mcgarden', 'Levy''s Solid Script turns written words into three dimensional objects with the traits of what is written.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'levy-mcgarden', 'Levy leads the three person team Shadow Gear with Jet and Droy.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'loke', 'Loke is really Leo, a celestial spirit of the zodiac, who lived in the human world after his owner died.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'loke', 'His finger ring Regulus can produce blinding or damaging light.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'gajeel-redfox', 'Gajeel can turn his limbs into iron weapons and eat iron objects for food with Iron Dragon Slayer Magic.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'gajeel-redfox', 'In Phantom Lord Gajeel was nicknamed Kurogane, written with characters for iron dragon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'juvia-lockser', 'Juvia''s water magic lets her turn her body into water, which makes physical attacks harmless.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'juvia-lockser', 'Juvia speaks about herself in the third person in the Japanese version.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'laxus-dreyar', 'Laxus uses Lightning Dragon Slayer Magic thanks to a lacrima crystal his father implanted in him as a child.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'laxus-dreyar', 'Laxus is the grandson of Makarov and the heir to the post of guild master.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'laxus-dreyar', 'Laxus has three personal followers named the Raijin Tribe, or Thunder Legion in the English dub.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'wendy-marvell', 'Wendy''s Sky Dragon Slayer Magic draws power from clean air and can heal injuries and ailments.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'wendy-marvell', 'Mashima made Wendy a twelve year old girl after a staff member said that young girls hardly appear in the series.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'carla', 'Carla is named Charles in Japanese, and the English name changed because readers would take Charles for a male name.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'gildarts-clive', 'Gildarts uses Crush to break any object or spell he touches into blocks.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'gildarts-clive', 'Magnolia''s streets rearrange into one narrow path to the guild so that Gildarts does not stumble into buildings.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'mavis-vermillion', 'Mavis was a prodigy nicknamed the Fairy Strategist, and she walks barefoot after a harsh master took her shoes.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'mavis-vermillion', 'The Three Great Fairy Magics, Fairy Law, Fairy Glitter and Fairy Sphere, can only be cast by members of her guild.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'mavis-vermillion', 'Mavis''s Fairy Sphere shielded the guild and left everyone inside suspended in time for seven years.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'mavis-vermillion', 'Mavis and Zeref were friends who fell in love, and when she accepted that love their shared curse ended both lives.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'zeref-dragneel', 'Cursed with immortality, Zeref wishes to die and has lived for four centuries.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'zeref-dragneel', 'Zeref is Natsu''s centuries-old elder brother.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'zeref-dragneel', 'Under the name Spriggan Zeref rules the Alvarez Empire, a military nation he built over a century.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'acnologia', 'Acnologia was once a human Dragon Slayer who became a black dragon as a side effect of his magic.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'acnologia', 'Acnologia killed Igneel, after losing an arm in their fight, and later took part in the war against the Alvarez Empire.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'acnologia', 'Natsu gathered the magic of the other Dragon Slayers and destroyed Acnologia''s spirit, which ended Acnologia.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'natsu-dragneel', 'Natsu''s Fire Dragon Slayer Magic comes from the dragon Igneel, who trained him.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'character', 'makarov-dreyar', 'Makarov uses Fairy Law against the Alvarez army and pays with his life, though Mavis later revives him.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fairy_Tail_characters', 'published'), ('fairy-tail', 'series', 'fairy-tail', 'In the finale Natsu and his team set out on a century old guild mission.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairy_Tail', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End is called 葬送のフリーレン, read Sōsō no Furīren, in Japan, which literally means Frieren at the Funeral.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'The manga has two creators: Kanehito Yamada writes it and Tsukasa Abe draws it.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Frieren began in Shogakukan''s Weekly Shōnen Sunday on 28 April 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Fifteen collected volumes were out by the end of 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'The manga went on an indefinite break in October 2025 so that its two creators could look after their health.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Madhouse made the first anime season, with Keiichirō Saitō directing, and it ran for 28 episodes from September 2023 to March 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Season two aired in early 2026 under a new director, Tomoya Kitagawa, bringing the total to 38 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'A third season was announced right after season two, to cover the Golden Land arc and premiere in October 2027.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Evan Call wrote the music for the anime.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'The anime has used three opening songs: Yoasobi and Yorushika in season one, Mrs. Green Apple in season two.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Milet sang every ending, including the one used only for the four-episode premiere broadcast.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Alongside the series came short episodes called Spell That Does OOO, eleven in the first batch.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'frieren', 'Frieren is an elf who is already more than a thousand years old.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'fern', 'Fern is a young mage who studies under Frieren after being raised by the priest Heiter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'qual', 'Qual invented Zoltraak, a spell that mages later studied until it became their standard attack.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'frieren', 'Frieren is a main character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'fern', 'Fern is a main character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'stark', 'Stark is a main character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('frieren', 'character', 'sein', 'Sein is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'himmel', 'Himmel is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'heiter', 'Heiter is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'eisen', 'Eisen is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'qual', 'Qual is an antagonist of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'aura', 'Aura is an antagonist of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'serie', 'Serie is a character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'denken', 'Denken is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'ubel', 'Übel is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'land', 'Land is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'methode', 'Methode is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'kanne', 'Kanne is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'lawine', 'Lawine is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'wirbel', 'Wirbel is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'revolte', 'Revolte is an antagonist of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'hero-of-the-south', 'Hero of the South is a character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'macht', 'Macht is an antagonist of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'himmel', 'Himmel was the leader and hero of the old party that beat the Demon King.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'heiter', 'Heiter, a priest with a fondness for drink, took part in the old Hero Party.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'eisen', 'Eisen, a dwarf, was the third veteran of the Hero Party alongside Himmel and Heiter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'stark', 'Stark fights with weapons at the front line instead of using spells; the dwarf Eisen brought him up.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'fern', 'Fern is a gifted young spellcaster, taught by Frieren.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'frieren', 'Frieren is a mage of the elf race, and a former companion of the old Hero Party.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'serie', 'Serie is a very old elf who works with magic and founded the Continental Magic Association.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'aura', 'Aura is a demon and one of the Seven Sages of Destruction, an old enemy of the Hero Party.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Lügner is a demon who acts as a peace envoy while taking his orders from Aura.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Linie is a demon, an assistant of Lügner, who reads her foe''s mana and turns it against them.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Draht is another helper of Lügner and goes after Frieren while she is locked up.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'revolte', 'Revolte is a demon general with four arms, the lower body of a snake and four magic swords.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'land', 'Land is a careful mage who is on a team with Fern in the exam and uses clones.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Genau is a first-class mage who runs the opening stage of the exam instead of taking it.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Edel is a hypnosis mage of the second class who joins the exam as a candidate.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'kanne', 'Kanne is a shy water mage ranked only third-class, and a teammate of Frieren in the exam.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Richter, who repairs staves in his own shop, is a second-class mage in the same exam team as Denken.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Laufen is fast on her feet thanks to movement magic, and she is in Denken''s group.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'methode', 'Methode, who also uses binding spells and healing, joined forces with Denken in the second stage.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'The Demon King led demons, and his strongest commanders were a group of seven, each ruling a region.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'ubel', 'Übel takes the exam as a candidate and uses a cleaving spell; Serie later promotes her.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'wirbel', 'Wirbel, who captains the Northern Magic Corps, sits the exam as a candidate to reach the top class.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Scharf is a second-class mage on Wirbel''s team who can turn flower petals into blades.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Ehre, granddaughter of Lernen, is a second-class mage on Wirbel''s team who commands stone.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'The demon Qual was so strong that the old Hero Party could not defeat him and sealed him away instead.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'The Japanese title is written in katakana as フルーツバスケット, which simply spells out the English words fruits basket.', 'fun', 'official', 'https://fruba.jp/onair/', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Natsuki Takaya both wrote and drew the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'The manga ran in Hakusensha''s twice-monthly shojo magazine Hana to Yume.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Hakusensha is the Japanese publisher of the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'The manga was serialized from July 1998 until November 2006, a run of more than eight years.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'The finished manga was collected in 23 tankobon volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Over its whole run the manga produced 136 chapters.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'In 2001 the manga won the Kodansha Manga Award in the shojo category.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Thirteen members of the Sohma family are possessed by animals of the Chinese zodiac, and they turn into those animals when weak or stressed, or when hugged by someone of the opposite sex.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'The title comes from a children''s game, Fruit Basket Turnover, in which young Tohru is given the part of an onigiri rice ball instead of a fruit.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'The first anime, in 2001, was made by Studio Deen and directed by Akitaro Daichi.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2001_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'The 2001 anime ran for 26 episodes on TV Tokyo, from July 5 to December 27, 2001.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2001_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'In 2005 fans folded origami cranes at conventions in a campaign that urged the studio and publisher to make more of the anime.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'A brand new anime, with an all-new cast and staff, was announced in November 2018.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'TMS Entertainment animated the 2019 remake, in a co-production with Funimation.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Yoshihide Ibata directed the 2019 anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Taku Kishimoto handled the series composition of the 2019 anime and Masaru Shindo designed its characters.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Masaru Yokoyama wrote the music of the 2019 anime.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'The first season of the remake has 25 episodes, aired from April to September 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'The second season of the remake has 25 episodes, aired from April to September 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'The third and last season is titled The Final, has 13 episodes and aired from April to June 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Altogether the 2019 remake runs to 63 episodes across 3 seasons.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Season 1 covers episodes 1 to 25, Season 2 covers episodes 26 to 50 and The Final covers episodes 51 to 63.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Season 1 opens first with Again by Beverly and then with Chime by Ai Otsuka, and ends with Lucky Ending and then One Step Closer.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Season 2 opens with Prism and then Home, and its endings are ad meliora and then Eden.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'The final season uses Pleasure by WARPs UP as its opening and Haru Urara by GENIC as its ending.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'A compilation film, Fruits Basket: Prelude, reached Japanese cinemas on February 18, 2022, recapping the remake and adding a prequel story about Tohru''s parents Kyoko and Katsuya.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket:_Prelude', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Fruits Basket Another is a sequel manga that follows a younger generation of the Sohma family.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_Another', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'Tokyopop first published the manga in English, and Yen Press later issued collector''s editions.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'tohru-honda', 'Tohru Honda is an orphaned high school student who ends up living with the Sohma cousins in return for doing housework.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'tohru-honda', 'In the childhood game that gives the series its name, Tohru is assigned the part of the rice ball.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'tohru-honda', 'Manaka Iwami', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'yuki-sohma', 'Yuki Sohma is the Rat of the zodiac and the younger brother of Ayame.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'yuki-sohma', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'kyo-sohma', 'Kyo Sohma is cursed by the cat, which is an animal outside the Chinese zodiac.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'kyo-sohma', 'Legend says the cat would have joined the zodiac if the Rat had not tricked it into missing the induction feast.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'kyo-sohma', 'After his mother died and his father rejected him, Kyo was raised by the martial arts teacher Kazuma Sohma.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'kyo-sohma', 'Yuma Uchida', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'kyo-sohma', 'Natsuki Takaya said in an author''s note that Kyo was the driving force that pulled the story along.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'shigure-sohma', 'Shigure Sohma is the Dog of the zodiac and owns the house where Tohru, Yuki and Kyo live.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'shigure-sohma', 'His name comes from shigurezuki, the autumn showers month, which is the tenth month and the month of the Dog.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'shigure-sohma', 'Yuichi Nakamura', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'akito-sohma', 'Akito Sohma is the frail head of the Sohma family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'akito-sohma', 'Akito calls herself the god of the zodiac, the one who controls it and the master of the cursed members'' souls.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'akito-sohma', 'In the manga and the 2019 anime, Akito turns out to be female although she lives as a man for most of the story.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'akito-sohma', 'Maaya Sakamoto voices Akito in the 2019 anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'akito-sohma', 'Only the four oldest zodiac members, Kureno, Shigure, Hatori and Ayame, knew Akito''s biological sex besides Akito.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'ayame-sohma', 'Ayame Sohma is the Snake of the zodiac and Yuki''s older brother, a flamboyant man with long silver hair.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'ayame-sohma', 'Takahiro Sakurai', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'hatori-sohma', 'Hatori Sohma is the Dragon of the zodiac, and in animal form he is a seahorse.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'hatori-sohma', 'He is the family doctor and uses a form of hypnosis passed down in his line to erase the memories of outsiders who learn the secret.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'hatori-sohma', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'hatsuharu-sohma', 'Hatsuharu Sohma, nicknamed Haru, carries the curse of the Ox.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'hatsuharu-sohma', 'Makoto Furukawa', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'momiji-sohma', 'Momiji Sohma is the Rabbit of the zodiac.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'momiji-sohma', 'Momiji''s father is a wealthy Japanese member of the Sohma family and his mother is German.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'momiji-sohma', 'Megumi Han', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'kagura-sohma', 'Kagura Sohma is the Boar of the zodiac.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'kagura-sohma', 'Rie Kugimiya', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'kisa-sohma', 'Kisa Sohma is the Tiger of the zodiac.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'kisa-sohma', 'Reina Ueda', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'hiro-sohma', 'Hiro Sohma is the Ram, or Sheep, of the zodiac, and he cares deeply about Kisa.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'hiro-sohma', 'Yō Taichi', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'ritsu-sohma', 'Ritsu Sohma is the Monkey of the zodiac.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'ritsu-sohma', 'Shigure enjoys playing on Ritsu''s insecurity and gullibility, just as he does with his editor Mitsuru.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'ritsu-sohma', 'Kengo Kawanishi', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'isuzu-sohma', 'Isuzu Sohma, called Rin, is the Horse of the zodiac.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'isuzu-sohma', 'Aki Toyosaki', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'arisa-uotani', 'Arisa Uotani used to run with a gang and is now among Tohru''s dearest friends.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'arisa-uotani', 'Atsumi Tanezaki', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'saki-hanajima', 'Saki Hanajima is a psychic girl who can sense people''s waves, and one of Tohru''s best friends.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'saki-hanajima', 'Satomi Satō', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'kyoko-honda', 'Kyoko Honda is the late mother of Tohru Honda, who was born with the family name Katsunuma.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'katsuya-honda', 'Katsuya Honda is Tohru''s late father and the husband of Kyoko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'kazuma-sohma', 'Kazuma Sohma is the man who took Kyo in as a boy after his father turned him away.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'character', 'machi-kuragi', 'Machi Kuragi is a student council treasurer with a painful childhood, and Yuki becomes drawn to her.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters', 'published'), ('fruits-basket', 'series', 'fruits-basket', 'The 2019 remake was split into three seasons, the last of which is titled The Final.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'The Japanese title is 鋼の錬金術師, read Hagane no Renkinjutsushi, which can be rendered as Alchemist of Steel.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Hiromu Arakawa wrote and drew the Fullmetal Alchemist manga all by herself.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Square Enix published the manga in its Monthly Shōnen Gangan magazine, from July 2001 until June 2010.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'The finished story fills 27 collected volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'In January 2004 the manga won the 49th Shogakukan Manga Award.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Studio Bones produced the first TV anime. Its 51 episodes were broadcast on the MBS and TBS networks, starting in October 2003 and finishing a year later.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Seiji Mizushima directed the 2003 anime, Shō Aikawa wrote it and Michiru Ōshima composed the score.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Arakawa asked for an original ending, so the first anime left the manga plot after roughly a dozen episodes and told its own story.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'The second anime, Brotherhood, was shown on MBS and TBS from spring 2009 to summer 2010 and adapts the whole manga story in 64 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist:_Brotherhood', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Yasuhiro Irie directed Brotherhood, Hiroshi Ōnogi wrote it and Akira Senju composed the music, all at Bones.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist:_Brotherhood', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Two directors shaped the anime: Seiji Mizushima for the 2003 series and Yasuhiro Irie for Brotherhood.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist:_Brotherhood', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'The 2003 anime used four opening and four ending songs, swapping them roughly every dozen episodes.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_episodes', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Brotherhood went through five openings and five endings, and Sid sang both the first ending and the last opening.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist:_Brotherhood_episodes', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'The story comes in two anime adaptations of 51 and 64 episodes, 115 episodes between them, and questions name which one they mean.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'dante', 'Dante exists only in the 2003 anime, where she is the main villain and an old flame of Hohenheim.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'The song Brothers, sung in Russian, became the 2003 anime''s signature piece and was never reused in Brotherhood.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'lin-yao', 'The prince of Xing is Lin Yao in the Japanese manga, but the 2009 anime and Viz''s earliest English volumes write his name as Ling Yao.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'edward-elric', 'Edward Elric is a main character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'alphonse-elric', 'Alphonse Elric is a main character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'roy-mustang', 'Roy Mustang is a supporting character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'winry-rockbell', 'Winry Rockbell is a supporting character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'riza-hawkeye', 'Riza Hawkeye is a supporting character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'alex-louis-armstrong', 'Alex Louis Armstrong is a supporting character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'maes-hughes', 'Maes Hughes is a supporting character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'izumi-curtis', 'Izumi Curtis is a supporting character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'van-hohenheim', 'Van Hohenheim is a supporting character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'scar', 'Scar is a supporting character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'lin-yao', 'Lin Yao is a supporting character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'may-chang', 'May Chang is a supporting character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'olivier-mira-armstrong', 'Olivier Mira Armstrong is a supporting character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'envy', 'Envy is an antagonist of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'greed', 'Greed is an antagonist of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'king-bradley', 'King Bradley is a supporting character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'father', 'Father is an antagonist of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'dante', 'Dante is an antagonist of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'shou-tucker', 'Shou Tucker is an antagonist of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'truth', 'Truth is a character of Fullmetal Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Lust is the shapely homunculus who serves as the assassin of her kin and can stretch her fingers into blades.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Gluttony is a slow-witted homunculus with a huge appetite, and he is nearly always found at the side of Lust.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Sloth is a hulking homunculus who finds everything pointless, yet he is the quickest of his kind.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Every homunculus carries the name of a deadly sin and is recognisable by an Ouroboros tattoo somewhere on the body.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Solf J. Kimblee is a human alchemist, the Crimson Alchemist, who won his fame in the Ishbalan Civil War by turning objects into bombs.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'riza-hawkeye', 'Riza Hawkeye adopted a pet dog called Black Hayate and trains him strictly.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Xiao Mei is the little panda that travels with May Chang.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Alexander is the Tucker family''s big pet dog, a Pyrenean Mountain Dog who loves to tackle Edward.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Maria Ross is a second lieutenant of the military who, with Denny Brosh, is first sent to look after Edward.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'edward-elric', 'Edward became the youngest State Alchemist ever, signing up at twelve years of age.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'roy-mustang', 'Roy Mustang, the Flame Alchemist, is a State Alchemist and the superior officer of Edward.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'alex-louis-armstrong', 'Alex Louis Armstrong is the weepy, muscle-flexing State Alchemist called the Strong Arm Alchemist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'maes-hughes', 'Maes Hughes works in military intelligence and is a doting father who phones everyone to boast about his daughter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'lin-yao', 'Lin Yao is the twelfth prince of the faraway country of Xing.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'may-chang', 'May Chang is a princess of Xing, number seventeen among the emperor''s children.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Lan Fan is a fierce warrior who guards Lin Yao, the prince from Xing, together with her grandfather.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'scar', 'Scar belongs to the Ishbalan people and is one of the few survivors of the campaign that wiped most of them out.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Jean Havoc, the cigarette smoker, is one of the soldiers Mustang trusts the most.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Heymans Breda is a Mustang loyalist who is clever at chess and afraid of dogs.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Vato Falman is a very formal member of the Mustang squad who recalls almost every detail he has seen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Denny Brosh is a sergeant who was posted as a bodyguard for Edward, not a member of the Mustang squad.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Most of the journey of the brothers takes place in the country of Amestris.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Xing lies far away from Amestris and is a whole country, split between fifty clans under one emperor.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Drachma is the neighbouring country that the fortress of Briggs was built to keep at bay.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Resembool is only a small town in the east of Amestris, where the Rockbell family runs its automail workshop.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'alphonse-elric', 'Alphonse lost his whole body, and his soul lives on inside a big suit of armor.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Barry the Chopper is a murderer whose soul the military bound to a suit of armor to make him a guard.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'The Slicer Brothers are two killers who guard the 5th Laboratory with both souls tied to the same suit of armor.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Tim Marcoh is a former military alchemist who led the research into Philosopher''s Stones and later used imperfect stones to heal people.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'edward-elric', 'Edward wears automail prosthetics in place of his right arm and left leg.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Lan Fan lost an arm shielding her prince and got an automail arm after surgery.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Buccaneer, a burly soldier under Olivier, is shown with two different pieces of automail.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'character', 'winry-rockbell', 'Winry builds and services automail for a living and keeps Edward''s limbs in shape.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Studio Bones animated both TV series and both theatrical films, the second of which is The Sacred Star of Milos.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Conqueror of Shamballa is an animated film that wraps up the story of the 2003 series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'The Sacred Star of Milos tells a new tale set in the time of Brotherhood.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'The Revenge of Scar is one of two live-action sequels to the 2017 film, released in 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fullmetal_Alchemist', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Rosé Thomas, the devoted believer of the Church of Leto, shows up at the very beginning of the manga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Pinako Rockbell is a surgeon and automail engineer and the person who looks after the Elric boys.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Sheska is a bookworm of a librarian who can recite everything she has read.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('fullmetal-alchemist', 'series', 'fullmetal-alchemist', 'Russell and his brother Fletcher Tringham started life in a light novel and entered the story only through the 2003 anime, never the manga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fullmetal_Alchemist_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The Japanese title 銀魂 is read Gintama and means silver soul, a nod to the hero''s silver hair and his stubborn spirit.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'Hideaki Sorachi created, wrote and drew the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The manga was serialized in Shueisha''s Weekly Shōnen Jump, and it later ended its run in Jump Giga and an app.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'Shueisha published the manga in Japan under its Jump Comics label.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The manga ran from December 2003 to June 2019, moving from Weekly Shōnen Jump to Jump Giga and finally an app.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The finished manga was collected in 77 tankobon volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The story is set in an alternate late Edo period that aliens called Amanto, meaning sky people, have invaded and taken over.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'After the shogun surrendered to the aliens, a sword ban took away the weapons of the samurai.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'Gintoki runs an odd-jobs shop called Yorozuya, which means store of ten thousand businesses, with Shinpachi and Kagura.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'Before it was shortened to Gintama, the series was originally titled Yorozuya Gin-san.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'Sorachi describes his own work with a long label: science fiction human drama pseudo-historical comedy.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'A recurring joke has Gintoki frantically hunting for the new issue of Weekly Shōnen Jump, and the series often breaks the fourth wall.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'TV Tokyo broadcast 201 episodes of the original anime between April 4, 2006 and March 25, 2010.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The second series, titled Gintama'', has 51 episodes and aired from April 4, 2011, to March 26, 2012.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The short follow-up Gintama'': Enchōsen added 13 episodes between October 4, 2012 and March 28, 2013.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'Gintama° brought the show back with 51 episodes, airing from April 8, 2015, to March 30, 2016.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The fourth series, Gintama., opened with 12 episodes between January 9 and March 27, 2017.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The Porori-hen part of Gintama. has 13 episodes and aired from October 2 to December 25, 2017.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The second half of the Silver Soul Arc had 14 episodes, airing from July to October 2018.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The first half of the Silver Soul Arc had 12 episodes, aired between January 8 and March 26, 2018.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'Adding up all the TV series, Gintama reaches 367 episodes in total.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'Sunrise animated the first two series, and Bandai Namco Pictures took over starting with Gintama°.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'Shinji Takamatsu directed the first 99 episodes, Yōichi Fujita took over after that, and Chizuru Miyawaki directed from Gintama° on.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'Akatsuki Yamatoya wrote for every TV season and the band Audio Highs composed the music of every series.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The original 201 episode series used twelve openings, beginning with Pray by Tommy Heavenly6 and ending with Katoniago by FLiP.', 'music', 'press', 'https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/encyclopedia/anime.php?id=6236', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The first series closed its episodes with twenty different ending songs, starting with Fuusen Gamu by Captain Stridum.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'Gintama'' had three openings and four endings, among them Samurai Heart by SPYAIR.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The TV story runs through eight blocks, from the 201 episode first series to the Silver Soul Arc, and a final film closes it.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The first film, Gintama: The Movie, retells the Benizakura arc and opened on April 4, 2010.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'The second film, Be Forever Yorozuya, has a script written by Sorachi himself and opened on July 6, 2013.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'Gintama: The Very Final opened on January 8, 2021, and adapts the finale of the manga with new story elements.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama:_The_Very_Final', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'A live-action film premiered in 2017 with Shun Oguri playing Gintoki, Kanna Hashimoto as Kagura and Masaki Suda as Shinpachi.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'series', 'gintama', 'A school comedy light novel series, Class 3-Z''s Teacher Ginpachi, was written by Tomohito Ōsaki and illustrated by Sorachi.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'gintoki-sakata', 'Gintoki Sakata is an eccentric samurai with a sweet tooth, and the owner of the Yorozuya.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'gintoki-sakata', 'Gintoki has naturally wavy hair, and in the war against the aliens his silver hair and fighting skill earned him a fearsome nickname.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'gintoki-sakata', 'Tomokazu Sugita voices Gintoki in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'shinpachi-shimura', 'Shinpachi Shimura is the teenager of the Yorozuya who stays at his family dojo and often plays the straight man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'shinpachi-shimura', 'Daisuke Sakaguchi voices Shinpachi in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'kagura', 'Kagura is an alien girl of the Yato clan who has enormous strength and joins the Yorozuya.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'kagura', 'Kagura''s strength is extraordinary, but her pale skin is sensitive to sunlight.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'kagura', 'Rie Kugimiya voices Kagura in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'sadaharu', 'Sadaharu is an inugami pet that Kagura picks up after his owners abandon him.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'sadaharu', 'Mikako Takahashi voices Sadaharu in Japanese.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'elizabeth', 'Elizabeth is Katsura''s pet, a giant white creature like a duck or a penguin.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'elizabeth', 'Elizabeth never speaks and communicates by holding up signboards.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'kotaro-katsura', 'Kotaro Katsura is Gintoki''s old comrade from the war who keeps leading an anti-Amanto resistance.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'kotaro-katsura', 'He is often called Zura, a word for wig, and he insists that his name is Katsura.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'kotaro-katsura', 'Akira Ishida voices Katsura in Japanese, together with Yuki Kaida in some episodes.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'tatsuma-sakamoto', 'Tatsuma Sakamoto is an ex-member of the Joi forces who became a merchant leading the Kaientai fleet.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'tatsuma-sakamoto', 'His name comes from the historical figure Sakamoto Ryoma.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'isao-kondo', 'Isao Kondo is the good-natured and honorable commander of the Shinsengumi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'toshiro-hijikata', 'Toshiro Hijikata is the chain-smoking vice commander of the Shinsengumi, known as the Demon Vice-Chief.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'toshiro-hijikata', 'Kazuya Nakai voices Hijikata in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'sogo-okita', 'Sougo Okita is the best swordsman of the Shinsengumi, who still likes to fire a bazooka.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'sogo-okita', 'Kenichi Suzumura voices Sougo in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'sagaru-yamazaki', 'Sagaru Yamazaki is a Shinsengumi spy who is often caught playing badminton and grows fond of anpan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'katakuriko-matsudaira', 'Katakuriko Matsudaira is the violent head of the police, and he wears sunglasses while distrusting everyone who wears them.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'otose', 'Otose is Gintoki''s landlady, who owns a snack shop and gets little rent from him.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'otose', 'Otose''s real name is Ayano Terada, and she is called the Empress, one of the four emperors of the Kabuki District.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'catherine', 'Catherine is a cat-like Amanto who works at Otose''s snack shop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'tae-shimura', 'Tae Shimura is Shinpachi''s older sister, who runs the family dojo and cannot cook.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'taizo-hasegawa', 'Taizo Hasegawa, nicknamed Madao, is a former official who lives as a loser but never takes off his sunglasses.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'tama', 'Tama is an android, codenamed Fuyo Unit Zero, and Kagura is the one who named her.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'ayame-sarutobi', 'Ayame Sarutobi, nicknamed Sa-chan, is a kunoichi who loves being treated badly.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'tsukuyo', 'Tsukuyo is the scarred leader of the Hyakka, the female assassin group of the Yoshiwara district.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'kamui', 'Kamui is Kagura''s older brother, a cheerful but bloodthirsty fighter who leads the 7th Division of the Harusame pirates.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'umibozu', 'Umibozu is Kagura''s father and the strongest alien hunter in the universe.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'umibozu', 'Umibozu''s mechanical arm replaces the one his own son Kamui took from him in a fight.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'kyubei-yagyu', 'Kyubei Yagyu is an aristocratic young woman raised as a man who lost her left eye protecting Tae.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'shinsuke-takasugi', 'Shinsuke Takasugi is Gintoki''s old comrade turned major enemy, who leads the Kiheitai.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'shinsuke-takasugi', 'He is easy to spot by his bandaged left eye, his colorful kimono and his eerie smile.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'shinsuke-takasugi', 'Takehito Koyasu voices Takasugi in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'utsuro', 'Utsuro is the true main antagonist and the founder of Tenshouin Naraku.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'utsuro', 'Utsuro was once known as Shoyo Yoshida, and the name is based on the real historical figure Yoshida Shoin.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'shoyo-yoshida', 'Shoyo Yoshida is the teacher who taught Gintoki, Katsura and Takasugi the ways of the samurai.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'oboro', 'Oboro leads Tenshouin Naraku in the absence of Utsuro and is the strongest of its Three Wings.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'gintoki-sakata', 'Gintoki loves sweets so much that the first brawl of the story starts when Amanto officials spill his parfait.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('gintama', 'character', 'kagura', 'Kagura has an enormous appetite and can put away a huge amount of food in a few seconds, though her tastes are plain.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Gintama_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The Japanese title ハイキュー!!, read Haikyū!!, comes from the kanji 排球, an old word for volleyball.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'Haruichi Furudate is the single creator behind Haikyu!!, handling both the story and the drawings.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'Weekly Shōnen Jump magazine carried the manga from February 2012 until July 2020, published by Shueisha.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The collected edition of the manga has 45 volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The manga reached television in spring 2014 through Production I.G, whose first season has 25 episodes and wrapped up in September.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'In all, the TV anime has 85 episodes over four seasons, with seven opening songs and seven ending songs.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_episodes', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'Season three, titled Karasuno High School vs Shiratorizawa Academy, is a short run of 10 episodes shown in autumn 2016.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The fourth season, To The Top, began on January 11, 2020; its second cour slipped to October because of the COVID-19 pandemic and ended on December 19, 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The finale is split into two Haikyu!! Final films: The Dumpster Battle came out on February 16, 2024, and vs. The Little Giant is set for 2027.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The first two seasons each switched songs halfway through, so every season has two openings and two endings.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'Season three kept one pair of songs, while the split-cour fourth season had two pairs.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The TV anime runs four seasons of 25, 25, 10 and 25 episodes, and the story ends in the Haikyu!! Final films.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_episodes', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'shoyo-hinata', 'Hinata''s dream starts when he sees a small ace called the Little Giant lead Karasuno on TV, which is why he joins that school.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'shoyo-hinata', 'Hinata won Best Boy at the fifth Crunchyroll Anime Awards and was also up for Best Protagonist.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The first of four OVA episodes, about the arrival of Lev Haiba, was shown at Jump Festa on November 9, 2014.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'shoyo-hinata', 'Shoyo Hinata is a main character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'tobio-kageyama', 'Tobio Kageyama is a main character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'kei-tsukishima', 'Kei Tsukishima is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'tadashi-yamaguchi', 'Tadashi Yamaguchi is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'daichi-sawamura', 'Daichi Sawamura is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'koshi-sugawara', 'Kōshi Sugawara is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'asahi-azumane', 'Asahi Azumane is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'yu-nishinoya', 'Yū Nishinoya is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'ryunosuke-tanaka', 'Ryūnosuke Tanaka is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'hitoka-yachi', 'Hitoka Yachi is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('haikyu', 'character', 'toru-oikawa', 'Tōru Oikawa is an antagonist of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'kenma-kozume', 'Kenma Kozume is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'tetsuro-kuroo', 'Tetsurō Kuroo is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'kotaro-bokuto', 'Kōtarō Bokuto is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'keiji-akaashi', 'Keiji Akaashi is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'wakatoshi-ushijima', 'Wakatoshi Ushijima is an antagonist of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'satori-tendo', 'Satori Tendō is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'atsumu-miya', 'Atsumu Miya is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'kiyoomi-sakusa', 'Kiyoomi Sakusa is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'korai-hoshiumi', 'Kōrai Hoshiumi is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'Hinata is the sole member of his junior high volleyball club, and it takes him two years to find classmates willing to practise with him.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'Tobio Kageyama is a setter prodigy whom people call the King of the Court because of his talent and his harsh way of playing.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'The Japanese title is written ハンター×ハンター and read Hantā Hantā, with a multiplication sign between the two words.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'Yoshihiro Togashi is the creator of the Hunter × Hunter manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'The manga has appeared in Shueisha''s Weekly Shōnen Jump since the spring of 1998, starting on 3 March.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'The collected edition stood at 39 volumes as of July 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'The longest break in the manga ended on 24 October 2022, after nearly four years without new chapters.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'An earlier anime aired on Fuji TV from October 1999 to March 2001 and had 62 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'The second anime, made by Madhouse for Nippon TV, ran from October 2011 to September 2014 and counts 148 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'The 2011 anime restarts the story from the first chapter and has no link to the 1999 series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_(2011_TV_series)', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'The Dark Continent storyline exists only in the manga so far, since the 2011 anime stops before it.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'The 2011 anime alternates between two versions of one opening, Departure! and Departure! -Second Version-, both sung by Masatoshi Ono.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_(2011_TV_series)', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'Five endings were used: Just Awake, Hunting for Your Dream, Reason, Nagareboshi Kirari and Hyōri Ittai, the last three all sung by the duo Yuzu.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_(2011_TV_series)', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'Two animated theatrical films reached cinemas in 2013, Phantom Rouge and The Last Mission.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'kurapika', 'Kurapika belongs to the Kurta Clan, whose members have prized irises that glow scarlet when they are furious.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'meruem', 'Meruem is the Chimera Ant King, the strongest of the Queen''s children.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'gon-freecss', 'Gon Freecss is a main character of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'killua-zoldyck', 'Killua Zoldyck is a main character of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'kurapika', 'Kurapika is a main character of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'leorio-paradinight', 'Leorio Paradinight is a main character of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'hisoka-morrow', 'Hisoka Morrow is an antagonist of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'illumi-zoldyck', 'Illumi Zoldyck is an antagonist of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'isaac-netero', 'Isaac Netero is a supporting character of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'ging-freecss', 'Ging Freecss is a supporting character of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'silva-zoldyck', 'Silva Zoldyck is a supporting character of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'kite', 'Kite is a supporting character of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'chrollo-lucilfer', 'Chrollo Lucilfer is an antagonist of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'feitan-portor', 'Feitan Portor is an antagonist of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'machi-komacine', 'Machi Komacine is an antagonist of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'uvogin', 'Uvogin is an antagonist of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'biscuit-krueger', 'Biscuit Krueger is a supporting character of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'meruem', 'Meruem is an antagonist of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'neferpitou', 'Neferpitou is an antagonist of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'komugi', 'Komugi is a supporting character of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'pariston-hill', 'Pariston Hill is an antagonist of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'character', 'alluka-zoldyck', 'Alluka Zoldyck is a supporting character of Hunter × Hunter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_characters', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'A short animated film from Studio Pierrot played at a Jump anime tour, ahead of the first TV series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_×_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'Phantom Rouge was the first of the two theatrical films, and The Last Mission was announced only once it had opened.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_×_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'The story begins when Gon leaves his island home to sit the Hunter Exam, the first arc.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_×_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'After the exam, Gon and Killua go to the towering Heavens Arena and learn Nen from the master Wing.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_×_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'Once Heavens Arena is behind them, the friends gather again in Yorknew City to face the Phantom Troupe.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_×_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'In Yorknew City Kurapika defeats two Troupe members and locks away the Nen of their boss Chrollo.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_×_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'After Yorknew City, Gon and Killua enter the game Greed Island, which Ging built, hoping to find hints about him.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_×_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'When Greed Island is finished, the boys find Kite, who is studying a Chimera Ant queen that eats people.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_×_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'The offspring of the Chimera Ant queen learn Nen and topple a nearby state called East Gorteau.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_×_Hunter', 'published'), ('hunter-x-hunter', 'series', 'hunter-x-hunter', 'In the Election arc, once the Chimera Ant crisis is over, the Zodiacs of the Hunter Association look for someone to lead them.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_×_Hunter', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The Japanese title 犬夜叉 means dog yaksha, a name that points to the half dog demon hero.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Rumiko Takahashi wrote and drew Inuyasha on her own.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The manga ran in Weekly Shōnen Sunday for its whole serialization.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Shogakukan published the collected volumes in Japan under its Shōnen Sunday Comics label.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The first chapter appeared in Weekly Shōnen Sunday on November 13, 1996.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The weekly run ended on June 18, 2008, after eleven years and seven months.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The manga fills 56 collected volumes, released between April 1997 and February 2009.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The story is told in 558 chapters.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'A 30 volume wide-ban edition was published between January 2013 and June 2015.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'On February 6, 2013 Takahashi published an epilogue chapter called Since Then, in a charity anthology for areas hit by the 2011 Tōhoku earthquake and tsunami.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Takahashi began Inuyasha after finishing her previous manga, Ranma ½.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Unlike her earlier comedies, Takahashi wanted a darker story, closer to her Mermaid Saga tales.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The story is set in the Sengoku period, an age of frequent wars, so that violence could be shown in a softer way.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'By June 2001 Takahashi had no clear ending, because she was still unsure how to end the relationship between the two leads.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The series draws some motifs from Nansō Satomi Hakkenden, a novel of the 19th century.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'A modern schoolgirl falls into an old well in her family shrine and lands in the Sengoku period, where she meets a half dog demon.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'After Kagome breaks the Shikon Jewel, which is said to grant any wish, the pieces fly all over Japan and the heroes set out to gather them.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'At the end Kagome wishes that the Shikon Jewel vanish forever, and three years later she comes back through the well and marries Inuyasha.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The manga took the Shogakukan Manga Award, 47th edition, for shonen manga in 2002.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The manga was a Jury Recommended Work at the Japan Media Arts Festival in 2001 and again in 2008.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'In the TV Asahi poll Manga Sōsenkyo 2021, where 150,000 people picked their top 100, Inuyasha ranked 28th.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'As of September 2020, circulation of the manga was above 50 million copies.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Circulation stood at more than 45 million copies in February 2010.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Viz Media began its English edition in April 1997, first as comic book issues, and it released the 56th and last volume on January 11, 2011.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Sunrise produced the first anime series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The first anime series began on October 16, 2000.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The first anime series ended on September 13, 2004.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The first series has 167 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Masashi Ikeda directed the first 44 episodes, and Yasunao Aoki directed the rest.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Kaoru Wada composed the music of the first anime series.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Katsuyuki Sumisawa developed the anime and wrote its films, and Yoshihito Hishinuma designed the characters.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The first season has 44 episodes and aired from October 16, 2000 to September 17, 2001.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_episodes', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The second season has 43 episodes and aired from October 8, 2001 to September 16, 2002.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_episodes', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The third season has 40 episodes and aired from October 14, 2002 to September 15, 2003.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_episodes', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The fourth season has 40 episodes and aired from October 13, 2003 to September 13, 2004.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_episodes', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'In July 2009 a sequel TV series was announced, made by the same cast and crew, to cover the last volumes of the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The Final Act has 26 episodes and aired from October 4, 2009 to March 30, 2010, adapting the rest of the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Six openings were used in turn, from Change the World by V6 to Angelus by Hitomi Shimatani.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Eight endings were used, from My Will by Dream to Brand-New World by V6, with Ayumi Hamasaki, BoA and Namie Amuro in between.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The Final Act used one opening, Kimi ga Inai Mirai by Do As Infinity, and three endings by AAA, Alan and Ai Takekawa.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha:_The_Final_Act', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The first film, Affections Touching Across Time, came out in 2001 and pits the heroes against a moth warrior woken by a jewel shard.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'In the second film, from 2002, the villain is Kaguya, a character based on the Tale of the Bamboo Cutter.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The third film, from 2003, has the two brothers seal their father''s third sword, and the fourth, from 2004, is set on a mystical island.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Together the four films earned more than 20 million US dollars in Japanese theaters.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The 30 minute OVA Black Tessaiga was shown on July 30, 2008 at an exhibit in Tokyo and went on sale in Japan on October 20, 2010.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'In May 2020 an anime-original sequel, Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon, was announced, and it premiered on October 3, 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Yashahime ran for two seasons between October 2020 and March 2022, and follows the daughters of the original heroes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'In the United States both series aired on Adult Swim, and later on its revived Toonami block, between 2002 and 2015.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'A light novel by Tomoko Komparu, illustrated by Takahashi, was published by Shogakukan on December 10, 2004.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'A stage play of Inuyasha ran at the Tennozu Galaxy Theater in Tokyo in April 2017, with Yutaka Kyan as Inuyasha and Yumi Wakatsuki as Kagome.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'Inuyasha''s sword Tessaiga appeared in Monster Hunter as a weapon that players could craft during a special event.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The anime is cut into the four seasons of the first series plus the sequel series The Final Act.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_episodes', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'inuyasha', 'Inuyasha is a proud, stubborn half-demon whose mother was human and whose father was a dog demon, with a soft side under the pride.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'inuyasha', 'Kappei Yamaguchi voices Inuyasha in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'kagome-higurashi', 'Kagome Higurashi is a brave and kind modern girl, the reincarnation of the priestess Kikyo, who never turns her back on someone in trouble.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'kagome-higurashi', 'As the series goes on Kagome becomes very skilled at archery and masters her strong spiritual powers.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'kagome-higurashi', 'Satsuki Yukino voices Kagome in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'miroku', 'Miroku is an eighteen year old Buddhist monk who is clever and lecherous, and who often swindles rich clients.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'miroku', 'Miroku''s greatest weapon is the Wind Tunnel, a black hole in his right palm that is really a hereditary curse laid on his grandfather by Naraku.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'miroku', 'Kōji Tsujitani voices Miroku in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'sango', 'Sango is a sixteen year old demon slayer, the most skilled of her village, the original home of the Shikon Jewel.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'sango', 'Sango fights with the Hiraikotsu, a huge purified bone boomerang.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'sango', 'Houko Kuwashima voices Sango in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'shippo', 'Shippo is an orphaned fox demon who first tries to steal the Shikon Jewel to avenge his father, then becomes a loyal companion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'kirara', 'Kirara is the faithful two-tailed companion of Sango, who looks like a kitten but can grow big enough to carry several passengers through the air.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'sesshomaru', 'Sesshomaru is a powerful dog demon feared across the feudal era, and the older half-brother of Inuyasha.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'sesshomaru', 'Ken Narita voices Sesshomaru in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'naraku', 'Naraku is the main villain, a half-demon born from the bandit Onigumo and the arch-enemy of Inuyasha and his friends.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'naraku', 'Toshiyuki Morikawa voices Naraku in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'naraku', 'In the end Naraku confesses a desire for Kikyo that sits beside his hatred of her, then spends his wish on locking himself and Kagome in the Shikon Jewel and dies.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'kikyo', 'Kikyo is the priestess who guarded the Shikon Jewel five hundred years before the main story and who loved Inuyasha.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'kikyo', 'Noriko Hidaka voices Kikyo in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'kikyo', 'Kikyo gives her own life so that Kohaku can live, just before Naraku gathers all the shards.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'kaede', 'Kaede is the younger sister of Kikyo, a strong shrine priestess who protects her village from demons.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'kaede', 'Kaede keeps Inuyasha under control with a magical bead necklace after he is freed from the tree.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'koga', 'Koga leads the Eastern Wolf Demon Tribe while still young, first fights Inuyasha as a rival, then becomes a grudging ally.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'kohaku', 'Kohaku is the eleven year old younger brother of Sango, a demon exterminator like the rest of his family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'rin', 'Rin is a barefoot orphan girl who nursed the wounds of Sesshomaru when she found him under a tree.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'jaken', 'Jaken is a small, green, imp-like demon who serves Sesshomaru faithfully and carries the Staff of Two Heads.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'myoga', 'Myoga is a flea demon who served Inuyasha''s father and gives Inuyasha information, but tends to run away from danger.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'totosai', 'Totosai is an old demon blacksmith with bulging eyes who forged Tessaiga and Tenseiga from the fangs of the Great Dog General.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'kagura', 'Kagura is a wind-controlling witch who fights with a fan, and the second detachment of Naraku.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'kanna', 'Kanna is the first detachment of Naraku, a ten year old girl in white who carries a mirror.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'bankotsu', 'Bankotsu is the youngest and strongest member of the Band of Seven and its leader, a mercenary who keeps a sense of honor for his comrades.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'bankotsu', 'Takeshi Kusao voices Bankotsu in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'character', 'hakudoshi', 'Hakudoshi calls himself the essence of Naraku and his eighth detachment, a barefoot boy who is skilled with weapons.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Inuyasha_characters', 'published'), ('inuyasha', 'series', 'inuyasha', 'The sequel spin-off Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon premiered on October 3, 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuyasha', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure is called ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 in Japan, read JoJo no Kimyō na Bōken.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Hirohiko Araki wrote and drew the whole manga himself.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'The manga began in Shueisha''s Weekly Shōnen Jump on 1 January 1987 and moved to the monthly Ultra Jump in 2005.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'By March 2026 the manga filled 139 collected volumes, one of the highest counts of any manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'The first season used two openings, one for each of Parts 1 and 2, and a single ending song for all of its episodes.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_season_1', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Season two switched themes halfway, and also had a special song sung by the characters Oingo and Boingo.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure:_Stardust_Crusaders', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Season three changed its opening three times and used one ending song throughout, plus a special group version of Great Days.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure:_Diamond_Is_Unbreakable', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Season four had two openings and two endings.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure:_Golden_Wind', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Season five had two openings and one ending song, and its last episode brought back Roundabout.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure:_Stone_Ocean', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'The sixth season''s second stage has an opening by Kroi and an ending by Yuki Chiba.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steel_Ball_Run:_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Stands, the spirit-like fighters that most characters use, are the best-known feature of the series.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'jotaro-kujo', 'Jotaro Kujo is the one character the author modeled on a real person, the actor Clint Eastwood.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Before the TV anime, A.P.P.P. made a 13-episode OVA of Stardust Crusaders, released between 1993 and 2002.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'jonathan-joestar', 'Jonathan Joestar is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'dio-brando', 'Dio Brando is an antagonist of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'joseph-joestar', 'Joseph Joestar is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'caesar-zeppeli', 'Caesar Anthonio Zeppeli is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'lisa-lisa', 'Lisa Lisa is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'kars', 'Kars is an antagonist of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'jotaro-kujo', 'Jotaro Kujo is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'avdol', 'Mohammed Avdol is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'kakyoin', 'Noriaki Kakyoin is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'polnareff', 'Jean Pierre Polnareff is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'josuke-higashikata', 'Josuke Higashikata is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'yoshikage-kira', 'Yoshikage Kira is an antagonist of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'rohan-kishibe', 'Rohan Kishibe is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'giorno-giovanna', 'Giorno Giovanna is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'bruno-bucciarati', 'Bruno Bucciarati is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'jolyne-cujoh', 'Jolyne Cujoh is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'enrico-pucci', 'Enrico Pucci is an antagonist of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'johnny-joestar', 'Johnny Joestar is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'gyro-zeppeli', 'Gyro Zeppeli is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'funny-valentine', 'Funny Valentine is an antagonist of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'jonathan-joestar', 'Jonathan Joestar is the hero at the heart of Phantom Blood, the first part of the story.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'jotaro-kujo', 'Jotaro Kujo is the lead of Stardust Crusaders, the third part, where he crosses the world to find Dio.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'giorno-giovanna', 'Giorno Giovanna is the lead of Golden Wind, the part set in Italy among the mafia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'polnareff', 'Jean Pierre Polnareff is a Frenchman who becomes a companion of the heroes, not the lead of his part.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Speedwagon starts out as a street thug but turns into the closest friend of Jonathan and helps him against Dio.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Will A. Zeppeli teaches Jonathan the Hamon technique and goes with him to take on Dio and the Stone Mask.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Dire is a pupil of the Hamon master Tonpetty who takes the field alongside Jonathan and Speedwagon against Dio.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Tarkus is a knight of old Britain whom Dio brings back as a zombie and sends against Jonathan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'kars', 'Kars is the head of the Pillar Men and the maker of the Stone Masks.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Esidisi, a Pillar Man, can heat his blood to a scorching temperature and flips between tears and calm.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Wamuu is a Pillar Man, a fighter who keeps to a code of honor and wields the wind.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Rudol von Stroheim is a human officer in the Nazi army, sent to study the Pillar Man Santana in Mexico.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'caesar-zeppeli', 'Caesar fights with Hamon, which he channels through soap bubbles blown from his gloves.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'avdol', 'Avdol, the fortune teller from Cairo, commands the fiery Stand Magician''s Red.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'kakyoin', 'Kakyoin''s Stand is Hierophant Green, which can fire green blasts of energy from a distance.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'polnareff', 'Polnareff fights through his Stand Silver Chariot, a knight in armor with a rapier.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Iggy is a stray dog, a Boston Terrier, who joins the heroes on the road to Egypt and loves coffee gum.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Coco Jumbo is a turtle that carries a hotel room inside its shell, handed to the gang by the boss.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Danny is the pet dog that Jonathan grew up with.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Hol Horse is a gunslinger from the American West who wields the revolver-shaped Stand Emperor.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'joseph-joestar', 'Joseph Joestar is the grandson of Jonathan and the lead of Battle Tendency.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'jotaro-kujo', 'Jotaro Kujo is the grandson of Joseph Joestar on his mother''s side.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'josuke-higashikata', 'Josuke Higashikata is a son of Joseph Joestar from a relationship outside his marriage.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'kakyoin', 'Noriaki Kakyoin is a high school student whom Jotaro frees from Dio''s control and who joins the heroes as a friend.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'In Egypt the heroes meet a run of Stands named after Egyptian gods, a change from the tarot card names used earlier in the story.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stardust_Crusaders', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'The blind N''Doul controls water with his Stand Geb.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'The gambler Daniel D''Arby holds the souls of his victims with the Stand Osiris.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'The butler Terence D''Arby, a game expert, owns the soul-stealing Stand Atum.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'J. Geil attacks through reflections with his Stand Hanged Man, which belongs to the earlier group of tarot-themed Stands.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Koichi Hirose awakens the sound-effect Stand Echoes, which has three Acts.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Okuyasu Nijimura carves away whatever he swipes with his Stand The Hand.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'rohan-kishibe', 'The manga artist Rohan Kishibe uses Heaven''s Door to read people like a book.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Abbacchio, once a policeman, is one of the men who follow Bucciarati.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Guido Mista fights beside Bucciarati with a revolver and the Stand Sex Pistols.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Narancia Ghirga is a young delinquent who swore to follow Bucciarati for good.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Prosciutto is a hitman of the Passione execution squad, a team of Stand users who start out as enemies of the heroes.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Phantom Blood is the title of the first part of the manga, set in late nineteenth century England.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Battle Tendency is the name of the second part, which begins in 1938.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Golden Wind is the title of the fifth part, set in Naples and Italy.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'josuke-higashikata', 'Crazy Diamond is the Stand of Josuke, a close range fighter that can restore broken things.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo''s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'The Japanese title 呪術廻戦 (Jujutsu Kaisen) can be read roughly as Sorcery Battle.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Gege Akutami is the sole creator of the manga, handling both the writing and the drawing.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Weekly Shonen Jump carried the manga from 5 March 2018 until 30 September 2024, a run of about six and a half years.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Shueisha serialized the manga in its magazine Weekly Shonen Jump and collected it in the Jump Comics line.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'The collected edition runs to 30 volumes, the last of which reached shelves in Japan on 25 December 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'The TV anime had its broadcast premiere on 3 October 2020, after an early online screening on 19 September 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Counting only the TV series (no films or recap specials), there are 59 episodes over three seasons of 24, 23 and 12.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'MAPPA is the animation studio behind all three TV seasons broadcast so far.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Sunghoo Park directed season 1, and Shota Goshozono took over as series director from season 2.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_episodes', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'In 2026 the third season, subtitled The Culling Game: Part 1, began airing on 9 January and ran for 12 episodes; a fourth season, Part 2, was announced as soon as it ended.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_season_3', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'The prequel Jujutsu Kaisen 0 began life as a four-chapter manga called Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical School, printed in Jump Giga in 2017.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_0', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'The film Jujutsu Kaisen 0 opened in Japanese cinemas on 24 December 2021 and was that year''s top earner at the Japanese box office.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_0_(film)', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'In June 2021 the manga paused for the author''s health, and serialization resumed on 2 August 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Volume 30, out on 25 December 2024, adds 16 new pages of four epilogues starring Panda, Nobara Kugisaki, Uraume and Yuko Ozawa.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'After the main story ended, Akutami and artist Yuji Iwasaki ran a short spin-off, Jujutsu Kaisen Modulo, in Weekly Shonen Jump from 8 September 2025 to 9 March 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'The manga''s worldwide circulation, digital editions included, has passed 150 million copies.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'At the fifth Crunchyroll Anime Awards the series took the Anime of the Year prize, and its second season repeated the feat at the eighth ceremony.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'From episode 3 of season 1, short slice-of-life clips called Juju Sanpo play after the credits, following the cast in their daily lives.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_season_1', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Crunchyroll rolled out dubs in five languages (German, French, Portuguese, Spanish and English) on 20 November 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'yuji-itadori', 'Yuji''s execution is postponed on one condition: he must first swallow every one of Ryomen Sukuna''s twenty fingers.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'satoru-gojo', 'Satoru Gojo, the teacher who takes Yuji in, holds the title of strongest sorcerer of the present day.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'kinji-hakari', 'Kinji Hakari''s Domain Expansion, Idle Death Gamble, hits its jackpot at odds of 1 in 239, and the jackpot lasts exactly 4 minutes 11 seconds, during which his cursed energy never runs out.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'aoi-todo', 'Aoi Todo''s habit of asking people which kind of woman they like was picked up from his mentor, the Special Grade sorcerer Yuki Tsukumo.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'yuji-itadori', 'Yuji Itadori is a main character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'satoru-gojo', 'Satoru Gojo is a main character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'megumi-fushiguro', 'Megumi Fushiguro is a main character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'nobara-kugisaki', 'Nobara Kugisaki is a main character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'ryomen-sukuna', 'Ryomen Sukuna is an antagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'kento-nanami', 'Kento Nanami is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'maki-zenin', 'Maki Zen''in is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'toge-inumaki', 'Toge Inumaki is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'panda', 'Panda is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'aoi-todo', 'Aoi Todo is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'mahito', 'Mahito is an antagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_chara