ia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'yuki-tsukumo', 'Yuki Tsukumo is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'rika-orimoto', 'Rika Orimoto is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'junpei-yoshino', 'Junpei Yoshino is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'riko-amanai', 'Riko Amanai is a character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'mai-zenin', 'Mai Zen''in is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'kasumi-miwa', 'Kasumi Miwa is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'utahime-iori', 'Utahime Iori is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'shoko-ieiri', 'Shoko Ieiri is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'kiyotaka-ijichi', 'Kiyotaka Ijichi is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'ryomen-sukuna', 'Ryomen Sukuna is voiced in Japanese by Junichi Suwabe.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'The series is written in katakana as カグラバチ, the same word the Weekly Shonen Jump page uses for its title.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'Takeru Hokazono both writes and draws the manga, and the official Jump page spells his name 外薗 健.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'Kagurabachi started in Shueisha''s Weekly Shōnen Jump in September 2023, which the official page lists as issue 42 of that year.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'The collected editions reached 12 volumes, with the first released on February 2, 2024 and the twelfth on September 4, 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'As of October 2026 the manga was past the 4.5 million mark in circulation, up from about a million two years earlier.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'In 2024 it took the tenth Next Manga Award for print manga, and in 2026 the Japan Expo Awards gave it the Daruma for best action manga.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'Viz Media announced a print edition in March 2024 and published volume 1 on November 5, 2024; Shueisha''s Manga Plus also carries the series in English.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'The twelve collected volumes run from chapter 1 to chapter 113, so chapter 114 is the first one still waiting for its volume.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'The tale unfolds in today''s Japan, 18 years after the Seitei War, a conflict in which hidden sorcery finally came into the open.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'Its first chapter was the most viewed worldwide in its first week on Manga Plus, and the platform logged more than 99 million views of the series by April 2024.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'Kamunabi is the state-run sorcerer agency set up in the Seitei War years to deal with dangers facing all of Japan.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'chihiro-rokuhira', 'Chihiro carries Enten, a secret seventh Enchanted Blade made by his father, which gives him stronger physical ability and lets him absorb energy.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'hakuri-sazanami', 'Hakuri can use both his clan''s Isou technique and the Storehouse, a subspace for keeping objects and people, which only one other clan member ever managed.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'seiichi-samura', 'Samura is a disciple of Itsuo Shirakai (白廻逸夫), the swordsman who created the Iai White Purity Style around the pursuit of speed.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'chihiro-rokuhira', 'Chihiro Rokuhira is a main character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'togo-shiba', 'Togo Shiba is a main character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'char-kyonagi', 'Char Kyonagi is a supporting character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'soshiro-azami', 'Soshiro Azami is a supporting character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'genichi-sojo', 'Genichi Sojo is an antagonist of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'kunishige-rokuhira', 'Kunishige Rokuhira is a supporting character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'hakuri-sazanami', 'Hakuri Sazanami is a main character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'hiyuki-kagari', 'Hiyuki Kagari is a supporting character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'yura', 'Yura is an antagonist of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'iori-samura', 'Iori Samura is a supporting character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'seiichi-samura', 'Seiichi Samura is a supporting character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'akemura-soga', 'Akemura Soga is an antagonist of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'The Sorcery Bureau was a state sorcery department that already existed ahead of the war.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'The Hishaku, a band of criminal sorcerers, killed the swordsmith Kunishige and carried off his six blades.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'kunishige-rokuhira', 'Once the war was over, Azami helped Kunishige settle somewhere out of sight.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'Ibuki Misaka, who had given up the sword, was killed by the Hishaku swordsman Hokuto soon after Kunishige died.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'When the war was over, the Cloud Gouger bearer Ibuki stopped fighting and lost his drive.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'chihiro-rokuhira', 'Chihiro starts a quest for revenge once his father is killed, hoping to win back the other stolen blades.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The Japanese title means roughly: the lady Kaguya wants him to confess, followed by a subtitle about a war of hearts and minds among geniuses.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Aka Akasaka both wrote and drew the manga Kaguya-sama: Love Is War.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'After a first stretch in Miracle Jump, the manga moved to Weekly Young Jump, where it stayed until the end.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Shueisha publishes the manga, with the volumes sold under its Young Jump Comics label.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The first chapter was published in Miracle Jump on May 19, 2015.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The serialization finished on November 2, 2022, after seven years and a few months.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The collected edition has 28 volumes, the first from March 2016 and the last from December 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The 281 chapters of the series fill those 28 volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Each chapter of the manga is officially called a battle, in keeping with the war of love at its center.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_chapters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The student council president and vice president of Shuchiin Academy both love each other but believe the first to confess loses, so they scheme to make the other speak first.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The character names come from an old tale known in Japan as the Tale of the Bamboo Cutter, in which Kaguya-hime is a princess.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The first plan of Akasaka was a fantasy about a game of death, but his editor asked for something more mainstream, and the series became his first romantic comedy.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Akasaka wanted intellectual duels in the manner of Death Note at first, and he also names School Rumble as an influence.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Akasaka pictured two people who like each other fighting battles of the mind, and readers found the idea fresh.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Akasaka was writing Instant Bullets for Weekly Young Jump when he looked for a second series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'In April 2020 Akasaka began Oshi no Ko, drawn by Mengo Yokoyari, in the same magazine, and Kaguya has a cameo in one of its special chapters.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Halfway through the series the leads confess to each other, and the story then follows how they move forward and what stands in their way.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The manga was one of two winners of the general category at the 65th Shogakukan Manga Award in 2020, the other being Aoashi.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'In its category for printed comics, the third Next Manga Award went to the series, for books released in 2017.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'By December 2022 the manga had passed 22 million copies in circulation.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The manga was the ninth best selling series of 2019, with more than 4 million copies sold that year.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'In the TV Asahi poll Manga Sōsenkyo 2021, where 150,000 people chose their top 100 series, the manga placed 50th.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Viz Media revealed its North American license for the manga on July 20, 2017, during a panel at San Diego Comic-Con.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'A spin-off by Shinta Sakayama, the Dōjin Edition, ran on the website Tonari no Young Jump from June 14, 2018 to June 25, 2020 in four volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'A four panel spin-off by G3 Ida, Kaguya-sama o Kataritai, follows two press club girls who idolize the council, and it filled eight volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Two spin-off novels by Jūichirō Hitsujiyama came out in September 2018 and November 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Shueisha announced the anime adaptation on June 1, 2018.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_episodes', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The anime premiered on January 12, 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_season_1', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'A-1 Pictures animated all three seasons, the film and the special.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Shinichi Omata directed the anime under the pen name Mamoru Hatakeyama.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_episodes', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Yasuhiro Nakanishi wrote the scripts, Yuuko Yahiro designed the characters, Jin Aketagawa directed the sound and Kei Haneoka composed the music.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_season_1', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The first season ran for 12 episodes from January 12 to March 30, 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_season_1', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The second season, Love Is War?, has 12 episodes and aired from April 11 to June 27, 2020, after a world premiere in Sydney.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War%3F', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'An OVA episode came bundled with volume 22 of the manga on May 19, 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_episodes', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Ultra Romantic, the third season, comprises 13 episodes that were broadcast between April 9 and June 25, 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_%E2%80%93_Ultra_Romantic', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The 3 TV seasons add up to 37 episodes: 12, 12 and 13.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_episodes', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The film The First Kiss That Never Ends opened in Japanese theaters on December 17, 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_episodes', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The television special The Stairway to Adulthood was announced in June 2025 and premiered on December 31, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_episodes', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'A last film, The Final Chapter, has been announced to conclude the story from an original story by Akasaka; no release date is listed as of October 25, 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_episodes', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The live action film of September 6, 2019 starred Sho Hirano as Miyuki and Kanna Hashimoto as Kaguya, and Hayato Kawai directed it.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'A sequel film, Kaguya-sama Final, opened in Japanese cinemas on August 20, 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Season one opened with Love Dramatic by Masayuki Suzuki with Rikka Ihara and closed with Sentimental Crisis by Halca.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_season_1', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Season two used Daddy! Daddy! Do!, again by Masayuki Suzuki, with the actress Airi Suzuki, and Kaze ni Fukarete by Haruka Fukuhara.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War%3F', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Season three came with GIRI GIRI by Masayuki Suzuki and Suu of Silent Siren, and Heart wa Oteage by Airi Suzuki.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_%E2%80%93_Ultra_Romantic', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'In episode 5 of the third season the ending song was My Nonfiction, sung by Makoto Furukawa and Konomi Kohara as Miyuki and Chika.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_%E2%80%93_Ultra_Romantic', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The special The Stairway to Adulthood opens with Abunai Kioku, by Masayuki Suzuki with Aoi Koga, and ends with Aka to Ao, sung by Aoi Koga.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_episodes', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'The anime is split into three TV seasons, a film and a television special.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_episodes', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'series', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Episodes of season one are made of short stories with titles that say who wants what, such as Kaguya Wants to Exchange Contact Info.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_episodes', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'kaguya-shinomiya', 'Kaguya Shinomiya is the vice president of the student council, a beautiful and clever heiress of one of the biggest business families in Japan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'kaguya-shinomiya', 'Kaguya is hopeless with social media and digital tools, yet she is excellent with old analog tools such as the typewriter.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'kaguya-shinomiya', 'Aoi Koga voices Kaguya in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'miyuki-shirogane', 'Miyuki Shirogane is the president of the student council and the top student of the school, who finished second in national mock exams.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'miyuki-shirogane', 'Miyuki is physically weak at sports and has a paralyzing fear of insects, above all cockroaches.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'miyuki-shirogane', 'Miyuki loves stargazing and dreams of becoming a professional astronomer one day.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'miyuki-shirogane', 'Makoto Furukawa voices Miyuki in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'chika-fujiwara', 'Chika Fujiwara is the secretary of the student council, a cheerful airhead who is nonetheless good at languages, singing and sports.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'chika-fujiwara', 'Chika has silver hair with a black bow in the manga, and her hair is light pink in the anime.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'chika-fujiwara', 'Konomi Kohara voices Chika in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'yu-ishigami', 'Yu Ishigami is the treasurer of the student council, a quiet underclassman who plays video games on a handheld console with headphones on.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'yu-ishigami', 'Ryōta Suzuki voices Yu in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'ai-hayasaka', 'Ai Hayasaka is the personal assistant and childhood friend of Kaguya, who hides this link at school behind a fashionable image.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'ai-hayasaka', 'When Miyuki visits the house, Ai plays a maid from an all-girls school under a made up name.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'ai-hayasaka', 'Yumiri Hanamori voices Ai in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'miko-iino', 'Miko Iino is a strict first-year member of the disciplinary committee who wants orderly and proper behavior, yet she is shy and fears public speaking.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'miko-iino', 'Miko is at the top of her class and admires Chika for her skill as a pianist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'miko-iino', 'Miyu Tomita voices Miko in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'miko-iino', 'Later on Miko runs for school president and wins, and she asks Yu Ishigami to be her vice president.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'nagisa-kashiwagi', 'Nagisa Kashiwagi is a classmate from a wealthy shipbuilding family who heads the volunteering club and asks Kaguya for relationship advice.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'nagisa-kashiwagi', 'Momo Asakura voices Nagisa in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'tsubasa-tanuma', 'Tsubasa Tanuma is the classmate who asks Miyuki for love advice, confesses to Nagisa and becomes her boyfriend.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'kei-shirogane', 'Kei Shirogane is the younger sister of Miyuki and the treasurer of the junior high student council of Shuchiin.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'kei-shirogane', 'Sayumi Suzushiro voices Kei in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'moeha-fujiwara', 'Moeha Fujiwara is the younger sister of Chika and the vice president of the junior high student council, with a habit of dark remarks.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'maki-shijo', 'Maki Shijo is a classmate and best friend of Nagisa who is secretly jealous, and a running gag shows her watching the couple from the edge of the page.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'maki-shijo', 'Kana Ichinose voices Maki in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'kobachi-osaragi', 'Kobachi Osaragi is the glasses-wearing classmate of Miko and a member of the disciplinary committee.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'tsubame-koyasu', 'Tsubame Koyasu is a popular senior who serves as vice captain of the cheer squad and does rhythmic gymnastics.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'tsubame-koyasu', 'Haruka Fukuhara voices Tsubame in Japanese, and she also sings the second ending theme of the anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'karen-kino', 'Karen Kino is a mass media club member who writes fan fiction about the leads, and the daughter of the head of a big publisher.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'erika-kose', 'Erika Kose is a mass media club member with a ponytail whose obsession is fixed on Kaguya, from a family that makes miso.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'papa-shirogane', 'Papa Shirogane is the father of Miyuki and Kei, who spends most of his time jobless and tells fortunes.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'papa-shirogane', 'Takehito Koyasu voices him in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'unyo-shinomiya', 'Un''yo Shinomiya is the cold and sharp half-brother of Kaguya who is very protective of her.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'oko-shinomiya', 'Oko Shinomiya is the eldest child of Gan''an and the heir to the Shinomiya Group.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'mikado-shijo', 'Mikado Shijo is the heir to the Shijo Group and the younger twin brother of Maki.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'mikado-shijo', 'Seiichiro Yamashita voices Mikado in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'ganan-shinomiya', 'Gan''an Shinomiya is the patriarch of the Shinomiya Group, who by the time he appears is weakened by illness.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'character', 'mikado-shijo', 'Mikado shares his name with the emperor who courts the princess in the Tale of the Bamboo Cutter.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Kaiju No. 8 is called Kaijū Hachigō in Japan, and its English alternate title is Monster #8.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Naoya Matsumoto is both writer and artist of the manga, which ran on Shueisha''s Shōnen Jump+ from July 3, 2020 until July 18, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_chapters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'The story closed after 129 chapters collected in 16 volumes, with the final book reaching Japanese shops on September 4, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_chapters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Production I.G animated the first season, with Studio Khara handling the kaiju designs; the 12 episodes ran between April 13 and June 29, 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_episodes', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Season two followed in July 2025 and brought the anime to 23 episodes in total; its last episode aired on September 27, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_episodes', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'The first season opens with Abyss by Yungblud and closes each episode with Nobody by OneRepublic.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_episodes', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'For season two the opening is You Can''t Run From Yourself by Aurora, and OneRepublic returns with Beautiful Colors as the ending.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_episodes', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'No source names story arcs, so this quiz uses the two anime seasons and then the part of the manga the anime has not covered yet.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_episodes', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Officers fight in powered suits built from kaiju remains, and each suit shows a combat power percentage that tops out at 100.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Matsumoto drew on Japanese tokusatsu shows, above all the Ultraman series, and used his own struggles as a manga artist for Kafka''s backstory.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'The manga took the 2021 Next Manga Award for web manga and was shortlisted for an Eisner Award the year after.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'By September 2026 more than 20 million copies of the manga were in circulation.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Besides the main manga there is a light novel by Keiji Andō from November 2022 and two spin-off manga that both began in 2024, B-Side and Relax.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'kikoru-shinomiya', 'Kikoru is a prodigy: no recruit before her has been logged with a higher unleashed combat power score.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'kafka-hibino', 'Kafka Hibino is a main character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'reno-ichikawa', 'Reno Ichikawa is a main character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'kikoru-shinomiya', 'Kikoru Shinomiya is a main character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'mina-ashiro', 'Mina Ashiro is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'soshiro-hoshina', 'Soshiro Hoshina is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'gen-narumi', 'Gen Narumi is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'isao-shinomiya', 'Isao Shinomiya is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'iharu-furuhashi', 'Iharu Furuhashi is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'haruichi-izumo', 'Haruichi Izumo is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'keiji-itami', 'Keiji Itami is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'kaiju-no-9', 'Kaiju No. 9 is an antagonist of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'kaiju-no-10', 'Kaiju No. 10 is an antagonist of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'reno-ichikawa', 'Reno Ichikawa is a teenager of eighteen when he joins the cleanup company and hopes to enter the Defense Force.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'mina-ashiro', 'Mina Ashiro, the Third Division captain, is twenty-seven in the character profile.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'reno-ichikawa', 'Reno can wield the Numbers 6 weapon, an armor made from Kaiju No. 6 that gives him ice powers.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Kaiju No. 6, which crippled the Defense Force before the story, is rated 9.6 on the fortitude scale.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'kikoru-shinomiya', 'Kikoru takes over the Numbers 4 armor of her late mother, which lets her fly.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'gen-narumi', 'Gen Narumi fights with the Numbers 1 weapon, made from Kaiju No. 1, which lets him foresee his enemy''s moves.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Hikari Shinomiya, Kikoru''s mother, once led the Second Division (Division 2) as its captain.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'reno-ichikawa', 'When the Third Division base is wrecked, Reno moves to the Fourth Division (Division 4).', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'A Defense Force officer needs unleashed combat power over 90 percent to become a captain or vice-captain who commands a division.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'The Japanese title is written モブサイコ100, read Mobu Saiko Hyaku, with the number 100 kept as a numeral.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'ONE wrote and drew Mob Psycho 100 himself.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'Mob Psycho 100 started as a webcomic on Ura Sunday, a website run by the publisher Shogakukan.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'The series was also published on the mobile app MangaONE.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'The manga was collected in 16 volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'Dark Horse Comics publishes the manga in English.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'The anime was animated by the studio Bones.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'Yuzuru Tachikawa directed the Mob Psycho 100 anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'Hiroshi Seko wrote the scripts of the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'Kenji Kawai composed the music of the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'As of October 2026, the Mob Psycho 100 anime has three seasons.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'The first season has 12 episodes and aired from July to September 2016.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_episodes', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'The second season has 13 episodes and aired from January to April 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_episodes', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'The third season has 12 episodes and aired from October to December 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_episodes', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'A live-action TV drama of Mob Psycho 100 was made in 2018.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'The live-action drama first appeared on Netflix and was then shown on TV Tokyo.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'A spin-off manga called Reigen was published online on Ura Sunday and on the MangaONE app.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'ONE is also the creator of the original One-Punch Man.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'In the shonen category, the manga was honoured at the 62nd Shogakukan Manga Award.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'At the first Crunchyroll Anime Awards, the anime won two prizes, Best Action and Best Fight Scene.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'Crunchyroll streamed every season of the anime as it aired.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_episodes', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'Mob is an eighth-grade esper with huge powers, who holds back his emotions so they do not run out of control.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'Reigen runs the Spirits and Such Consultation Office, a low-cost advice business where Mob works for 300 yen an hour.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'The Body Improvement Club is a fitness club that took over the room of the Telepathy Club.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'When Mob''s emotions reach 100%, he unleashes his full powers.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'The mark ???% stands for an unconscious state of power that goes far beyond Mob''s normal limits.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'series', 'mob-psycho-100', 'Claw is a criminal group of espers that aims at world domination and is led by Touichirou Suzuki.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'theme', 'op-1', 'The opening of the first season is called 99 and is sung by Mob Choir.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'theme', 'ed-1', 'The first season ends with Refrain Boy, performed by All Off.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'theme', 'op-2', 'The second season opens with 99.9, by Mob Choir together with Sajou no Hana.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'theme', 'op-3', 'The third season opens with a song simply called 1, by Mob Choir.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'theme', 'ed-2', 'The third season closes with Cobalt, also by Mob Choir.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mob_Psycho_100', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'shigeo-kageyama', 'Shigeo Kageyama, nicknamed Mob, is written 影山 茂夫 in Japanese and is an eighth-grade esper.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'arataka-reigen', 'Arataka Reigen is written 霊幻 新隆 in Japanese and runs a consultation business.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'ritsu-kageyama', 'Ritsu Kageyama is written 影山 律 in Japanese and is the younger brother of Mob.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'teruki-hanazawa', 'Teruki Hanazawa is written 花沢 輝気 in Japanese and is a powerful telekinetic esper.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'dimple', 'Dimple is written エクボ in Japanese and is an evil spirit.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'tsubomi-takane', 'Tsubomi Takane is written 高嶺 ツボミ in Japanese and is a childhood friend of Mob.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'musashi-goda', 'Musashi Goda is written 郷田 武蔵 in Japanese and is the president of the Body Improvement Club.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'tome-kurata', 'Tome Kurata is written 暗田 トメ in Japanese and founded the Telepathy Club.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'tenga-onigawara', 'Tenga Onigawara is written 鬼瓦 天牙 in Japanese and is a delinquent who joins the Body Improvement Club.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'touichirou-suzuki', 'Touichirou Suzuki is written 鈴木 統一郎 in Japanese and is the leader of Claw.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'katsuya-serizawa', 'Katsuya Serizawa is written 芹沢 克也 in Japanese and is a bodyguard in Claw.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'ryo-shimazaki', 'Ryo Shimazaki is written 島崎 亮 in Japanese and belongs to the Ultimate 5 of Claw.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'toshiki-minegishi', 'Toshiki Minegishi is written 峯岸 棯樹 in Japanese and belongs to the Ultimate 5 of Claw.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'hiroshi-shibata', 'Hiroshi Shibata is written 柴田 宏 in Japanese and belongs to the Ultimate 5 of Claw.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'nozomu-hatori', 'Nozomu Hatori is written 羽鳥 希 in Japanese and belongs to the Ultimate 5 of Claw.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'shou-suzuki', 'Shou Suzuki is written 鈴木 将 in Japanese and is the son of the head of Claw.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'keiji-mogami', 'Keiji Mogami is written 最上 啓示 in Japanese and was a famed psychic of the past.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'megumu-koyama', 'Megumu Koyama is written 誇山 恵 in Japanese and is a member of the Scars of the 7th Division.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'kenji-mitsuura', 'Kenji Mitsuura is written 密裏 賢治 in Japanese and leads the Mitsuura Group.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'ichi-mezato', 'Ichi Mezato is written 米里 イチ in Japanese and is a journalist of the Journalism Club.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'shigeo-kageyama', 'Mob keeps his feelings under tight control, because they power his abilities.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'arataka-reigen', 'Reigen says he is a psychic, but he has no powers and gets by on wit and charm.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'ritsu-kageyama', 'Ritsu is a seventh-grade student and a member of the Student Council.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'ritsu-kageyama', 'Ritsu develops psychic powers of his own as the series goes on.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'teruki-hanazawa', 'Teruki is known as the hidden boss of Black Vinegar Middle School.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'dimple', 'Dimple is an evil spirit who can take over bodies, though he cannot possess powerful psychics without their permission.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'tsubomi-takane', 'Tsubomi Takane is the childhood friend that Mob has a crush on.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'musashi-goda', 'Musashi Goda founded the Body Improvement Club and serves as its president.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'tome-kurata', 'Tome Kurata founded the Telepathy Club and is its president.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'tenga-onigawara', 'By accident, Tenga Onigawara starts the rumor called White T-Poison.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'touichirou-suzuki', 'Touichirou Suzuki founded Claw to take over the world.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'katsuya-serizawa', 'Serizawa stayed shut in his room because he feared his powers might get out of control.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'ryo-shimazaki', 'Shimazaki''s special ability is called the Mind''s Eye, and he can teleport and predict movements.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'toshiki-minegishi', 'Minegishi controls plants, and after his defeat he becomes a florist.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'hiroshi-shibata', 'Shibata''s power is to boost his own psychic strength.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'nozomu-hatori', 'Hatori controls technology with his psychic powers, and in the anime he ends up as a helicopter pilot.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'shou-suzuki', 'Shou is the son of the head of Claw but stands against his father, and he is a close friend of Ritsu.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'keiji-mogami', 'Keiji Mogami was once called the greatest psychic of the twentieth century.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'megumu-koyama', 'Koyama fights with attacks named Telekinetic Helix and Energy Bomb.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'ichi-mezato', 'Mezato took part in founding the Psycho Helmet Cult.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'kenji-mitsuura', 'Mitsuura wished to create psychic powers by artificial means.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('mob-psycho-100', 'character', 'arataka-reigen', 'Arataka Reigen is voiced in Japanese by Takahiro Sakurai.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Mob_Psycho_100_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'In Japan the series is titled 僕のヒーローアカデミア, read Boku no Hīrō Akademia.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Kōhei Horikoshi wrote and drew every chapter of the manga himself.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'The manga ran for a decade, from July 2014 until its finale in August 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Kenji Nagasaki directed the early seasons and then served as chief director for the rest.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'A bonus television special that adapts chapter 431 premiered on 2 May 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'The manga has won both a Sugoi Japan Award and a Harvey Award.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'During the Meta Liberation Army stretch, the title of the series temporarily changes to My Villain Academia.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia_season_5', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Roughly four in five people in this world have a superpower called a Quirk.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Four animated films have been released, starting with Two Heroes and ending with You''re Next.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'One of the spin-off manga is Vigilantes, which ran between 2016 and 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'izuku-midoriya', 'Izuku starts the story as a boy with no Quirk at all, yet still dreams of becoming a hero.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'A live-action film from Legendary Entertainment has been announced and is still in development.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'izuku-midoriya', 'Izuku Midoriya is a main character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'katsuki-bakugo', 'Katsuki Bakugo is a main character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'ochaco-uraraka', 'Ochaco Uraraka is a main character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'shoto-todoroki', 'Shoto Todoroki is a main character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'tenya-ida', 'Tenya Ida is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'eijiro-kirishima', 'Eijiro Kirishima is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'momo-yaoyorozu', 'Momo Yaoyorozu is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'tsuyu-asui', 'Tsuyu Asui is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'denki-kaminari', 'Denki Kaminari is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'fumikage-tokoyami', 'Fumikage Tokoyami is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'mina-ashido', 'Mina Ashido is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'kyoka-jiro', 'Kyoka Jiro is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'minoru-mineta', 'Minoru Mineta is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'all-might', 'All Might is a main character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'shota-aizawa', 'Shota Aizawa is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'recovery-girl', 'Recovery Girl is a character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_