nist of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'twice', 'Twice is an antagonist of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'overhaul', 'Overhaul is an antagonist of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'hawks', 'Hawks is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'eri', 'Eri is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'tsuyu-asui', 'Tsuyu Asui is a frog-like girl who studies in the famous Class 1-A.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'momo-yaoyorozu', 'Momo Yaoyorozu serves as the deputy class representative of Class 1-A.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'tenya-ida', 'Tenya Ida is the class representative of Class 1-A and takes the job very seriously.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Itsuka Kendo is the class representative of the rival Class 1-B.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'present-mic', 'Present Mic, whose real name is Hizashi Yamada, teaches English at U.A.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Midnight is a Pro Heroine who also teaches modern art history at U.A.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Cementoss is a Pro Hero who teaches literature at U.A.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Fat Gum is a Pro Hero with his own agency who takes interns, such as Tamaki Amajiki and Kirishima.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'ochaco-uraraka', 'Ochaco Uraraka makes things weightless with her Quirk Zero Gravity.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'shoto-todoroki', 'Shoto Todoroki makes ice with one side of his body and fire with the other, thanks to Half-Cold Half-Hot.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'tenya-ida', 'Tenya Ida owes his great speed to the Quirk Engine, with engines in his calves.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'shota-aizawa', 'Aizawa, the homeroom teacher of Class 1-A, nullifies other Quirks with Erasure for as long as he does not blink.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'ochaco-uraraka', 'Uravity is the hero name of Ochaco Uraraka.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'tsuyu-asui', 'Froppy is the hero name of Tsuyu Asui.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'momo-yaoyorozu', 'Creati is the hero name of Momo Yaoyorozu.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'mirio-togata', 'Lemillion is the hero name of the third-year Mirio Togata, who hopes to help a million people.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'twice', 'Twice joined the League because it took him as he was, flaws included.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Spinner is a gecko-like villain who joined the League out of admiration for Stain.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Magne is a sharp and ruthless criminal who belonged to the League and uses magnetism.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'overhaul', 'Overhaul is the germ-fearing head of the Yakuza group Shie Hassaikai, not a member of the League.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Mandalay leads the Pussycats, the cat-themed team of Pro Heroes who help train the students.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Pixie-Bob is one of the Pussycats and moves the earth with her Quirk.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Ragdoll is the hyperactive Pussycat who can keep track of a hundred people.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Kamui Woods is a tree-limbed Pro Hero who is part of the Lurkers team, not the Pussycats.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'endeavor', 'Endeavor, whose real name is Enji Todoroki, is the father of Shoto and his older siblings.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Rei Todoroki is the wife of Endeavor and the mother of his four children.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Fuyumi Todoroki is the big sister of Shoto and works as an elementary school teacher.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Gran Torino is a retired hero who once mentored All Might and later Izuku, and is no relative of the Todorokis.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Shiketsu High School is the main rival of U.A. and one of the best hero schools in western Japan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Ketsubutsu Academy is a respected hero school that likes to see itself as a rival of U.A.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Seiai Academy is a hero school for girls that only appears in the anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'The Shie Hassaikai is not a school but a Yakuza gang that deals in drugs that destroy Quirks.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'mirio-togata', 'Mirio Togata, the leader of the Big Three, passes through solid walls with Permeation.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Tamaki Amajiki, a member of the Big Three, borrows the traits of whatever he eats through Manifest.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Nejire Hado, the third member of the Big Three, fires spiral shockwaves with Wave Motion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'tsuyu-asui', 'Tsuyu Asui, a first-year of Class 1-A, has a Quirk simply called Frog.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'The teacher and Pro Hero Cementoss controls concrete with his Quirk Cement.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'The Pro Hero Kamui Woods grows tree-like limbs with the Quirk Arbor.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https