r', 'jiraiya', 'Jiraiya, known as the Toad Sage, acts as a teacher to Naruto, and the author calls their bond his favourite.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'konohamaru-sarutobi', 'Konohamaru, grandson of the Third Hokage, treats Naruto as a mentor and copies his techniques.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'rock-lee', 'Rock Lee is on Team Guy and is the best-loved pupil of its captain.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'neji-hyuga', 'Neji, a gifted Hyuga, fought alongside Lee as part of the team led by Might Guy.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Tenten, the weapons specialist, is the third genin on Might Guy''s squad.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'hinata-hyuga', 'Hinata is a Hyuga heiress who trains with Team 8 under Kurenai.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'The three Sand Siblings are Suna ninja who are children of that village''s Fourth Kazekage.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'gaara', 'Gaara is the youngest of the three Sand children, and a mirror image of Naruto.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Kankuro is the middle child of the trio and a puppeteer.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Temari is the big sister of the trio and fights with a huge fan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'shikamaru-nara', 'Shikamaru is a lazy genius who belongs to Team 10 and counts Naruto as a friend.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'orochimaru', 'Orochimaru, Jiraiya and Tsunade were pupils of the same Konoha master and are honoured as the Legendary Sannin.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'hiruzen-sarutobi', 'Hiruzen Sarutobi trained all three of the Legendary Sannin when they were young.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Hashirama Senju was the first Hokage and a co-founder of Konoha.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Tobirama Senju, Hashirama''s younger brother, held the Hokage seat as number two.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'hiruzen-sarutobi', 'Hiruzen Sarutobi sat as the third Hokage, ruling longer than any other.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'gaara', 'Gaara later leads Sunagakure as its Kazekage, so his title is not Hokage.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'kakashi-hatake', 'Team 7, led by Kakashi, is made up of Naruto, Sasuke and Sakura.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'might-guy', 'Might Guy teaches taijutsu and leads his own squad, Team Guy, instead of Kakashi''s.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'killer-bee', 'Killer Bee, host of the Eight-Tails, is hunted by Akatsuki and tricks them by faking his capture.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'kurama', 'Kurama, the Nine-Tailed Fox, is the strongest of all the Tailed Beasts.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Shukaku is the One-Tail, a tanuki beast once sealed in Gaara.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Gyuki is the Eight-Tails, a beast with an ox head and octopus body.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Akamaru is Kiba''s dog partner, a pet and fighter, not a Tailed Beast.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'zabuza-momochi', 'Zabuza once belonged to the swordsmen of the Hidden Mist before he went rogue.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'kisame-hoshigaki', 'Kisame is a former Mist ninja with a shark-like face.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Suigetsu hails from the Hidden Mist and dreams of collecting its famous swords.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Deidara left the Hidden Rock village after bombing it, then drifted to Akatsuki.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Mei Terumi leads Kirigakure as its Mizukage.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Onoki is the proud Tsuchikage of Iwagakure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Ay leads Kumogakure as its Raikage and is Killer Bee''s adoptive brother.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Chiyo is an old puppeteer who advises Sunagakure, but she holds no Kage title.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Sai steps into Team Kakashi in the second part of the story, taking the slot left by Sasuke.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Yamato is an Anbu ninja who fills in as captain of Team Kakashi during Part II.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Hidan, an immortal worshipper of Jashin, is one half of an Akatsuki pair with Kakuzu.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Kakuzu signs on with Akatsuki because he wants the bounty money.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Deidara and Sasori are the bomber and the puppeteer who captured Gaara for Akatsuki.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The Korean title is 전지적 독자 시점, and the English name Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint is also shortened to Omniscient Reader.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The Chinese Wikipedia infobox gives the Korean title in Latin letters as Jeonjijeok Dokja Sijeom.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The story comes from singNsong''s web novel; the Webtoon page credits UMI and Sleepy-C alongside it, with Sleepy-C as the webtoon artist.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The original web novel started on the Munpia platform on January 6, 2018, and its main story was finished on February 2, 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The main web novel runs for 551 chapters, a count that leaves out the side stories added later.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%A0%84%EC%A7%80%EC%A0%81_%EB%8F%85%EC%9E%90_%EC%8B%9C%EC%A0%90', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The webtoon adaptation went live on Naver Webtoon on May 26, 2020, opening with a prologue episode.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'English readers got the webtoon on August 18, 2020, when the prologue and the first two episodes were posted on the same day.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'Season 1 ended on the Naver Webtoon with episode 311 on June 9, 2026, labeled as the season finale, and the series is now on a break.', 'history', 'official', 'https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=747269', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The Yen Press imprint IZE Press announced in June 2023 that it holds English rights to both the comic and the novel; the first English novel volume came out on July 22, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'In Korea the comic is collected by A.Tempo Media: volumes 1 and 2 appeared together on December 22, 2020, and 18 had been released by March 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'A live-action film directed by Kim Byung-woo opened in South Korean cinemas on July 23, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader:_The_Prophecy', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'We split the webtoon into five blocks of ten of Naver''s own Ep. chapters, named after the first and last chapter titles; the episode numbers are the ones printed in the Naver titles.', 'history', 'official', 'https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=747269', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'kim-dokja', 'Dokja has been the sole reader of the web novel Three Ways to Survive in a Ruined World for 13 years, and it has 3,149 chapters.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'kim-dokja', 'Kim Dokja is a main character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'yoo-joonghyuk', 'Yoo Joonghyuk is a main character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'han-sooyoung', 'Han Sooyoung is a main character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'yoo-sangah', 'Yoo Sangah is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'jung-heewon', 'Jung Heewon is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'lee-hyunsung', 'Lee Hyunsung is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'lee-gilyoung', 'Lee Gilyoung is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'lee-jihye', 'Lee Jihye is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'gong-pildu', 'Gong Pildu is an antagonist of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'han-myungoh', 'Han Myungoh is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'bihyung', 'Bihyung is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'shin-yoosung', 'Shin Yoosung is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint began as a web novel from South Korea, written by singNsong.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader''s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The first English volume of the comic reached readers on December 12, 2023, from Ize Press, an imprint of Yen Press.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'Ize Press printed the first English volume of the novel on July 22, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'In Japan the title is spelled in katakana as ワンピース, read Wan Pīsu, the same two words as the English name.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/ONE_PIECE', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Eiichiro Oda is the one person behind both the writing and the drawing of the One Piece manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Shueisha has run the manga in its weekly magazine Weekly Shōnen Jump since the summer of 1997, starting on 22 July.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'By the start of July 2026 Shueisha had put out 115 collected volumes of the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'The first fifteen openings begin with We Are! by Hiroshi Kitadani and include pop acts such as Folder 5, TVXQ and Namie Amuro.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Openings 16 to 29 run from Hands Up! to Luminous, and include groups like AAA, V6 and Sekai no Owari plus a return of Hiroshi Kitadani.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'The first twelve ending songs open with Memories by Maki Otsuki and finish with Tsuki to Taiyō by Shela.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Endings 13 to 23 lead from Dreamship to Sono Mirai, the ending that began with the Elbaph arc in 2026.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Printed circulation worldwide had grown past six hundred million copies by the spring of 2026, the highest total of any manga.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Guinness World Records recognized Oda in 2015 and again in 2022 for the most copies published of one comic series by a single author.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'monkey-d-luffy', 'Luffy swallowed the Gum-Gum Fruit by mistake, which turned his body into rubber.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Kohei Tanaka and Shiro Hamaguchi wrote the music for the anime.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'The early English dub by 4Kids trimmed the first 143 episodes to 104 through edits for content and running time.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'We Are! served as the opening for the first 47 episodes and made a comeback for episode 1000.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Viz Media holds the English license for North America and the United Kingdom, while Madman Entertainment covers Australia.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Netflix put out a live-action One Piece television series in 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'From April 2026 the anime moved away from its year-round weekly schedule to two split cours each year.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_episodes', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'The anime began adapting the Elbaph arc on 5 April 2026, after a short break at the start of that year.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'gol-d-roger', 'Luffy''s journey aims at the treasure left behind by the late King of the Pirates, which is named the One Piece.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Besides Luffy the Straw Hat crew holds a swordsman, a navigator, a marksman, a cook, a doctor, an archaeologist, a shipwright, a musician and a helmsman.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'The Wano Country season is the longest of the 22 home media seasons, with 197 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_episodes', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Season 5 of the home media release carries the title TV Original, since its 13 episodes are new stories made for the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_episodes', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', '