', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roronoa_Zoro', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'roronoa-zoro', 'Zoro''s signature technique is Onigiri: its characters mean a demon cut, but spoken aloud it is the Japanese word for a rice ball.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'sanji', 'Sanji dreams of reaching the All Blue, a legendary sea where the four Blues meet and where fish of every kind can be found.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Straw_Hats', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'sanji', 'Sanji learned his cooking from Zeff, the former pirate who owns the floating restaurant Baratie and also showed him how to fight with his legs.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sanji_(One_Piece)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Gin, the combat commander of Krieg''s crew, turns up at the Baratie starving, and Sanji''s gift of a meal makes him thankful to the cook.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_pirates', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'sanji', 'Sanji will not use his hands in a fight, since a cook depends on them, so every attack of his is a kick.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sanji_(One_Piece)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'nami', 'After the mark of Arlong''s crew is removed from Nami''s arm, she wears a new tattoo that shows a tangerine beside a pinwheel.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nami_(One_Piece)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'tony-tony-chopper', 'Chopper''s sweet tooth gives him a pet name: the reindeer doctor is called the Cotton Candy Lover.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tony_Tony_Chopper', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'franky', 'Franky keeps his cyborg body running by drinking bottles of cola from a fridge built into his abdomen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franky_(One_Piece)', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'The title is written ワンパンマン in Japanese and read Wanpanman; English editions call it One-Punch Man.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One-Punch_Man', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'One came up with the story, and Yusuke Murata redrew it for the published manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One-Punch_Man', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'The story began in 2009 as a webcomic that One put online himself, before any publisher was involved.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One-Punch_Man', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'Murata''s redrawn version has appeared on Shueisha''s Tonari no Young Jump site since 14 June 2012.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One-Punch_Man', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'Season 1 was animated by Madhouse under director Shingo Natsume and ran for 12 episodes from 5 October to 21 December 2015.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One-Punch_Man_season_1', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'Season 2 moved to J.C.Staff with Chikara Sakurai directing; its 12 episodes, numbered 13 to 24 overall, aired from 10 April to 3 July 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One-Punch_Man_season_2', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'Season 3 stayed at J.C.Staff under director Shinpei Nagai: its first cours is episodes 25 to 36 (36 in total so far), with a second cours due in January 2027 and the manga beyond season 3 still ahead.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One-Punch_Man_season_3', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'The Japanese name riffs on the children''s hero Anpanman, with wanpan serving as shorthand for a single punch.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One-Punch_Man', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'Season 1 opens with a JAM Project song and ends on Hiroko Moriguchi tracks, with a separate closing song for episode 12.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One-Punch_Man_season_1', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'Season 2 pairs a JAM Project opening with a Makoto Furukawa ending; season 3 does the same, with Babymetal joining JAM Project.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One-Punch_Man', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'mumen-rider', 'His hero name jokes that he rides without a licence, and the character is a send-up of Kamen Rider.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'saitama', 'Saitama is a main character of One-Punch Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'genos', 'Genos is a main character of One-Punch Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'mumen-rider', 'Mumen Rider is a supporting character of One-Punch Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'speed-o-sound-sonic', 'Speed-o''-Sound Sonic is an antagonist of One-Punch Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'king', 'King is a supporting character of One-Punch Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'bang', 'Bang is a supporting character of One-Punch Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'atomic-samurai', 'Atomic Samurai is a supporting character of One-Punch Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'tatsumaki', 'Tatsumaki is a supporting character of One-Punch Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'garou', 'Garou is an antagonist of One-Punch Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'boros', 'Boros is an antagonist of One-Punch Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'fubuki', 'Fubuki is a supporting character of One-Punch Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'blast', 'Blast is a character of One-Punch Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'saitama', 'Saitama is 25 years old, a hero bored by how easily one blow ends nearly every fight.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'saitama', 'Every day Saitama works through 100 push-ups, 100 sit-ups and 100 squats, then a 10 km run, which he credits for his power.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'saitama', 'Saitama just clears the Hero Association entrance exam with 71 points, because his written paper drags his total down.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'Among all S-Class heroes, Child Emperor is the youngest of the group.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'mumen-rider', 'When Mumen Rider is first introduced in the Hero Association lists, he stands at the top of the lowest class, as the number 1 of C-Class.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'tatsumaki', 'Tatsumaki, nicknamed Terrible Tornado, holds second place in the S-Class and is the highest-placed woman of the Hero Association.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'character', 'atomic-samurai', 'Atomic Samurai insists that he is no more than 37 when Saitama calls him middle-aged.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'Puri-Puri Prisoner boasts a jail sentence of 10,000 years, which is where his hero name comes from.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('one-punch-man', 'series', 'one-punch-man', 'Child Emperor, the S-Class genius at rank 5, is 10 years old and carries his robot gear in a school backpack.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One-Punch_Man_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'The Japanese title is written 【推しの子】 inside corner brackets and read Oshi no Ko.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'Aka Akasaka wrote the story and Mengo Yokoyari drew the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'Shueisha''s Weekly Young Jump published the manga between April 2020 and November 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'The collected manga fills sixteen tankōbon volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'By December 2025 the manga had more than 25 million copies in circulation.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'Doga Kobo animates the television series, with Daisuke Hiramaki directing, Jin Tanaka handling series composition and Takurō Iga composing.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'The first season ran eleven episodes, from April 12 to June 28, 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_episodes', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'The season opened with a feature-length first episode titled Mother and Children that also had a cinema screening on March 17, 2023.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'The second season ran thirteen episodes, from July 3 to October 6, 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_episodes', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'Season one opens with Idol by YOASOBI and closes with Mephisto by Queen Bee.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'Season two uses Fatal by Gemn as its opening and Burning by Hitsujibungaku as its ending.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'Season three has Test Me by Chanmina as its opening and Serenade by Natori as its ending.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'aqua-hoshino', 'The premise: the twins Aqua and Ruby are reborn, Aqua being the doctor Gorou Amamiya (雨宮 吾郎) and Ruby being his patient Sarina Tendōji (天童寺 さりな).', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'kana-arima', 'As a child, Kana Arima won fame as an acting prodigy who could produce tears whenever a scene needed them.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'A live-action series debuted on November 28, 2024, and a feature film titled The Final Act arrived on December 20, 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'aqua-hoshino', 'Aqua Hoshino is a main character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'ruby-hoshino', 'Ruby Hoshino is a main character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'ai-hoshino', 'Ai Hoshino is a main character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'kana-arima', 'Kana Arima is a main character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'akane-kurokawa', 'Akane Kurokawa is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'mem-cho', 'MEM-cho is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'taishi-gotanda', 'Taishi Gotanda is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'ichigo-saito', 'Ichigo Saitō is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'miyako-saito', 'Miyako Saitō is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'melt-narushima', 'Melt Narushima is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'frill-shiranui', 'Frill Shiranui is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'taiki-himekawa', 'Taiki Himekawa is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'masaya-kaburagi', 'Masaya Kaburagi is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'pieyon', 'Pieyon is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'abiko-samejima', 'Abiko Samejima is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'yoriko-kichijouji', 'Yoriko Kichijouji is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'sakuya-kamoshida', 'Sakuya Kamoshida is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'minami-kotobuki', 'Minami Kotobuki is a supporting character of Oshi no Ko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'akane-kurokawa', 'Akane takes part in LoveNow, a dating reality show in the story, in order to advertise her theater company.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'mem-cho', 'Mem-cho, a YouTuber, is another entrant of the same dating show.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'ichigo-saito', 'Ichigo Saitō heads Strawberry Productions, the talent agency of the story.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'miyako-saito', 'Miyako Saitō, Ichigo''s wife, takes care of the daily running of the agency.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'ai-hoshino', 'As a young girl from an orphanage, Ai was signed to the agency by its president.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'ai-hoshino', 'Ai Hoshino is the star at the heart of the idol group B-Komachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'ruby-hoshino', 'Ruby puts together a fresh version of B-Komachi with the actress Kana and the YouTuber Mem-cho.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'abiko-samejima', 'Abiko Samejima draws Tokyo Blade and steps in as a producer when its stage play goes badly.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'When Oshi no Ko began, its writer''s earlier hit Kaguya-sama was still being published in that very magazine.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'The writer was busy with the live-action film of his earlier manga when he thought of the entertainment-industry story.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'series', 'oshi-no-ko', 'Yen Press holds the licence for the North American edition of the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshi_no_Ko', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'taiki-himekawa', 'Taiki Himekawa, an acclaimed stage actor, is the lead of the Tokyo Blade play when he first shows up.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('oshi-no-ko', 'character', 'melt-narushima', 'Melt Narushima, who has since worked on his acting, later takes a part in the Tokyo Blade play.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Oshi_no_Ko_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The full Japanese title is Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活, which means starting an isekai life from zero, and it is read Ri:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Tappei Nagatsuki is the author of the novels, and he also helps supervise the scripts of the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Nagatsuki began posting Re:Zero as a web novel on the site Shōsetsuka ni Narō on April 20, 2012, under the pen name Nezumi-iro Neko.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Media Factory printed the first light novel volume under its MF Bunko J label on January 24, 2014.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'As of September 2026, the main light novel series counts 46 volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Shinichirou Otsuka illustrates the light novels, and the anime credits him for the original character designs.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The first season ran 25 episodes between April and September 2016, and it opened with an hour long episode.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The second season came in two parts: the first part had 13 episodes in July to September 2020, and the second part had 12 episodes from January to March 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The third season came in two parts of eight episodes: the first part ran from October to November 2024, and the second part from February to March 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The fourth season came in two parts in 2026: the first part had 11 episodes from April to June, and the second part had 8 episodes from August to September.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'By October 2026 the TV anime had aired four seasons.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'White Fox animates Re:Zero, the same studio that made Steins;Gate.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Masahiro Shinohara has directed the anime since its third season.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Masaharu Watanabe directed the first two seasons, and he picked Kenichiro Suehiro to compose the music.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Kenichiro Suehiro composes the music of the anime, partly inspired by the style of Ennio Morricone.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Masahiro Yokotani handles the series composition of the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Two OVAs followed the first season: Memory Snow in October 2018 and The Frozen Bond in November 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Studio Puyukai made chibi shorts for the first season, called Starting Break Time From Zero and later Re:Petit.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The third season opened with a 90 minute special named Theatrical Malice.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Games based on the series include the visual novel Death or Kiss, the mobile game Lost in Memories, the tactical adventure The Prophecy of the Throne and Witch''s Re:surrection.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The arcs were adapted as manga in Monthly Comic Alive, Monthly Big Gangan and Comic Alive+.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Re:Zero joined Isekai Quartet, a chibi crossover comedy that also stars characters from KonoSuba, Overlord and The Saga of Tanya the Evil.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The Royal Capital of Lugunica was modeled on the city of Prague.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Nagatsuki first wrote fan fiction of The Familiar of Zero on Narō, then turned its other world idea into his own story.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'For the first volume Nagatsuki handed in a manuscript of more than 1,000 pages, four times the length of a normal light novel.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The series started from Nagatsuki''s wish to write Emilia, since he loves silver-haired heroines.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Subaru Natsuki, a NEET, is summoned to a fantasy world where he discovers that he can go back in time after he dies.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'subaru-natsuki', 'Subaru''s given name refers to the Pleiades star cluster, which is the Seven Sisters of Greek myth.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Nagatsuki calls the scene in which rabbits devour Subaru his most gruesome, and took the idea from The Lost World: Jurassic Park.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The royal election to pick the 42nd Queen of Lugunica has five candidates: Emilia, Crusch, Priscilla, Anastasia and Felt.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'At the mansion of Roswaal L. Mathers, the twin maids Rem and Ram work for the master, and Beatrice keeps the library.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The visual novel Death or Kiss was developed by the game company 5pb.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The first two seasons fill episodes 1 to 50, with the first season ending at episode 25 and the second season split into two parts.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_episodes', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The third season, with the Attack Arc and the Counterattack Arc, covers episodes 51 to 66, and the fourth, with the Loss Arc and the Recapture Arc, covers 67 to 85.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_episodes', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Re:Zero has used six openings so far: Redo, Paradisus-Paradoxum, Realize, Long Shot, Reweave and Recollect.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The eight endings so far run from Styx Helix by Myth & Roid to Ender Ember, which features TK from Ling Tosite Sigure.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'The fourth season opens with Recollect by Konomi Suzuki featuring the rapper Ashnikko and closes with Ender Ember by Myth & Roid with TK.', 'music', 'official', 'https://re-zero-anime.jp/tv/music/', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'subaru-natsuki', 'Subaru Natsuki, the hero, is a shut-in who gets whisked off to another world on a walk home from the corner store.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'emilia', 'Emilia is a silver-haired half-elf, and a candidate to be the 42nd queen of Lugunica.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'puck', 'Puck is Emilia''s cat-shaped spirit familiar, who works fixed hours like an office worker.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'felt', 'Felt, a teenage pickpocket of fifteen, was raised in the poorest districts of the capital.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'reinhard-van-astrea', 'Reinhard van Astrea is a knight who holds the title of Sword Saint, and the author calls him the most powerful character in the world.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'elsa-granhiert', 'Elsa Granhiert is an assassin from the northern country of Gusteko who is said to be immortal.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'rem', 'Rem is the twin sister of Ram, and she wears her blue hair parted on the left.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'ram', 'Ram is the twin sister of Rem and wears her pink hair parted on the right.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'beatrice', 'Beatrice guards the ancient magical tomes in the enormous library of Roswaal''s mansion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'roswaal-l-mathers', 'Roswaal L. Mathers holds noble rank as a margrave, serves as court wizard, and funds Emilia''s campaign for the crown.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'crusch-karsten', 'Crusch Karsten has a blessing that lets her tell when someone is lying.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'priscilla-barielle', 'Priscilla Barielle is a candidate in the royal election who had eight husbands at only 19.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'anastasia-hoshin', 'At 22 Anastasia Hoshin already leads the well known Hoshin Trading Company.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'julius-juukulius', 'Julius Juukulius is Anastasia''s knight and a member of the Royal Guard.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'otto-suwen', 'Otto Suwen is a merchant with a blessing that lets him talk to animals, plants and other beings.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'petelgeuse-romanee-conti', 'Petelgeuse Romanée-Conti is a Witch Cult leader who represents the sin of Sloth.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'satella', 'Satella is the Witch of Envy, the central figure of worship for the Witch Cult.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'garfiel-tinzel', 'Garfiel Tinzel is a demi-human who guards the Sanctuary, and he is the half-brother of Frederica Baumann.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'echidna', 'Echidna is the Witch of Greed and an important figure in the fourth arc of the series.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'regulus-corneas', 'Regulus Corneas is a Witch Cult leader who stands for the sin of Greed.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'subaru-natsuki', 'Subaru is voiced by Yūsuke Kobayashi in Japanese and by Sean Chiplock in English.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'subaru-natsuki', 'Subaru''s power Return by Death sends him back in time when he dies, while he keeps his memories.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'emilia', 'Emilia is voiced by Rie Takahashi in Japanese and by Kayli Mills in English.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'emilia', 'Emilia first introduced herself to Subaru as Satella, the name of the Witch of Envy.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'puck', 'Puck is really one of the four Great Spirits, the Beast of the End of the Eternally Frozen Lands.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'puck', 'Puck is voiced by Yumi Uchiyama in Japanese and by Erica Mendez in English.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'felt', 'Felt is later shown not to be her real name.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'reinhard-van-astrea', 'Reinhard holds the title of Sword Saint, and he becomes Felt''s knight in the royal election.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'elsa-granhiert', 'Elsa is known as the Bowel Hunter for how she kills her prey.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'elsa-granhiert', 'Elsa is the person who first kills Subaru and triggers his time rewind.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'rem', 'At first Rem hates Subaru because he has the scent of the Witch on him, and she kills him.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'rem', 'Rem is voiced by Inori Minase in Japanese and by Brianna Knickerbocker in English.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'rem', 'Rem won Best Character (Female) at the 2015 to 2016 Newtype Anime Awards.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'ram', 'Ram always calls Subaru Barusu and shows him little respect.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'ram', 'Ram lost her powers when her horn was cut off during an attack on their village.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'beatrice', 'Beatrice often ends her sentences with I suppose.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('re-zero', 'character', 'beatrice', 'Beatrice can warp any room of the mansion to the library, but cannot leave the mansion fully.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'roswaal-l-mathers', 'Roswaal is far older than he looks, since he has taken over the bodies of his descendants.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'roswaal-l-mathers', 'Roswaal lives long enough to revive Echidna, his master and the love of his life.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'crusch-karsten', 'Crusch is not easily fooled, as her blessing reveals a lie.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'priscilla-barielle', 'Priscilla had eight husbands, all of whom died mysteriously, yet her lands prosper.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'anastasia-hoshin', 'Anastasia speaks in the Kansai dialect and has the mercenary company Iron Fang.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'julius-juukulius', 'Julius is a knight who fights with Spirit Arts and is therefore nicknamed a Spirit Knight.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'otto-suwen', 'Otto''s blessing to talk with animals and plants can make him seem shady.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'petelgeuse-romanee-conti', 'Petelgeuse uses the Authority of Sloth, which shows as invisible shadow arms called Unseen Hands.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'satella', 'Satella killed the six other Witches of Sin 400 years ago and was sealed in a shrine at the Grand Cascade.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'garfiel-tinzel', 'Garfiel is the guard of the Sanctuary and first acts as a secondary antagonist in the fourth arc.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'echidna', 'Echidna is fascinated by Subaru''s Return by Death and longs to become his advisor.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'character', 'regulus-corneas', 'Regulus holds the Witch Factors of Greed, and long ago he killed his family and his whole village.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Re:Zero_characters', 'published'), ('re-zero', 'series', 're-zero', 'Re:Zero is a Japanese light novel series by Tappei Nagatsuki, illustrated by Shinichirou Otsuka.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re:Zero', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'In Japanese the title is 美少女戦士セーラームーン, read Bishōjo Senshi Sērā Mūn; it was first rendered in English as Pretty Soldier Sailor Moon and later as Pretty Guardian Sailor Moon.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Naoko Takeuchi both wrote and drew the Sailor Moon manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Kodansha''s girls'' magazine Nakayoshi ran the manga from the end of December 1991 until early February 1997.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'The original edition filled 18 volumes, released between July 1992 and April 1997.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'The manga won the 1993 Kodansha Manga Award in the shōjo category.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Toei Animation''s 1992 anime aired on TV Asahi from 7 March 1992 to 8 February 1997 and totals 200 episodes across 5 seasons.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'The manga''s five story arcs match the anime''s five seasons: 46, 43, 38, 39 and 34 episodes in 1992 anime order.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Junichi Sato directed the first season, Kunihiko Ikuhara the next three, and Takuya Igarashi the last.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Sailor Moon Crystal, Toei''s reboot, has 39 episodes in three seasons; the third adapts the manga''s Infinity arc.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon_Crystal', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'The Crystal story continues in two-part films: Eternal in 2021 covers the Dream arc and Cosmos in 2023 covers the Stars arc.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon_Crystal', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'One opening, Moonlight Densetsu, served the first 166 episodes: DALI sang it for the first two seasons and Moon Lips for the next two.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'The last season has its own opening, Sailor Star Song by Kae Hanazawa, and the finale closes on Moon Lips'' Moonlight Densetsu.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'usagi-tsukino', 'Usagi Tsukino is a main character of Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'ami-mizuno', 'Ami Mizuno is a supporting character of Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'rei-hino', 'Rei Hino is a supporting character of Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'makoto-kino', 'Makoto Kino is a supporting character of Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'minako-aino', 'Minako Aino is a supporting character of Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'mamoru-chiba', 'Mamoru Chiba is a supporting character of Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'luna', 'Luna is a supporting character of Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'artemis', 'Artemis is a supporting character of Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'queen-beryl', 'Queen Beryl is an antagonist of Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'chibiusa', 'Chibiusa is a supporting character of Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'haruka-tenoh', 'Haruka Tenoh is a supporting character of Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'michiru-kaioh', 'Michiru Kaioh is a supporting character of Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'ami-mizuno', 'Ami, the quiet genius, sits in the same classroom as Usagi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'makoto-kino', 'Makoto, tall and strong, is another girl in the class of Usagi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Gurio is a glasses-wearing boy who studies in the class of Usagi and has a crush on her.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'rei-hino', 'Rei is the one friend who goes to a separate private school from the rest of the girls.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'usagi-tsukino', 'Usagi is a glutton for sweets, and cake appears as a favourite in the manga.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon_(character)', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'makoto-kino', 'Makoto looks after herself and enjoys housekeeping, cooking and tending plants.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Ikuko, the mother of Usagi, is usually seen busy in the kitchen, scolding her about school marks.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'ami-mizuno', 'Ami loves learning and reading, and she is rumoured to have an IQ of 300.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Ikuko Tsukino is the mother of Usagi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Kenji Tsukino is a magazine reporter and later editor-in-chief, and the father of Usagi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Shingo is the little brother of Usagi, the only Guardian with a known sibling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Luna, Artemis and Diana are speaking cats from the planet Mau, and they advise their owners.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Phobos and Deimos are two pet crows kept by Rei at the shrine and named for the moons of Mars.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'chibiusa', 'Chibiusa is a girl from the 30th century and the daughter of the future queen and king.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'usagi-tsukino', 'Usagi later rules the Earth as Neo-Queen Serenity in the 30th century.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon_(character)', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Queen Serenity was the ruling queen of the Moon during the Silver Millennium, long ago.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'At the start, Sailors Mercury, Mars, Jupiter and Venus are the friends who stand beside Sailor Moon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Sailors Uranus, Neptune, Pluto and Saturn arrive later in the story as four extra Guardians.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Sailor Pluto uses the Garnet Orb to attack and to stop time for a short while.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'haruka-tenoh', 'Haruka carries the Space Sword as her talisman when fighting as Sailor Uranus.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'michiru-kaioh', 'Michiru has the Deep Aqua Mirror, which helps her intuition and shows hidden evil.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Hotaru, as Sailor Saturn, wields the Silence Glaive, a weapon that makes barriers.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Ail and An belong to the Hell Tree aliens, a group made up for the anime only.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Yuichiro, a boy who helps at the shrine, was made up for the anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Naru, Usagi''s best friend, also shows up in the manga, where she reaches the same high school.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'queen-beryl', 'Queen Beryl founded the Dark Kingdom, the first enemy faced by the Guardians.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Zirconia heads the Dead Moon Circus, who search for the Golden Crystal.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Sailor Galaxia leads Shadow Galactica, a band of corrupted Guardians stealing Star Seeds.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Princess Kakyuu rules the kingdom of Kinmoku, which the villain Galaxia destroys.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'mamoru-chiba', 'Mamoru Chiba is a student a bit older than Usagi, who also fights as Tuxedo Mask.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'Motoki Furuhata works at the Crown Game Center arcade and fruit parlor and is no relative; Usagi just calls him Big Brother.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'The Black Moon Clan, led by Prince Demand, are terrorists from the 30th century.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'series', 'sailor-moon', 'On Earth the three Starlights pose as a male pop band called the Three Lights, under the names Seiya, Taiki and Yaten Kou.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sailor_Moon_characters', 'published'), ('sailor-moon', 'character', 'usagi-tsukino', 'Usagi is a glutton for sweets, yet she is said to dislike carrots.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailor_Moon_(character)', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The title is written in capital letters as SAKAMOTO DAYS, and in Japanese it is サカモトデイズ, romanized as Sakamoto Deizu.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Yuto Suzuki writes and draws the manga on his own.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The manga runs in Weekly Shōnen Jump, where it has been published since November 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Shueisha publishes the collected volumes in Japan under its Jump Comics label.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'A one-shot simply called Sakamoto appeared in Jump Giga on December 26, 2019, a year before the weekly series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The weekly serialization began on November 21, 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'As of August 2026 the series has 28 collected volumes, and the story is still running.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The first collected volume came out on April 2, 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'By August 2026 the manga had more than 18 million copies in circulation.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Circulation grew from 2.2 million in October 2022 to 12 million in June 2025 and 15 million two months later.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'A feared hitman retires for love, marries, becomes a father and runs a convenience store, until the underworld finds him again.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'To date his wife, Sakamoto accepted her condition that he never kill again, and he has to protect his family under that rule.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Suzuki fixed the look of the hero by asking why a strong man would be fat, and answered that he retired and perhaps got married.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The idea of a strong, heavy fighter was partly inspired by the comedy film Enter the Fat Dragon, and The Equalizer and the John Wick films also influenced Suzuki.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Among the influences of Suzuki are Katsuhiro Otomo, Takehiko Inoue and Hiroya Oku, along with the movies of Christopher Nolan.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Suzuki''s background in the Nihonga style of painting helps him create interesting page layouts, says his editor.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'His editor says that pairing the quiet hero with a mind reader, Shin, revealed the motives of the hero and let the comedy flourish.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Suzuki first drew dark one-shot stories and picked a lighter tone for Sakamoto Days because weekly serialization demanded it.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The story entered its final battle on August 4, 2025, and on July 21, 2026 it was announced that the series was heading to its climax.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'At the 2021 Next Manga Awards the series placed sixth out of 50 nominees in the print category and won the U-Next Prize.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The series earned a nomination in 2022 for the Shogakukan Manga Award, edition 68, among shonen titles.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Bookstore employees across Japan ranked the series sixth in their list of recommended comics of 2022.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The manga is published in English at the same time as in Japan by Viz Media and on Manga Plus, and Viz began selling print volumes on April 5, 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'A spin-off, Sakamoto Holidays, by Tetsu Ōkawa, a former assistant of Suzuki, began in Saikyō Jump on July 4, 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The novel Assassin''s Method, with an original story by Renka Misaki, was released on April 4, 2023, and its English edition on July 28, 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'A second novel by Renka Misaki, Assassin''s Blues, was released on December 4, 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'A smartphone puzzle game, Dangerous Puzzle, developed by Goodroid, was released on April 2, 2025.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Reports in May 2024 revealed that TMS Entertainment would make a TV anime of the series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The anime premiered on January 11, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_episodes', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'TMS Entertainment produced the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Masaki Watanabe directed the first season, and Daisuke Nakajima is set to direct the second one.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Taku Kishimoto wrote the scripts, Yō Moriyama designed the characters and Yuki Hayashi composed the music.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_episodes', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The first cour has 11 episodes, broadcast between January 11 and March 22, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_episodes', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The second cour of the anime has 11 episodes too and aired from July 15 to September 23, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_episodes', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The first season adds up to 22 episodes in two cours.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Netflix licensed the anime worldwide, with episodes released at the same time as the Japanese broadcast on TV Tokyo.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'Sakamoto Days was the most watched anime on Netflix worldwide in the first half of 2025, with 24.4 million views.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'A second season was announced in December 2025 at Jump Festa and is set to premiere in January 2027, as of October 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'A live action film directed by Yūichi Fukuda, with Ren Meguro as Sakamoto, opened in Japan on April 29, 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'On October 30, 2026, Amazon Prime Video is set to start streaming the live action film around the world.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The first cour opens with Hashire Sakamoto and ends with Futsū, but episode 7 uses a special ending, Somebody Help Us, by Vaundy.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The second cour uses Method by Kroi as the opening and Dandelion by Go!Go!Vanillas as the ending.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakamoto_Days', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The story as adapted so far is two cours of 11 episodes, and the manga has moved on to its final battle.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_episodes', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'series', 'sakamoto-days', 'The anime starts with an episode called The Legendary Hit Man, and episode 7 is called Jurassic Bastard.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_episodes', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'taro-sakamoto', 'Taro Sakamoto is a legendary ex-hitman turned convenience store owner, heavier and calmer now but still extremely skilled.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'taro-sakamoto', 'Sakamoto keeps only about 30 percent of his prime strength, but in extreme moments he loses all his fat and becomes twice as powerful as before.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'taro-sakamoto', 'Tomokazu Sugita voices Sakamoto in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'shin-asakura', 'Shin Asakura is a 21 year old former hitman, known as Shin the Clairvoyant for reading minds, who works at Sakamoto''s store.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'shin-asakura', 'A running gag has Sakamoto imagine killing Shin when he is annoyed, and Shin always senses it.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'shin-asakura', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki voices Shin in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'lu-xiaotang', 'Lu Xiaotang, aged 18, is a scatterbrained girl whose father led a Chinese crime syndicate, and she later works in the store.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'lu-xiaotang', 'Lu fights with a style that mixes Tai Chi with Drunken Fist.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'lu-xiaotang', 'Ayane Sakura voices Lu in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'aoi-sakamoto', 'Aoi Sakamoto is the wife of Sakamoto, a former cashier whom he fell for at first sight.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'aoi-sakamoto', 'Nao Tōyama voices Aoi in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'hana-sakamoto', 'Hana Sakamoto is the 6 year old daughter of Sakamoto and Aoi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'heisuke-mashimo', 'Heisuke Mashimo is an emotional, gullible hitman who specializes in sniping and holds an all-time record at the JCC.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'heisuke-mashimo', 'Heisuke has a pet parrot called Piisuke that acts as his spotter.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'heisuke-mashimo', 'Ryōta Suzuki voices Heisuke in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'yoichi-nagumo', 'Yoichi Nagumo is a cheerful old classmate and colleague of Sakamoto, a member of the Order who loves to disguise himself.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'yoichi-nagumo', 'Natsuki Hanae voices Nagumo in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'shishiba', 'Shishiba is a strict, cynical member of the Order who hates onions, and he fights with a hammer.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'osaragi', 'Osaragi is the youngest member of the Order, a snack loving, childish killer who fights with a large circular saw.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'osaragi', 'Saori Hayami voices Osaragi in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'hyo', 'Hyo is a harsh member of the Order who cares about the safety of others and fights with brass knuckles.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'boiled', 'Boiled is a former classmate of Sakamoto from the assassin agency Dondenkai, who fights with explosive balls and a rocket punch gauntlet.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'lu-wutang', 'Lu Wutang is the former bodyguard of Lu Xiaotang, a weak fighter but a master strategist who ends up working at the store.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'takamura', 'Takamura is the most formidable assassin of the Japan Assassin Association, a frail looking old man with a katana.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'takamura', 'Hōchū Ōtsuka voices Takamura in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'kanaguri', 'Kanaguri is an eccentric movie director famous for assassin films, and a member of the Order who works in secret for X.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'akira-akao', 'Akira Akao is a timid girl who befriends Sakamoto during the JCC entrance exam, and she is faster than she looks.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'akira-akao', 'M.A.O voices Akira in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'natsuki-seba', 'Natsuki Seba is a sarcastic student and gifted weapons maker whose invisibility suit makes him a tricky opponent.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'natsuki-seba', 'Nobuhiko Okamoto voices Natsuki in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'kei-uzuki', 'Kei Uzuki, also called X or Slur, is a serial killer who hunts assassins in order to dismantle the JAA.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'kei-uzuki', 'Daisuke Namikawa voices Uzuki in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'rion-akao', 'Rion Akao is a skilled assassin and a classmate of Sakamoto, gifted at seeing lethal paths, a talent shared by her niece Akira.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'gaku', 'Gaku is the lazy right-hand man of X, often asleep or playing video games, who fights with a mace that has a blaster in its head.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('sakamoto-days', 'character', 'kashima', 'Kashima is a cyborg in a reindeer mask who works for X and has weapons built into his body.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sakamoto_Days_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The title is written in capital letters as SLAM DUNK, and in Japanese it is スラムダンク.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Takehiko Inoue wrote and drew the manga on his own.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The manga ran in Weekly Shōnen Jump for its whole serialization.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Shueisha published the collected volumes in Japan under its Jump Comics label.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The first chapter appeared in Weekly Shōnen Jump on October 1, 1990.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The weekly run ended on June 17, 1996, after almost six years.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The original edition fills 31 volumes, from February 1991 to October 1996.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The story is told in 276 chapters.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Later editions were a 24 volume deluxe set in 2001 and 2002 and a 20 volume new edition in 2018.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Before the series Inoue drew a one-shot, Aka ga Suki, that already held early versions of Sakuragi and Haruko.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Inoue has loved basketball since his own high school years, and that love is the root of the series.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Inoue began playing basketball to be popular with girls and then grew to like the sport itself, as Sakuragi does in the story.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'As research Inoue watched the NBA Finals in America and the Barcelona Summer Games of 1992.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Letters from readers who had taken up basketball because of the manga pushed Inoue to draw better basketball games.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'In 2006 Inoue and Shueisha created the Slam Dunk Scholarship, which sends a winning teenager to a prep school in America.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'In 1994 the series took the Shogakukan Manga Award, the 40th edition, for shonen manga.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'In 2010 the Japan Basketball Association gave Inoue special commendations for helping to popularize basketball in Japan.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'A poll of nearly 79,000 people for the 10th Japan Media Arts Festival in 2006 voted Slam Dunk the best manga of all time.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'In the TV Asahi poll Manga Sōsenkyo 2021, only One Piece and Demon Slayer ranked above Slam Dunk, which came third.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Worldwide circulation had passed 185 million copies as of 2025.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Volumes 21 to 23 held the manga record for first printing, at 2.5 million copies, until it was broken in 2002.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Helped by a new edition, Slam Dunk sold 5.2 million copies in 2018 and ranked fourth among manga that year.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Viz Media published Slam Dunk in English from September 2008 to December 2013, after an earlier run by Gutsoon! in Raijin Comics.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'In June 2026 Viz Media announced a deluxe edition of the series, set to start in the second quarter of 2027.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The epilogue 10 Days After was drawn on 23 chalkboards in a closed school and shown to the public for three days in December 2004.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Toei Animation produced the TV anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'TV Asahi aired the anime between October 16, 1993 and March 23, 1996.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The TV series has 101 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Nobutaka Nishizawa directed the TV series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Takanobu Masuda composed the music of episodes 1 to 61, and BMF took over for episodes 62 to 101.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The anime follows the manga but leaves out the games of the National Tournament.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Baad sang the opening for the first 61 episodes, and Zyyg replaced it for episodes 62 to 101.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_episodes', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Four songs closed the episodes in turn: Maki Ohguro, then Wands, then Manish and finally Zard.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_episodes', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'A railroad crossing of the Enoshima Electric Railway, shown in the opening credits of the anime, became a fan pilgrimage site so crowded that guards were assigned to it.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'Toei made four short films in 1994 and 1995, starting with Slam Dunk on March 12, 1994 and a second one on July 9, 1994.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The first three anime films earned a combined 6.53 billion yen in Japan by 1995.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'On January 7, 2021 Inoue announced a new anime film, The First Slam Dunk, with himself as director and writer.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The First Slam Dunk opened in Japanese theaters on December 3, 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_First_Slam_Dunk', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'As of October 2026 the film had earned about 279 million dollars worldwide, the most ever for a basketball film.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_First_Slam_Dunk', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The film earned the 2023 Japan Academy Prize in the animation category.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_First_Slam_Dunk', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The film opens with Love Rockets by the Birthday and ends with Dai-Zero Kan by 10-Feet.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_First_Slam_Dunk', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The official film site announced that The First Slam Dunk returns to Japanese cinemas from March 20 to April 1, 2027.', 'history', 'official', 'https://slamdunk-movie.jp/', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The basketball player J. R. Sakuragi took part of his Japanese surname from the hero when he became a Japanese citizen.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slam_Dunk_(manga)', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'This data file cuts the story into eight blocks from the episode list: the seven blocks of the anime and the manga-only National Tournament.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_episodes', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'series', 'slam-dunk', 'The film centers on Miyagi and retells the last match of the manga against Sannoh, with new flashbacks and an epilogue.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_First_Slam_Dunk', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'hanamichi-sakuragi', 'Hanamichi Sakuragi is the hot-tempered first-year who plays power forward for Shohoku in the number 10 jersey.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'hanamichi-sakuragi', 'Before high school girls turned him down fifty times, and then he fell for Haruko Akagi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'hanamichi-sakuragi', 'Sakuragi leads a feared gang called the Sakuragi Legion, with four close friends.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'hanamichi-sakuragi', 'Takeshi Kusao voices Sakuragi in the TV anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'takenori-akagi', 'Takenori Akagi is the captain and center of Shohoku, a senior in the number 4 jersey and the older brother of Haruko.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'takenori-akagi', 'Sakuragi calls the captain Gori, because of his huge physical presence.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'takenori-akagi', 'Kiyoyuki Yanada voices Akagi in the TV anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'kaede-rukawa', 'Kaede Rukawa is the cold and aloof small forward of Shohoku in the number 11 jersey, and the great rival of Sakuragi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'kaede-rukawa', 'Hikaru Midorikawa voices Rukawa in the TV anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'kaede-rukawa', 'At the Kanagawa Interhigh Tournament Rukawa was named among the top five players, and he was the only first-year to be picked.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'haruko-akagi', 'Haruko Akagi is the younger sister of the captain and the love interest of Sakuragi, who has a crush on someone else.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'haruko-akagi', 'Haruko noticed the talent of Sakuragi when he tried to dunk a ball at her request, and she judged him good enough for the team.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'haruko-akagi', 'Akiko Hiramatsu voices Haruko in the TV anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'ayako', 'Ayako is the strong-willed manager of the team, who trains Sakuragi in the basics such as dribbling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'mitsuyoshi-anzai', 'Mitsuyoshi Anzai is the overweight, beloved coach of Shohoku, who was once a strict college coach known as the White-Haired Devil.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'mitsuyoshi-anzai', 'Tomomichi Nishimura voices Anzai in the TV anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'yohei-mito', 'Yohei Mito is the deputy of the Sakuragi gang and the best friend of Sakuragi since childhood, and the best fighter after him.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'kiminobu-kogure', 'Kiminobu Kogure is the gentle vice-captain of Shohoku in the number 5 jersey, a senior who rarely appears without his glasses.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'kiminobu-kogure', 'Sakuragi calls him Megane-kun, which means glasses guy.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'hisashi-mitsui', 'Hisashi Mitsui is the shooting guard of Shohoku in the number 14 jersey, a former junior high MVP who came back to the team.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'hisashi-mitsui', 'Mitsui is best known as the three point specialist of the team.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'hisashi-mitsui', 'Ryōtarō Okiayu voices Mitsui in the TV anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'ryota-miyagi', 'Ryota Miyagi is the small but very fast point guard of Shohoku, who wears the number 7 jersey.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'ryota-miyagi', 'Miyagi was turned down ten times in love, far fewer than the fifty of Sakuragi.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'ryota-miyagi', 'Yoku Shioya voices Miyagi in the TV anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'akira-sendoh', 'Akira Sendoh is the easygoing ace of Ryonan, a small forward with a smile who often arrives late to practice.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'akira-sendoh', 'Hōchū Ōtsuka voices Sendoh in the TV anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'jun-uozumi', 'Jun Uozumi is the captain and center of Ryonan, who sees the Shohoku captain as his rival, though without hostility.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'jun-uozumi', 'Sakuragi calls him Boss Monkey, because he is built like the Shohoku captain and is even taller.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'shinichi-maki', 'Shinichi Maki is the captain and point guard of Kainan, called the best player in Kanagawa and twice prefectural MVP.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'shinichi-maki', 'Hisao Egawa voices Maki in the TV anime.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'nobunaga-kiyota', 'Nobunaga Kiyota is the boastful small forward of Kainan, who resembles Sakuragi in attitude but has the skills to back it up.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'nobunaga-kiyota', 'Kiyota calls Sakuragi the Red Monkey, and Sakuragi calls him the Wild Monkey.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'soichiro-jin', 'Soichiro Jin is the calm shooting guard of Kainan, who built a deadly three point shot by taking 500 every day after practice.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'kenji-fujima', 'Kenji Fujima is both the point guard and the coach of Shoyo, and he goes on court only when his team truly needs him.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'toru-hanagata', 'Toru Hanagata is the glasses-wearing center of Shoyo, known for his hard-to-block fade away shot.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'kazunari-fukatsu', 'Kazunari Fukatsu is the calm point guard and captain of Sannoh, who adds an odd word to nearly everything he says.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'eiji-sawakita', 'Eiji Sawakita is the ace of Sannoh, taught basketball by his father, and counted as the best all-round player in the country.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('slam-dunk', 'character', 'masashi-kawata', 'Masashi Kawata is the top high school center in Japan, who grew very tall in a year and so learned skills that other centers lack.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Slam_Dunk_characters', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'In Korea the story is titled 나 혼자만 레벨업, a phrase that English fans also translate as Only I Level Up.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'Written in Revised Romanization, the Korean name of Solo Leveling reads Na Honjaman Rebereop.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'The story began as a web novel by Chugong, first posted on the KakaoPage platform on 25 July 2016.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'In print, the novel comes from the publisher D&C Media, under its Papyrus label, starting 4 November 2016.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'The webtoon opened on KakaoPage in March 2018 and ended with its last chapter in December 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'The comic was split in two: the first season wrapped up on 19 March 2020, and a second one followed from August 2020 until December 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'The anime was animated by A-1 Pictures.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'Shunsuke Nakashige directed the anime, with Noboru Kimura on the scripts and Hiroyuki Sawano composing the music.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling_season_1', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'The film Beyond the System is announced, so the story after Season 2 is still read on the page rather than seen in the series.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'Over its two seasons the anime counts 25 episodes in total.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'Season 1 opens with Level by SawanoHiroyuki[nZk]: Tomorrow X Together and closes with Request by Krage.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling_season_1', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'Season 2 opens with Reawaker by LiSA (feat. Felix of Stray Kids) and closes with Un-Apex by TK from Ling Tosite Sigure.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling_season_2', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'A recap special named How to Get Stronger covered the first seven episodes of season one.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling_season_1', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'A compilation film of Season 1, Solo Leveling: ReAwakening, was shown in Japan with the first two episodes of Season 2 in late 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'The anime took the top prize, Anime of the Year, at the 9th Crunchyroll Anime Awards in 2025.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'Kakao revealed a follow-up webtoon, Solo Leveling: Ragnarok, in April 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'The anime adaptation was first announced at the Anime Expo convention in 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'The anime''s official site shows a banner announcing that a theatrical film, Beyond the System, is in production.', 'history', 'official', 'https://sololeveling-anime.net/', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'sung-jin-woo', 'Sung Jin-woo starts out as a notoriously weak E-Rank Hunter, picked by a game-like power called The System.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'igris', 'Igris is given the title Blood-Red Commander and is a knight with outstanding sword skill.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'cha-hae-in', 'Cha Hae-in is an S-Rank Hunter whose strength lies in fighting with a sword.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'thomas-andre', 'The American Hunter Thomas Andre is nicknamed Goliath and counts as the strongest in his country.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'ashborn', 'Ashborn rules the dead as a king and holds the Monarch of Shadows title.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'antares', 'Antares is the King of Dragons and is counted as the most powerful of all the Monarchs.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'sung-jin-woo', 'Sung Jin-woo is a main character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'sung-jin-ah', 'Sung Jin-ah is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'park-kyung-hye', 'Park Kyung-hye is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'yoo-jin-ho', 'Yoo Jin-ho is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'lee-joo-hee', 'Lee Joo-hee is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'song-chi-yul', 'Song Chi-yul is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'igris', 'Igris is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'cha-hae-in', 'Cha Hae-in is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'go-gun-hee', 'Go Gun-hee is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'baek-yoon-ho', 'Baek Yoon-ho is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'choi-jong-in', 'Choi Jong-in is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'kang-tae-shik', 'Kang Tae-shik is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'min-byung-gyu', 'Min Byung-gyu is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'beru', 'Beru is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'bellion', 'Bellion is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'ashborn', 'Ashborn is an antagonist of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'sung-il-hwan', 'Sung Il-hwan is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'sung-suho', 'Sung Suho is a main character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'thomas-andre', 'Thomas Andre is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'liu-zhigang', 'Liu Zhigang is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'christopher-reed', 'Christopher Reed is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'siddharth-bachchan', 'Siddharth Bachchan is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'lennart-niermann', 'Lennart Niermann is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'goto-ryuji', 'Goto Ryuji is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'lim-tae-gyu', 'Lim Tae-gyu is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'ma-dong-wook', 'Ma Dong-wook is a supporting character of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'antares', 'Antares is an antagonist of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'rakan', 'Rakan is an antagonist of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'sillad', 'Sillad is an antagonist of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'querehsha', 'Querehsha is an antagonist of Solo Leveling.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'The second season of the anime begins right where the first one stopped, with no time skip between them.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling_season_2', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'Beyond the System is the name of a sequel film that continues the anime on the big screen.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'Netflix announced in July 2025 that it is making a live-action Solo Leveling drama, cast with actors instead of drawings.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'In the live-action series, the actor Byeon Woo-seok is cast to portray the hero Sung Jin-woo.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'A rare and overwhelmingly strong double dungeon almost destroys Jin-woo''s whole party, and it leads to his meeting The System.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'lee-joo-hee', 'Lee Joo-hee, a healer, gets out of the double dungeon alive together with Jin-woo.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'song-chi-yul', 'Song Chi-yul, a kumdo teacher and C-Rank Hunter, is among the few Hunters who walk out of the double dungeon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'baek-yoon-ho', 'Baek Yoon-ho, an S-Rank Hunter, leads the White Tiger Guild as its master.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'baek-yoon-ho', 'Baek Yoon-ho fights with magic that changes his body into other forms.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'baek-yoon-ho', 'Of all the S-Rank Hunters, Baek Yoon-ho is the first to realise that Jin-woo can grow stronger.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'character', 'choi-jong-in', 'Choi Jong-in is the S-Rank fire mage who runs the Hunters Guild.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'The Shadow Army is an undying host of soldiers revived through the might of the Shadow Monarch.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'Shadow soldiers differ from the summons of other Hunters because they can grow stronger and even talk.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('solo-leveling', 'series', 'solo-leveling', 'Solo Leveling started in South Korea as a fantasy web novel by Chugong.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solo_Leveling', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'In Japan the title is written スパイファミリー, a katakana spelling of the English words spy and family.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/SPY%C3%97FAMILY', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'Tatsuya Endo both writes and draws the Spy × Family manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'By the spring of 2026 the chapters filled seventeen collected tankōbon volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'Two studios share the animation, Wit Studio and CloverWorks.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'Kazuhiro Furuhashi directed the early seasons, with Takahiro Harada credited on season 2 and Yukiko Imai on season 3.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'Three seasons of the TV anime, 50 episodes in total, aired on TV Tokyo between April 2022 and December 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'Each cour of the anime has its own pair of songs, from Official Hige Dandism and Gen Hoshino in the first to Spitz and Lilas Ikuta in the third season.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'Circulation had climbed past forty-two million copies by April 2026, which puts the manga among the biggest sellers ever.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'anya-forger', 'Anya can read minds, a gift that lets her see through the secret jobs of both of her new parents.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'yor-forger', 'Yor works at City Hall by day, but in her other line of work she goes by the Thorn Princess.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Spy_%C3%97_Family_characters', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'bond-forger', 'Bond the family dog can see short glimpses of the future, which only Anya knows about.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'A theatrical film, Code: White, reached Japanese cinemas in December 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'The Tokyo Anime Award Festival named the series its Animation of the Year.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'anya-forger', 'In a FinT survey of Generation Z in Japan, the line about Anya liking peanuts came out as the most trending phrase of 2022.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'Takuya Eguchi, Atsumi Tanezaki and Saori Hayami voice the three Forgers in the Japanese cast.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'Loid''s mission is code-named Operation Strix, and Sylvia Sherwood is the handler who oversees it.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Spy_%C3%97_Family_characters', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'loid-forger', 'Loid Forger is a main character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'anya-forger', 'Anya Forger is a main character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'yor-forger', 'Yor Forger is a main character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'bond-forger', 'Bond Forger is a main character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'franky-franklin', 'Franky Franklin is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'sylvia-sherwood', 'Sylvia Sherwood is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'henry-henderson', 'Henry Henderson is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'yuri-briar', 'Yuri Briar is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'damian-desmond', 'Damian Desmond is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'becky-blackbell', 'Becky Blackbell is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'fiona-frost', 'Fiona Frost is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'camilla', 'Camilla is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'millie', 'Millie is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'sharon', 'Sharon is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'emile-elman', 'Emile Elman is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'ewen-egeburg', 'Ewen Egeburg is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'donovan-desmond', 'Donovan Desmond is an antagonist of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'dominic', 'Dominic is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_%C3%97_Family_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'melinda-desmond', 'Melinda Desmond is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/SPY%C3%97FAMILY', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'martha-marriott', 'Martha Marriott is a supporting character of Spy × Family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Spy_%C3%97_Family_characters', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'In the film Code: White, the class of Anya sets up a cooking contest, where the winner may gain a Stella star.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_×_Family_Code:_White', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'The principal, who judges the contest, is a fan of a dessert named Meremere in the film Code: White.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_×_Family_Code:_White', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'Meremere comes from Frigis, a city in the north, so Loid takes his family there.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_×_Family_Code:_White', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'Anya opens a suitcase on the train and eats the chocolate inside, which hides a microfilm.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_×_Family_Code:_White', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'At a restaurant in Frigis, Colonel Snidel grabs the last Meremere right in front of the Forgers.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_×_Family_Code:_White', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'Cherry liquor is the last ingredient that Loid needs to bake the Meremere dessert.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spy_×_Family_Code:_White', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'emile-elman', 'Emile Elman, a follower of Damian, has a sweet tooth.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Spy_×_Family_characters', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'bond-forger', 'Bond tries hard to dodge the meals cooked by Yor, since his glimpse of the future told him they could kill him.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Spy_×_Family_characters', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'Eden Academy hands out a Stella Star as a reward for strong results in class or behaviour.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Spy_×_Family_characters', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'series', 'spy-x-family', 'A Tonitrus Bolt is a mark of punishment at Eden Academy, the opposite of a Stella Star.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Spy_×_Family_characters', 'published'), ('spy-x-family', 'character', 'yor-forger', 'Yor Forger is voiced in Japanese by Saori Hayami.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Spy_×_Family_characters', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The title is stylized as STEINS;GATE in capitals, and its katakana reading is Shutainzu Gēto.', 'fun', 'wikidata', 'https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q20590069', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The original Steins;Gate visual novel was developed by the two companies 5pb. and Nitroplus.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The visual novel first came out on the Xbox 360 on October 15, 2009.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'Chiyomaru Shikura planned the game, Naotaka Hayashi wrote the scenario and the artist Huke designed the characters.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'Takeshi Abo composed the music of the original visual novel.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'Steins;Gate belongs to the Science Adventure series and is its second game, after Chaos;Head.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The title has no fixed meaning: it is built from the German word Stein, which means stone, and is a nod to the physicist Albert Einstein.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The story takes place in the summer of 2010 in the district of Akihabara.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The hero founds the Future Gadget Laboratory, a small lab in Akihabara where the friends build their inventions.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The PhoneWave, a device the friends have been developing, turns out to be a time machine.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'D-Mails are messages sent to the past, and they begin to change the timeline in big ways.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'Okabe has the Reading Steiner ability, which lets him notice changes between different timelines, when nobody else can.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'Different timelines are called world lines, and a divergence meter is used to track how far they differ.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The game is called a speculative science adventure, with branching scenarios that lead to several endings.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The Steins;Gate anime was animated by the studio White Fox.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The first anime has 24 episodes, which aired from April to September 2011.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The bonus episode Egoistic Poriomania was released on February 22, 2012, with the last disc volume.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Steins;Gate_episodes', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'Jukki Hanada handled the series composition of the first anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The film Load Region of Déjà Vu reached Japanese theaters in 2013.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The sequel visual novel Steins;Gate 0 came out in Japan on December 10, 2015.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_0', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The anime of Steins;Gate 0 began in April 2018 and has 23 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_0', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The Steins;Gate 0 anime was directed by Kenichi Kawamura and animated at White Fox.', 'history', 'official', 'https://steinsgate0-anime.com/', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'Steins;Gate 0 takes place on the Beta timeline, where Okabe becomes a tester of the Amadeus artificial intelligence.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_0', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'To help a woman called Kagari, who has lost her memory, Okabe builds the PhoneWave again in Steins;Gate 0.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_0', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The neuroscientist Alexis Leskinen turns out to work for an intelligence agency called Strategic Focus.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_0', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The story of Steins;Gate 0 leads, through its final ending, to the True End route of the first game.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_0', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'At the Famitsu Awards the visual novel received an Excellence prize, called the Game of Excellence.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'A live-action Steins;Gate series was announced as a project of Skydance Television.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'series', 'steins-gate', 'The PC version in English was published in North America by JAST USA.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'theme', 'op-1', 'The opening of the first anime is Hacking to the Gate, sung by Kanako Itō.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Steins;Gate_episodes', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'theme', 'ed-1', 'The normal ending of the first anime is a song by Yui Sakakibara, Toki Tsukasadoru Jūni no Meiyaku.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Steins;Gate_episodes', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'theme', 'ed-2', 'Episode 23 closes with a different ending, Skyclad no Kansokusha, performed by Kanako Itō.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Steins;Gate_episodes', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'theme', 'op-2', 'Steins;Gate 0 opens with Fatima, performed by Kanako Itō.', 'music', 'official', 'https://steinsgate0-anime.com/', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'theme', 'ed-3', 'In the first episode of Steins;Gate 0 the ending is Amadeus, by Kanako Itō.', 'music', 'press', 'https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/encyclopedia/anime.php?id=20446', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'theme', 'ed-4', 'Last Game, by Zwei, is the ending used in most episodes of Steins;Gate 0.', 'music', 'official', 'https://steinsgate0-anime.com/', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'theme', 'ed-5', 'World-Line, sung by Asami Imai, ends several episodes in the second half of Steins;Gate 0.', 'music', 'press', 'https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/encyclopedia/anime.php?id=20446', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'theme', 'ed-6', 'Gate of Steiner, by Eri Sasaki, closes the final episode of Steins;Gate 0.', 'music', 'press', 'https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/encyclopedia/anime.php?id=20446', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'rintaro-okabe', 'Rintaro Okabe is written 岡部 倫太郎 in Japanese and is the founder of the Future Gadget Laboratory.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'kurisu-makise', 'Kurisu Makise is written 牧瀬 紅莉栖 in Japanese and is a neuroscience researcher.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'mayuri-shiina', 'Mayuri Shiina is written 椎名 まゆり in Japanese and is a childhood friend of Okabe.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'itaru-hashida', 'Itaru Hashida, nicknamed Daru, is written 橋田 至 in Japanese and is a hacker.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'moeka-kiryu', 'Moeka Kiryu is written 桐生 萌郁 in Japanese and is a tech journalist.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'luka-urushibara', 'Luka Urushibara is written 漆原 るか in Japanese and is a friend of Okabe.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'faris-nyannyan', 'Faris NyanNyan, whose real name is Rumiho Akiha, is written フェイリス・ニャンニャン in Japanese and works in a maid cafe.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'suzuha-amane', 'Suzuha Amane is written 阿万音 鈴羽 in Japanese and is a time traveler.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'yugo-tennouji', 'Yugo Tennouji is written 天王寺 裕吾 in Japanese and is Okabe''s landlord, also known as Mr. Braun.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'nae-tennouji', 'Nae Tennouji is written 天王寺 綯 in Japanese and is the daughter of Yugo Tennouji.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'doctor-nakabachi', 'Doctor Nakabachi is written ドクター中鉢 in Japanese; his real name is Shouichi Makise, and he is the father of Kurisu.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'maho-hiyajo', 'Maho Hiyajo is a neuroscientist and colleague of Kurisu who appears in Steins;Gate 0.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_0', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'rintaro-okabe', 'Okabe holds the number 001 in the Future Gadget Laboratory, as Lab Member No. 001.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('steins-gate', 'character', 'mayuri-shiina', 'Mayuri holds the number 002 in the Future Gadget Laboratory, as Lab Member No. 002.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'itaru-hashida', 'Daru holds the number 003 in the Future Gadget Laboratory, as Lab Member No. 003.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'kurisu-makise', 'Kurisu holds the number 004 in the Future Gadget Laboratory, as Lab Member No. 004.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'moeka-kiryu', 'Moeka holds the number 005 in the Future Gadget Laboratory, as Lab Member No. 005.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'luka-urushibara', 'Luka holds the number 006 in the Future Gadget Laboratory, as Lab Member No. 006.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'faris-nyannyan', 'Faris holds the number 007 in the Future Gadget Laboratory, as Lab Member No. 007.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'suzuha-amane', 'Suzuha holds the number 008 in the Future Gadget Laboratory, as Lab Member No. 008.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'rintaro-okabe', 'Okabe plays up a mad scientist persona called Hououin Kyouma, though he is a kind and loyal friend underneath.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'rintaro-okabe', 'Mayuri and Daru call Okabe by the nickname Okarin.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'kurisu-makise', 'Kurisu is so talented that she skipped a grade, and her research was published in the journal Science.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'mayuri-shiina', 'Mayuri has a sing-song way of speaking and sings tutturu when she arrives.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'mayuri-shiina', 'Mayuri lost her grandmother several years before the story, in circumstances that are not known.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'moeka-kiryu', 'Moeka becomes upset when somebody tries to take her mobile phone from her.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'faris-nyannyan', 'Faris comes from a family that owns Akihabara and helped it become the city of moe.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'suzuha-amane', 'It is later found out that Suzuha is the time traveler known as John Titor.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'suzuha-amane', 'Suzuha is the daughter of Itaru Hashida, who is Daru.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'yugo-tennouji', 'Yugo Tennouji, the landlord of Okabe, is also known as Mr. Braun.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'doctor-nakabachi', 'Doctor Nakabachi is the father of Kurisu Makise, and his urge to outdo her in science becomes a driving force of the story.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'maho-hiyajo', 'Maho has the hard drive of Kurisu and hopes that her theories can save her.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_0', 'published'), ('steins-gate', 'character', 'rintaro-okabe', 'In the Japanese cast of the Steins;Gate anime, Rintaro Okabe is voiced by Mamoru Miyano.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steins;Gate_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'The Japanese title is written ソードアート・オンライン in katakana, read Sōdo Āto Onrain.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'Reki Kawahara writes the Sword Art Online novels and abec draws their illustrations.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'The light novels began in print on April 10, 2009, under the Dengeki Bunko imprint of ASCII Media Works.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'As of April 10, 2026, the main light novel series stands at 29 volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'Before it was a printed series, Kawahara shared the story online as a web novel under the pen name Fumio Kunori.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'Kawahara''s later work Accel World won the Grand Prize of the Dengeki competition, which led the publisher to ask him to publish Sword Art Online as well.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'Players of a full-dive virtual reality game discover they cannot log out, and the only way home is to clear the game.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'The NerveGear is a helmet that feeds the five senses to the brain, so players can control their game characters with their minds.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'On the first day, 10,000 players enter the game and find they cannot log out.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'To go free, the players have to beat all 100 floors of the floating castle Aincrad.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'The rule of the game is that a player who dies in it, or who has the NerveGear forcibly removed, dies in real life too.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'After the game is cleared, 300 players, Asuna among them, are still stuck inside their NerveGear.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'Agil tells Kirito that a figure like Asuna was spotted on the World Tree of the game Alfheim Online.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'In Gun Gale Online, Kirito looks into a string of murders and takes part in a gunfight tournament named Bullet of Bullets.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'The Soul Translator lets Kirito enter the Underworld, where the clock runs a thousand times faster than outside.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'A-1 Pictures is the studio behind the Sword Art Online anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'Tomohiko Itō directed the first two seasons of the anime, and Manabu Ono directed the Alicization seasons.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'Yuki Kajiura composed the music of the Sword Art Online anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'The Sword Art Online anime premiered in July 2012.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'Counting every arc, the television anime reaches 96 episodes, plus specials.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'The film Sword Art Online: Ordinal Scale, directed by Tomohiko Itō at A-1 Pictures, opened in Japan on February 18, 2017.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'Sword Art Online Progressive: Aria of a Starless Night, the first Progressive film, opened in Japan on October 30, 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'Sword Art Online: Infinity Moment was the first console game of the series, made for the PlayStation Portable.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'Sword Art Online: Hollow Fragment, for the PlayStation Vita, was the first game of the series released outside Japan.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'series', 'sword-art-online', 'Skydance Television bought the worldwide rights to make a live-action television version of the series.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'arc', '1', 'Aincrad, the first arc, is 14 episodes long and aired from July to October 2012.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'arc', '2', 'Fairy Dance has 11 episodes and aired from October to December 2012.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'arc', '3', 'Phantom Bullet is 14 episodes long and aired from July to October 2014.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'arc', '4', 'Calibur is the shortest arc, only 3 episodes, shown in October and November 2014.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'arc', '5', 'Mother''s Rosario has 7 episodes and closes the second season in November and December 2014.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'arc', '6', 'Alicization aired from October 2018 to March 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'arc', '7', 'War of Underworld aired in two parts, in late 2019 and again in the summer of 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'op-1', 'The first opening of the anime is Crossing Field, sung by LiSA.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'op-2', 'Fairy Dance opens with Innocence, performed by Eir Aoi.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'op-3', 'The second season begins with the opening Ignite, performed by Eir Aoi.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'op-4', 'The later part of the second season opens with Courage, by Haruka Tomatsu.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'op-5', 'Adamas, by LiSA, opens the first half of Alicization.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'op-6', 'Resister, by ASCA, opens the second half of Alicization.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'op-7', 'War of Underworld starts with the opening Resolution, performed by Haruka Tomatsu.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'op-8', 'Anima, by Reona, opens the later episodes of War of Underworld.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'ed-1', 'The first ending of the anime is Yume Sekai, sung by Haruka Tomatsu.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'ed-2', 'Fairy Dance closes with Overfly, performed by Luna Haruna.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'ed-3', 'The second season first ends with Startear, performed by Luna Haruna.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'ed-4', 'No More Time Machine, by LiSA, closes the Calibur episodes.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'ed-5', 'Shirushi, by LiSA, ends the episodes of Mother''s Rosario.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'ed-6', 'Iris, performed by Eir Aoi, ends the first episodes of Alicization.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'ed-7', 'Forget-me-not, by Reona, ends a long stretch of Alicization.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'ed-8', 'Unlasting, by LiSA, ends the last Alicization episodes and also the first War of Underworld ones.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'theme', 'ed-9', 'I will..., performed by Eir Aoi, closes the later episodes of War of Underworld.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword_Art_Online_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'kirito', 'Kirito, real name Kazuto Kirigaya, is written 桐ヶ谷 和人 in Japanese and is the main character.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'asuna', 'Asuna, real name Asuna Yuuki, is written 結城 明日奈 in Japanese and is the main heroine.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'klein', 'Klein, real name Ryōtarō Tsuboi, is written 壷井 遼太郎 in Japanese and is a katana user.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'agil', 'Agil, real name Andrew Gilbert Mills, is written アンドリュー・ギルバート・ミルズ in Japanese and fights with an axe.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'akihiko-kayaba', 'Akihiko Kayaba is the designer of the game and of the NerveGear.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'yui', 'Yui is written ユイ in Japanese and is an AI companion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'lisbeth', 'Lisbeth, real name Rika Shinozaki, is written 篠崎 里香 in Japanese and works as a blacksmith.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'silica', 'Silica, real name Keiko Ayano, is written 綾野 珪子 in Japanese and is a beast tamer.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'sachi', 'Sachi is written サチ in Japanese and belongs to the guild Moonlit Black Cats.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'diavel', 'Diavel is written ディアベル in Japanese and leads the raid on the first floor boss.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'kibaou', 'Kibaou is written キバオウ in Japanese and leads the Aincrad Liberation Squad.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'argo', 'Argo is written アルゴ in Japanese and is an information broker.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'sasha', 'Sasha is a caretaker of younger players in the Town of Beginnings.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'leafa', 'Leafa, real name Suguha Kirigaya, is written 桐ヶ谷 直葉 in Japanese and is Kirito''s cousin.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'sinon', 'Sinon, real name Shino Asada, is written 朝田 詩乃 in Japanese and is a sniper in Gun Gale Online.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'death-gun', 'Death Gun is the dangerous player in Gun Gale Online who is hunted by Kirito and Sinon.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'yuuki-konno', 'Yuuki Konno is written 紺野 木綿季 in Japanese and leads a guild of players.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'eugeo', 'Eugeo is written ユージオ in Japanese and is the companion of Kirito in the Underworld.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'alice-zuberg', 'Alice Zuberg is written アリス・ツーベルク in Japanese and is an Integrity Knight.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'bercouli', 'Bercouli is the very first Integrity Knight and founded Rulid Village.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'kirito', 'Kirito is called the Black Swordsman, because he likes to dress in black.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'kirito', 'Kirito gets ready for his famous Dual Blades style by taking over the katana of Leafa.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'asuna', 'Asuna fights with a rapier and goes by the nickname The Flash in the game.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'yui', 'Yui is officially named MHCP version 1, short for Mental Health Counselling Program.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'klein', 'Klein becomes the head of his own guild, Fuurinkazan.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'agil', 'Agil is an axe fighter who also works as a blacksmith and shopkeeper.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'lisbeth', 'Lisbeth is proud of her work as a blacksmith who forges custom swords.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'silica', 'Silica travels with a small dragon named Pina, her tamed companion.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'sachi', 'Sachi is a member of Moonlit Black Cats, the first guild Kirito joined, and her guild is trapped in a room on the 27th floor.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'diavel', 'Diavel leads the raid party that goes after the boss of the first floor.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'kibaou', 'Kibaou heads a group called the Aincrad Liberation Squad.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'argo', 'Argo makes her living as an information broker.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'sinon', 'Sinon shoots with a sniper rifle called the PGM Ultima Ratio Hecate II.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'sinon', 'In the real world Sinon has panic attacks at the sight of a gun.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'leafa', 'Leafa has practiced kendo for eight years.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'yuuki-konno', 'Because nobody has ever beaten her in a duel, Yuuki holds the title Absolute Sword.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'eugeo', 'Eugeo carries the Blue Rose Sword.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'alice-zuberg', 'Alice is an Integrity Knight with the designation Alice Synthesis Thirty.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'bercouli', 'Bercouli is remembered as the very first of the Integrity Knights.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'death-gun', 'Death Gun''s weapon makes the old trauma of Sinon come back.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'akihiko-kayaba', 'Akihiko Kayaba created both the game Sword Art Online and the NerveGear that runs it.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'sasha', 'Sasha takes care of the youngest players in the Town of Beginnings on the first floor.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('sword-art-online', 'character', 'kirito', 'Kirito is voiced in Japanese by Yoshitsugu Matsuoka.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Sword_Art_Online_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime is the English title of 転生したらスライムだった件, read Tensei Shitara Suraimu Datta Ken, which fans shorten to TenSura.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Fuse wrote the story of the series, first as a web novel and then as light novels.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Fuse posted the story online on Shōsetsuka ni Narō from February 20, 2013, to January 1, 2016.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Micro Magazine printed the first light novel under its GC Novels label on May 30, 2014.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The light novels run to 23 main volumes, plus two extra ones.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Mitz Vah illustrates the light novels, and the official anime site credits the original characters to this artist.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Taiki Kawakami launched the main manga in Monthly Shōnen Sirius on March 26, 2015.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'As of October 2026, the main manga has 33 volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Spin-off manga include The Ways of the Monster Nation by Shō Okagiri, The Slime Diaries by Shiba and Trinity in Tempest by Tae Tono.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The first season ran 24 episodes from October 2018 to March 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The second season came in two parts of 12 episodes, in January to March 2021 and in July to September 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The third season aired 24 episodes between April and September 2024 on Nippon TV and its affiliates.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The fourth season is planned as five cours, and the first two aired from April to September 2026, with 24 episodes so far.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'As of October 25, 2026, the third cour of the fourth season is scheduled for July 2027.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Eight Bit animates the TV anime, the films and the spin-offs.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Naokatsu Tsuda directs the fourth season of the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Yasuhito Kikuchi directed the first season, and Atsushi Nakayama directed the second and third seasons.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Kazuyuki Fudeyasu handled the series composition of seasons one and two, Toshizo Nemoto season three and Hitomi Ogawa season four.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The first film, Scarlet Bond, premiered in Japan on November 25, 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The second film, Tears of the Azure Sea, premiered on February 27, 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Visions of Coleus is a short net animation spin-off, also made by Eight Bit, and it uses the same staff as the second season.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Satoru Mikami, a salaryman, is stabbed to death in Tokyo and reborn in a fantasy world as a slime called Rimuru Tempest.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Before his death, Satoru Mikami is a 37-year-old office worker living in Tokyo.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Rimuru gains the skill Predator, which lets him devour anything and copy its looks and abilities, together with the skill Great Sage.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Veldora, the Storm Dragon, has been sealed in a cave for 300 years when Rimuru finds him.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The slime gets the name Rimuru from Veldora and gives the dragon the family name Tempest in return.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Rimuru beats the Orc Lord Disaster Geld, which leads to the founding of the Jura Tempest Federation.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Rimuru meets the survivors of a ruined ogre village and names them Benimaru, Shuna, Shion, Souei and Kurobe.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Benimaru leads six ogre survivors when he first meets Rimuru.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'To keep the last wish of Shizue, Rimuru travels to Ingracia to teach five Otherworlder students.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Rimuru destroys the 20,000 strong army of Falmuth with the spell Megiddo and becomes a demon lord.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'After Clayman is beaten, the Ten Great Demon Lords are restructured as the Octagram.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'In season three Rimuru opens a Labyrinth of 100 floors, managed by Veldora and Ramiris.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The second duel between Rimuru and Hinata ends when the True Demon Lord Luminous Valentine steps in, leading to a peace treaty.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'Yuuki turns on Maribel, the granddaughter of Granville, and kills her, then claims the Demon Lords did it.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The True Hero Chronoa is the personification of the rage and grief of Chloe, who traveled countless times to the past.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The first season fills episodes 1 to 24 and the second season, in two parts, episodes 25 to 48.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_episodes', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The third season fills episodes 49 to 72, and the first two cours of the fourth fill episodes 73 to 96.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_episodes', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The eight openings of the TV anime go from Nameless Story by Takuma Terashima to Tactic by Daoko.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'series', 'that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'The eight endings start with Another Colony by TRUE and finish, for now, with Hymnal by Azusa Tadokoro.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'rimuru-tempest', 'Rimuru Tempest is the slime form of Satoru Mikami and is technically genderless, though usually taken as male.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'veldora-tempest', 'Veldora Tempest is the Storm Dragon, one of four original True Dragons and a Catastrophe-level threat.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'gobta', 'Gobta is a hobgoblin who heads the goblin riders and has real talent with the sword.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'ranga', 'Ranga is the dire wolf who first meets Rimuru while raiding the goblin village.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'benimaru', 'Benimaru is an ogre prince, and after being named he evolves into a kijin, a rare ogre that looks more human.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'shion', 'Shion is one of the six ogre survivors and becomes Rimuru''s self-appointed secretary.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'shuna', 'Shuna, the sister of Benimaru, is skilled at sewing clothes and teaches goblins her craft.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'souei', 'Souei is a friend of Benimaru and one of the six ogre survivors.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'kurobe', 'Kurobe is the ogre blacksmith, and he forges most of Tempest''s tools with Kaijin.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'geld', 'Geld is an orc, the Orc Lord''s son and one of his bodyguards, who bears no grudge against Rimuru.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'gabil', 'Gabil is the lizardman chieftain''s son who is pushed by Laplace to fight the Orc Lord.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'milim-nava', 'Milim Nava is the daughter of the True Dragon Veldanava, which makes her the niece of Veldora.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'ramiris', 'Ramiris is among the oldest True Demon Lords and reincarnates whenever she dies.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'shizue-izawa', 'Shizue Izawa, nicknamed Shizu, was summoned during the bombing of Tokyo.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'hinata-sakaguchi', 'Hinata Sakaguchi is a former student of Shizu who works as a knight for the Western Holy Empire.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'diablo', 'Diablo is one of seven Primordial Demons, known as Noir, and he is Rimuru''s strongest subordinate.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'clayman', 'Clayman is a deathman Demon Lord known as the Marionette Master who leads the Moderate Harlequin Alliance.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'luminous-valentine', 'Luminous Twilight Valentine is a vampire and one of the oldest True Demon Lords, with the epithet Queen of Nightmares.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'masayuki', 'Masayuki Rudra Nam Ul Nasca is an Otherworlder emperor of the Eastern Empire, also known as the hero Lightspeed Masayuki.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'yuuki-kagurazaka', 'Yuuki Kagurazaka is an Otherworlder who runs the Freedom Academy as its grandmaster.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'rimuru-tempest', 'Rimuru is voiced by Miho Okasaki in Japanese and by Brittney Karbowski in English.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'rimuru-tempest', 'Rimuru learns that becoming a demon lord lets him bring back his fallen friends, and so he evolves into a true demon lord.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'veldora-tempest', 'Veldora is voiced by Tomoaki Maeno in Japanese and by Chris Rager in English.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'gobta', 'Gobta commands the goblin riders and, despite his goofy looks, can bring down a huge monster with his sword.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'ranga', 'After he is named, Ranga evolves into a Tempest Star Wolf using his skill Death Storm.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'benimaru', 'Benimaru, an ogre prince, attacks Rimuru by mistake while hunting those who destroyed his village.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'shion', 'Shion is a poor cook who loves to hug Rimuru and competes with Shuna for his attention.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'shion', 'Shion dies during the surprise attack on Tempest, which pushes Rimuru toward becoming a demon lord.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'shuna', 'Rimuru gave Shuna the title Holy Princess.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'souei', 'After the Orc Lord fell, Rimuru gave Souei the title Spy.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'kurobe', 'Kurobe has the title Blacksmith, which Rimuru gave him.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'geld', 'Geld evolves into a High Orc and commands the army of Tempest.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'gabil', 'Gabil is entrusted with his father''s Vortex Spear before he becomes a winged dragonewt.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'milim-nava', 'Milim is called the Destroyer, a Catastrophe-level Demon Lord whose power is destruction itself.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'milim-nava', 'Rimuru tames Milim with food and friendship when she arrives in Tempest seeking excitement.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'ramiris', 'Ramiris, the Labyrinth Master, controls a hidden dimension and later runs her labyrinth as an attraction.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'shizue-izawa', 'Shizue is called the Conqueror of Flames after the fire spirit Ifrit is bound to her.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'hinata-sakaguchi', 'Hinata ambushes Rimuru on his way back from Ingracia, believing that he killed Shizu.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'diablo', 'Diablo is one of the Primordial Demons called Noir and swears loyalty to Rimuru after being summoned.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'clayman', 'Clayman is called the Marionette Master because he manipulates others from behind the scenes.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'luminous-valentine', 'Luminous hides as a maid while ruling the Western Holy Empire in secret, until Veldora exposes her at Walpurgis.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_characters', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'masayuki', 'Rimuru befriends the Chosen Hero Masayuki when he opens the Labyrinth.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime', 'character', 'yuuki-kagurazaka', 'Yuuki is the guild creator of the Western nations and the grandmaster of the Freedom Academy.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/That_Time_I_Got_Reincarnated_as_a_Slime_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'The Japanese title is written 東京喰種, with the reading Tōkyō Gūru shown in katakana beside the kanji.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'Sui Ishida is the one creator behind Tokyo Ghoul, who both wrote and drew it.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'The first manga ran in Shueisha''s Weekly Young Jump, from September 2011 to September 2014.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'The original Tokyo Ghoul manga fills 14 volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'The sequel manga, Tokyo Ghoul:re, began in October 2014 and was gathered into 16 volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'Tokyo Ghoul:re takes place two years after the first story finishes.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'The first anime season has 12 episodes, aired in the summer of 2014 and was animated by Pierrot.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'Shuhei Morita directed the first season of the Tokyo Ghoul anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'Yutaka Yamada wrote the music for the Tokyo Ghoul anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'Chūji Mikasano wrote the scripts for the Tokyo Ghoul anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'The second season is called Tokyo Ghoul √A, read Root A. It has 12 episodes and began in January 2015.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'Root A does not follow the manga plot; it tells a story made for the anime.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'The first half of Tokyo Ghoul:re began in April 2018 and has 12 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'Tokyo Ghoul:re has 24 episodes in all, split into two cours of 12.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'The second half of Tokyo Ghoul:re followed in October 2018.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'A live-action Tokyo Ghoul film directed by Kentarō Hagiwara reached Japanese cinemas on July 29, 2017 and runs 120 minutes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul_(film)', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'In the 2017 film, Masataka Kubota plays Kaneki, Fumika Shimizu plays Touka and Yū Aoi plays Rize.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul_(film)', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'Tokyo Ghoul [Jack] is a prequel spin-off manga that first came out on the Jump Live service.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'Tokyo Ghoul: Days is a side story that looks at the daily lives of characters from the series.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'A Tokyo Ghoul video game called Call to Exist came out for PlayStation 4 and for Windows.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'After a date goes wrong, a college student wakes up as a half-ghoul, because organs from the ghoul who attacked him were transplanted into him.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'A coffee shop named Anteiku, run by ghouls, takes Kaneki in and teaches him how to live as a half-ghoul.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'The CCG, the Commission of Counter Ghoul, is the federal agency that handles crimes linked to ghouls.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'Aogiri Tree is a group of rogue ghouls that wants to take control of Tokyo''s ghoul wards away from the CCG.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'Funimation licensed the Tokyo Ghoul anime for North America.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'series', 'tokyo-ghoul', 'Viz Media publishes the Tokyo Ghoul manga in English in North America.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'theme', 'op-1', 'The opening of the first season is Unravel, performed by TK from Ling tosite Sigure.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'theme', 'ed-1', 'The ending of the first season is The Saints, by the band People in the Box.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'theme', 'op-2', 'Root A opens with Munou, a song by Österreich.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'theme', 'ed-2', 'The ending theme of the Root A season is a song by Amazarashi, titled Kisetsu wa Tsugitsugi Shinde Iku.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'theme', 'op-3', 'The first half of Tokyo Ghoul:re opens with Asphyxia, performed by Cö shu Nie.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'theme', 'ed-3', 'The first half of Tokyo Ghoul:re ends with Half, by the band Queen Bee.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'theme', 'op-4', 'The second half of Tokyo Ghoul:re opens with Katharsis, again by TK from Ling tosite Sigure.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'theme', 'ed-4', 'The closing song of the second half of Tokyo Ghoul:re is Rakuen no Kimi, by Österreich.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Ghoul', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'ken-kaneki', 'Ken Kaneki is written 金木 研 in Japanese and is the bookish student at the center of the story.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'touka-kirishima', 'Touka Kirishima is written 霧嶋 董香 in Japanese and works at the Anteiku cafe.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'rize-kamishiro', 'Rize Kamishiro is written 神代 利世 in Japanese and is the ghoul who attacks Kaneki on their date.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'hide-nagachika', 'Hide Nagachika, whose full name is Hideyoshi, is written 永近 英良 in Japanese and is Kaneki''s best friend.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'yoshimura', 'Yoshimura is written 芳村 in Japanese and is the manager of the Anteiku cafe.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'nishiki-nishio', 'Nishiki Nishio is written 西尾 錦 in Japanese and is a university student who is also a ghoul.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'hinami-fueguchi', 'Hinami Fueguchi is written 笛口 雛実 in Japanese and is a young ghoul living in the 20th ward.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'kotaro-amon', 'Kotaro Amon is written 亜門 鋼太朗 in Japanese and is a Special Class Investigator of the CCG.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'akira-mado', 'Akira Mado is written 真戸 暁 in Japanese and is an investigator of the CCG.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'shu-tsukiyama', 'Shu Tsukiyama is written 月山 習 in Japanese and is a fashionable ghoul.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'juzo-suzuya', 'Juzo Suzuya is written 鈴屋 什造 in Japanese and is a young investigator of the CCG.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'kisho-arima', 'Kisho Arima is written 有馬 貴将 in Japanese and is a Special Class Investigator of the CCG.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'ayato-kirishima', 'Ayato Kirishima is written 霧嶋 絢都 in Japanese; he is Touka''s younger brother and an executive of Aogiri Tree.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'renji-yomo', 'Renji Yomo is written 四方 蓮示 in Japanese and is a quiet ghoul connected to Anteiku.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'yamori', 'Yamori is written 大守 八雲 in Japanese and is an executive of Aogiri Tree.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'seido-takizawa', 'Seido Takizawa is written 滝澤 政道 in Japanese and is an investigator of the CCG.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'eto-yoshimura', 'Eto Yoshimura is written 芳村 愛支 in Japanese and leads Aogiri Tree.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'haise-sasaki', 'Haise Sasaki is written 佐々木 琲世 in Japanese and is a CCG investigator who leads the Quinx Squad.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'toru-mutsuki', 'Toru Mutsuki is written 六月 透 in Japanese and belongs to the Quinx Squad.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'nimura-furuta', 'Nimura Furuta is written 旧多 二福 in Japanese and is the main antagonist of Tokyo Ghoul:re.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'ken-kaneki', 'Kaneki''s hair turns white: slowly from chapter 61 in the manga, but all at once in the anime.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'ken-kaneki', 'By the end of the story Kaneki has taken the title of the One-Eyed King.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'rize-kamishiro', 'When steel beams fall on Rize, her organs are moved into Kaneki, which makes him a half-ghoul.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'touka-kirishima', 'Late in the story Touka marries Kaneki, and she is expecting his child.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'hide-nagachika', 'Hide senses that something is off about Kaneki, even though Kaneki tries to hide his ghoul side from him.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'hide-nagachika', 'In the later story Hide takes on a disguise known as the Scarecrow.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'yoshimura', 'Yoshimura quietly supplies food to ghouls who are unable to hunt for themselves.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'hinami-fueguchi', 'Hinami has a heightened sense of smell.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'kotaro-amon', 'Amon grew up as an orphan under the care of Donato Porpora, who turns out to be a cannibal ghoul.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'juzo-suzuya', 'Before the CCG took him in, Suzuya was brought up by a ghoul called Big Madam.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'kisho-arima', 'Arima is known inside the CCG as the Reaper.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'kisho-arima', 'In secret, Arima is the One-Eyed King and works alongside Eto.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'kisho-arima', 'Arima is the main character of the prequel manga Tokyo Ghoul [Jack].', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'eto-yoshimura', 'Eto also works as a novelist, writing under the name Sen Takatsuki.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'ayato-kirishima', 'Ayato goes by the alias Black Rabbit.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'yamori', 'Yamori got the nickname Jason because of his cruelty and the hockey mask he likes to wear.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'yamori', 'Yamori tortured Kaneki for ten days before Kaneki turned the tables.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'seido-takizawa', 'In Tokyo Ghoul:re, Takizawa returns as a one-eyed ghoul, after being experimented on.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'haise-sasaki', 'Haise Sasaki is the identity Kaneki is given after Arima defeats him and his memories are wiped.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'haise-sasaki', 'Haise mentors the Quinx Squad, a special unit made up of artificial ghouls.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'nimura-furuta', 'Furuta ends up killed by Kaneki inside the Dragon, a creature that Furuta himself created.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'shu-tsukiyama', 'Tsukiyama is known as the Gourmet.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-ghoul', 'character', 'ken-kaneki', 'Ken Kaneki is voiced in Japanese by Natsuki Hanae.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Ghoul_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The title is written 東京卍リベンジャーズ, with the manji symbol 卍 inside, and read Tōkyō Ribenjāzu.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'Ken Wakui wrote and drew the manga, and the official anime site credits him as the original creator.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The weekly manga started on March 1, 2017, and its last chapter appeared on November 16, 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The chapters were collected in 31 tankōbon volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The manga ran in Weekly Shōnen Magazine, a weekly of the publisher Kodansha.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The first anime season ran 24 episodes between April and September 2021 and covers the 8.3 Conflict and Bloody Halloween stories.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_episodes', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The second season, the Christmas Showdown Arc, ran 13 episodes from January to April 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_episodes', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The third season, the Tenjiku Arc, aired between October and December 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_episodes', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The fourth season, the War of the Three Titans Arc, premiered in October 2026 and is still airing as of October 25, 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_episodes', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'Liden Films produces the anime, from the first season to the fourth.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'Koichi Hatsumi directed the first three seasons of the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_episodes', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'For the fourth season Maki Kodaira took over as director, while Hatsumi moved to series composition with Mutō.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'Hiroaki Tsutsumi composes the music of the anime.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_episodes', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The first live-action film, directed by Tsutomu Hanabusa, opened in Japanese cinemas on July 9, 2021, after a delay from the planned date in October 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers_(film)', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The live-action sequel Bloody Halloween was released as two separate films, Destiny and Decisive Battle, in the same year.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers_(film)', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The chibi shorts ChibiReve, made by Studio Puyukai, were released free on YouTube during the first season.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'Shinpei Funatsu drew Tōdai Revengers, a parody spin-off manga published on Magazine Pocket.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'A Letter from Keisuke Baji, drawn by Yukinori Kawaguchi, is a spin-off manga centered on Keisuke Baji and Chifuyu Matsuno.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'A mini series called Dōwa Revengers retells fairy tales with the Tokyo Revengers cast, starting with Momotarō.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_episodes', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'Official releases outside Japan remove the Buddhist manji symbol of the gang or hide it behind rays of light.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'A 26-year-old part-timer named Takemichi learns that his ex-girlfriend Hinata has died, then jumps back twelve years to save her.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The story starts in 2017, when Takemichi is 26, and sends him back to 2005.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The Tokyo Manji Gang, shortened to Toman, wants a new golden era for the delinquents of the Kanto region.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The anime splits into five story arcs, from the 8.3 Conflict Arc in episodes 1 to 12 to the War of the Three Titans Arc that began at episode 51.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_episodes', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The Bloody Halloween battle between the Tokyo Manji Gang and Valhalla takes place on October 31, 2005.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'In the first timeline Draken dies after a stabbing on August 3, 2005, and the 8.3 Conflict arc is about stopping it.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_episodes', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'Mikey reveals that Shinichiro had really died, and that a homeless man with a stolen time-leap ability had changed events.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'Takemichi and Mikey leap together to 1998, rewrite history, and end up with a peaceful future.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'In the happy ending Takemichi and Hinata marry eleven years after the rewrite, surrounded by their friends and family.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'Cry Baby by Official Hige Dandism opens the first season, White Noise opens seasons two and three, and Ignite by JO1 opens season four.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'The endings are Koko de Iki o Shite by Eill, Tokyo Wonder by Nakimushi, Kizutsukedo, Aishiteru by Tuyu, Say My Name by Hey-Smith and Trick Star by go!go!vanillas.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'Cry Baby plays in all 24 episodes of the first season, while Koko de Iki o Shite is used for the first 12 and Tokyo Wonder for the rest.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_episodes', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'series', 'tokyo-revengers', 'Cry Baby by Official Hige Dandism won Video of the Year at the MTV Video Music Awards Japan.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'takemichi-hanagaki', 'Takemichi Hanagaki, a part-timer when the story starts, is the main protagonist of the series.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'manjiro-sano', 'Manjiro Sano leads the Tokyo Manji Gang, known as Toman, and goes by the nickname Mikey.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'ken-ryuguji', 'Ken Ryuguji is Mikey''s second-in-command and best friend, and goes by Draken.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'hinata-tachibana', 'Hinata Tachibana is the middle school girlfriend that Takemichi wants to save.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'naoto-tachibana', 'Naoto Tachibana is Hinata''s younger brother, and he becomes a police officer in the new present.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'tetta-kisaki', 'Tetta Kisaki starts as an outsider but schemes his way up to become a captain in the gang.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'keisuke-baji', 'Keisuke Baji is a founding member and loyal captain, who is also the focus of a spin-off letter series.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'takashi-mitsuya', 'Takashi Mitsuya commands the second division, and Takemichi joins the gang under him.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'haruki-hayashida', 'Haruki Hayashida, nicknamed Pah-chin, leads the third division until he turns himself in to the police.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'masataka-kiyomizu', 'Masataka Kiyomizu is nicknamed Kiyomasa and is the bully who first treats Takemichi like a servant.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'chifuyu-matsuno', 'Chifuyu Matsuno serves as vice-captain of the first division, under Baji.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'kazutora-hanemiya', 'Kazutora Hanemiya is one of the Tokyo Manji Gang''s founding members.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'hakkai-shiba', 'Hakkai Shiba is the vice-captain of the second division, and Taiju and Yuzuha are his siblings.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'taiju-shiba', 'Taiju Shiba leads the Black Dragons in their tenth generation.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'yuzuha-shiba', 'Yuzuha Shiba is the sister of Taiju and Hakkai.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'izana-kurokawa', 'Izana Kurokawa heads the Yokohama team Tenjiku and was adopted into the Sano family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'kakucho', 'Kakucho is one of the Four Heavenly Kings of Tenjiku and once was a childhood friend of Takemichi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'shuji-hanma', 'Shuji Hanma is a tattooed fighter who collaborates with Kisaki.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'emma-sano', 'Emma Sano is the younger half sister of Mikey.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'haruchiyo-sanzu', 'Haruchiyo Sanzu is a masked vice-captain of the fifth division.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'takemichi-hanagaki', 'Takemichi starts out as a 26-year-old part-timer whose life is gloomy.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'takemichi-hanagaki', 'Takemichi can leap exactly twelve years back, to the same day, and a handshake with Naoto triggers the jump.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_episodes', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'takemichi-hanagaki', 'Takemichi is voiced by Yuuki Shin in Japanese and by A.J. Beckles in the English dub.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'manjiro-sano', 'Mikey is voiced by Yū Hayashi in Japanese and by Aleks Le in the English dub.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'manjiro-sano', 'Mikey is the nickname of the gang leader Manjiro Sano, and he is also called the commander of Toman.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'manjiro-sano', 'In a possible future Mikey vanishes and leads the ruthless gang Bonten.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'ken-ryuguji', 'Ken Ryuguji is nicknamed Draken and is known for a mature, big-brother attitude.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'ken-ryuguji', 'Draken is voiced by Tatsuhisa Suzuki in the first season and by Sean Chiplock in the English dub.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'ken-ryuguji', 'Draken is stabbed by Kiyomasa, and he would have died in the first timeline if Takemichi had not saved him.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'ken-ryuguji', 'In 2008 Draken is killed while shielding Senju.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'hinata-tachibana', 'Hinata is Takemichi''s girlfriend from middle school, and her death drives his time travel.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'hinata-tachibana', 'Hinata is voiced by Azumi Waki in Japanese and by Lizzie Freeman in the English dub.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'naoto-tachibana', 'Naoto is alive and works as a police officer in the new present, where he explains Takemichi''s ability.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'tetta-kisaki', 'Kisaki uses Pah-chin''s arrest to become captain of the third division.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'tetta-kisaki', 'In his confession, Kisaki admits that ambition and a fixation on Hinata, not any grand cause, drove him.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'keisuke-baji', 'Baji seemed to defect to Valhalla, but he only joined to learn more about Kisaki.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'takashi-mitsuya', 'Takashi Mitsuya holds the post of second division captain.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'haruki-hayashida', 'Pah-chin captains the third division until he is arrested.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'masataka-kiyomizu', 'Kiyomasa organizes underground fights that force Takemichi''s friends to fight.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'shuji-hanma', 'Hanma has tattoos on both hands that read sin and punishment.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'chifuyu-matsuno', 'Chifuyu is the vice-captain of the first division, with Baji as his captain.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'kazutora-hanemiya', 'Kazutora killed Mikey''s brother Shinichiro while trying to steal a motorbike with Baji.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'hakkai-shiba', 'Hakkai is the second division''s vice-captain and the younger brother of Taiju and Yuzuha.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'taiju-shiba', 'Taiju leads the Black Dragons, and he abuses Hakkai and Yuzuha after their mother''s death.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'yuzuha-shiba', 'Yuzuha is a good fighter who defends Hakkai from Taiju.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'izana-kurokawa', 'Izana is the president of Tenjiku, a gang based in Yokohama.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'izana-kurokawa', 'Izana resents Mikey out of jealousy over the legacy of Shinichiro.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Revengers', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'kakucho', 'Kakucho is nicknamed The Brawler and has a large scar across his face.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'emma-sano', 'Kisaki murders Emma to break Mikey before the Tenjiku conflict.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tokyo-revengers', 'character', 'haruchiyo-sanzu', 'Sanzu is recognized by his long hair and a mask that never comes off.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tokyo_Revengers_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'In Korea the series is called 신의 탑, written Sin-ui Tap in Latin letters, and English readers know it as Tower of God.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'One creator, working under the pen name S.I.U., writes and draws the series; his real name is Lee Jong-hui.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'The webtoon began on the Naver Webtoon platform on June 30, 2010, and new chapters keep coming there.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'It was among the first webtoons to get an official English translation, released through Line Webtoon from July 2014.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'The anime adaptation was first revealed at Seoul Comic-Con in August 2019, and the show reached screens in April 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'Season one, made by Telecom Animation Film and directed by Takashi Sano, ran for 13 episodes in Japan between April 2 and June 24, 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God_season_1', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'Season two came from The Answer Studio and aired in two back-to-back cours, adding 26 episodes between July 7 and December 29, 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God_season_2', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'Takashi Sano directed season one; Akira Suzuki directed season two under chief director Kazuyoshi Takeuchi; Kevin Penkin wrote the music for both.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'Stray Kids performed both songs that frame season one.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God_season_1', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'Season two changed singers between its two cours: NiziU first, then Stray Kids again.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God_season_2', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'theme', 'op-1', 'Stray Kids sang the season one songs in Japanese, English and Korean, one version for each language dub.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God_season_1', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'The anime so far covers season one plus the two cours of season two, 39 episodes in all, and the webtoon runs further.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God_season_2', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'Shinsu, which means roughly Divine Water, is the substance that fills the Tower and gets stronger and denser on the higher floors.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'Climbers chosen from outside are Regulars, those who reach the top are Rankers, and the rare people who open the Tower''s doors themselves are Irregulars.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'twenty-fifth-bam', 'Bam''s full Korean name translates literally as Twenty-fifth Night.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'The creator lines up major events and characters long before they appear, in some cases more than eight years ahead.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'twenty-fifth-bam', 'Twenty-Fifth Bam is a main character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'rachel', 'Rachel is a main character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'khun-aguero-agnes', 'Khun Aguero Agnes is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'rak-wraithraiser', 'Rak Wraithraiser is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'headon', 'Headon is a character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'shibisu', 'Shibisu is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'hatz', 'Hatz is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'phonsekal-lauroe', 'Phonsekal Lauroe is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'anaak-jahad', 'Anaak Jahad is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'jahad', 'Jahad is an antagonist of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'endorsi-jahad', 'Endorsi Jahad is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'ha-yuri-jahad', 'Ha-Yuri Jahad is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'evan-edrok', 'Evan Edrok is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'ja-wangnan', 'Ja Wangnan is a main character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'hwa-ryun', 'Hwa Ryun is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'urek-mazino', 'Urek Mazino is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'ha-jinsung', 'Ha Jinsung is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'enryu', 'Enryu is a supporting character of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'white', 'White is an antagonist of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'phantaminum', 'Phantaminum is an antagonist of Tower of God.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'In the Tower, teams fight with 5 standard roles: fisherman, spear-bearer, light-bearer, scout and wave-controller.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'Every floor of the Tower splits into 3 parts: an outer living area, an inner testing area and a middle linking area.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'The top of the Tower is ruled by a council called the 10 Great Families, led by King Jahad.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'enryu', 'The Irregular Enryu once slew the administrator of floor 43, a deed nobody thought possible.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'character', 'rachel', 'Rachel is voiced in Japanese by Saori Hayami.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Tower_of_God_characters', 'published'), ('tower-of-god', 'series', 'tower-of-god', 'Tower of God comes from South Korea: it is a manhwa published as a webtoon, with S.I.U. as writer and artist.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_God', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Vinland Saga is written ヴィンランド・サガ in Japanese and read Vinrando Saga.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Makoto Yukimura writes and draws the manga, which Kodansha publishes; his name is 幸村誠 in Japanese.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'The manga began in Weekly Shōnen Magazine in April 2005, moved to Monthly Afternoon on December 24, 2005, and finished there on July 25, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'The story is collected in 29 volumes holding 220 chapters, and the last volume came out on September 22, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_chapters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Wit Studio animated the first season under director Shūhei Yabuta; its 24 episodes were shown on NHK General TV from July 8 to December 30, 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'MAPPA took over for the second season, which aired 24 more episodes, numbered 25 to 48 overall, from January 10 to June 20, 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_episodes', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Season one opened with Mukanjyo by Survive Said the Prophet and later Dark Crow by Man with a Mission, and closed with Torches by Aimer and later Drown by milet.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Season two used River by Anonymouz and then Paradox by Survive Said the Prophet as openings, with Without Love by LMYK and Ember by haju:harmonics as endings.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'The manga article divides the plot into four arcs: the War Arc, the Slave Arc, the Eastern Expedition Arc and the Vinland Arc.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Using the numbered chapter list, the War Arc fills chapters 1 to 54 (season one) and the Slave Arc chapters 55 to 100 (season two); the last two arcs are not animated yet.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_chapters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'In 2009 the Japan Media Arts Festival gave the manga its top honor, and Kodansha''s general-manga prize followed in 2012; circulation topped 7 million copies by August 2022.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Kodansha USA publishes the manga in English in two-in-one hardcovers, starting on October 14, 2013.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'thorfinn', 'The series dramatizes the expedition of the real Icelandic explorer Thorfinn Karlsefni, and the lead is a fictional counterpart of him.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'thors', 'Thors earned the epithet the Troll of Jom as a Jomsviking general, then quietly left war behind to live as a pacifist farmer.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'thorfinn', 'Thorfinn is a main character of Vinland Saga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'askeladd', 'Askeladd is a main character of Vinland Saga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'thors', 'Thors is a supporting character of Vinland Saga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'canute', 'Canute is a main character of Vinland Saga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'thorkell', 'Thorkell is a supporting character of Vinland Saga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'leif', 'Leif is a supporting character of Vinland Saga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'floki', 'Floki is an antagonist of Vinland Saga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'bjorn', 'Bjorn is a supporting character of Vinland Saga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'einar', 'Einar is a main character of Vinland Saga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'ketil', 'Ketil is a supporting character of Vinland Saga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'gudrid', 'Gudrid is a supporting character of Vinland Saga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'character', 'hild', 'Hild is a supporting character of Vinland Saga.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Vinland_Saga_characters', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Thorkell, Thorfinn''s great-uncle, seizes Prince Canute during the fighting.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Thorfinn later labours as a slave on a Danish farm that belongs to Ketil.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Thorfinn and Einar are freed and sail away with Leif Erikson, an old friend of Thors.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'In the War Arc, Askeladd and his men sign on as hired soldiers of King Sweyn for the attack on London by the Danes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Askeladd''s company then grabs Prince Canute, planning to sell him to whichever side pays.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Thorfinn becomes friends with Einar, a fellow slave, while working the farm.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Canute rules both England and Denmark after getting rid of his brother Harald.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Thorfinn tries to kill King Canute and ends up condemned to slavery after Thorkell stops him.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'In 2009 the manga won the Grand Prize of the 13th Japan Media Arts Festival.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'The 13th Japan Media Arts Festival is the one of the 2009 fiscal year.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Most of the opening story plays out in England in 1013 AD, a country that the Danish king Sweyn Forkbeard has largely taken over.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('vinland-saga', 'series', 'vinland-saga', 'Yukimura took material for the voyage and the period from medieval accounts such as the Flateyjarbók and the Saga of the Greenlanders.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinland_Saga_(manga)', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The Japanese title is written ヴァイオレット・エヴァーガーデン and read Vaioretto Evāgāden, which is just the heroine''s name spelled out in katakana.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'Kana Akatsuki wrote the light novels that the whole franchise grew out of.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'Akiko Takase illustrated the novels, and her designs carried over into the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The novels were put out by the animation studio itself, Kyoto Animation, under its own KA Esuma Bunko label.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The first light novel volume came out on December 25, 2015, years before the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The story of Violet Evergarden takes place in the land of Telesis, right after a four year war has ended.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'A former soldier takes a job at the CH Postal Company as an Auto Memory Doll, a ghostwriter who writes letters for clients who cannot find the words.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The TV series aired between January 11 and April 5, 2018, one episode a week for a single winter season.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The TV anime has 13 episodes, plus a separate extra episode released later.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'Kyoto Animation produced the series and the films, as well as publishing the novels.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'Taichi Ishidate directed the TV series and later the 2020 film.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'Evan Call wrote the music, and he composed the soundtrack album Automemories.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'Reiko Yoshida handled the series composition and the screenplay of the TV anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The characters in the anime were designed by Akiko Takase, the same artist who illustrated the books.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The opening theme of the TV series is Sincerely, sung by True.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The ending theme is Michishirube, which means guidepost, sung by Minori Chihara.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The two disc soundtrack album Automemories holds orchestral score and a handful of vocal tracks.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The OVA, counted as episode 14 and titled Surely, Someday, You Will Understand Love, came out on July 4, 2018, with the last home video volume.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'Netflix streamed the series worldwide as it aired, with the United States and Australia following later.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The side story film Eternity and the Auto Memory Doll reached Japanese cinemas on September 6, 2019, and runs 90 minutes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden:_Eternity_and_the_Auto_Memory_Doll', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'In the side story film Violet is sent to a prestigious girls boarding school to tutor Isabella York.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden:_Eternity_and_the_Auto_Memory_Doll', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The sequel, Violet Evergarden: The Movie, premiered in Japan on September 18, 2020, after being delayed twice.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden:_The_Movie', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The 2020 film runs 140 minutes, far longer than a TV episode.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden:_The_Movie', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The 2020 film uses a wide 2.31:1 picture instead of the 16:9 format of the TV series.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden:_The_Movie', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The director hesitated to make the film because he felt the TV ending told his whole story, until the script showed him Gilbert could live.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden:_The_Movie', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'The light novel won the grand prize of the fifth Kyoto Animation Award in its novel category in 2014.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'series', 'violet-evergarden', 'At the 2018 IGN Awards the TV anime won Best Animation, and it also won that category at the 2019 Crunchyroll Anime Awards.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'violet-evergarden', 'Violet Evergarden is the title character, an Auto Memory Doll who is learning what the words I love you mean.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'violet-evergarden', 'Violet works as an Auto Memory Doll, a ghostwriter for clients who cannot put their feelings into letters.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'violet-evergarden', 'Violet was raised as a soldier and lost both arms in the war, so she works with prosthetic hands.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'violet-evergarden', 'Yui Ishikawa voices Violet in Japanese, and Erika Harlacher does so in English.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'claudia-hodgins', 'Claudia Hodgins is the man in charge of the CH Postal Company, the firm that employs Violet and the other Dolls.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'claudia-hodgins', 'Claudia is a former lieutenant colonel who was a close friend of Gilbert in the army.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'claudia-hodgins', 'Takehito Koyasu voices Claudia Hodgins in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'cattleya-baudelaire', 'Cattleya Baudelaire is an Auto Memory Doll at the CH Postal Company and its most popular one.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'cattleya-baudelaire', 'Cattleya has known Claudia since before the CH Postal Company existed.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'cattleya-baudelaire', 'Aya Endō voices Cattleya in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'benedict-blue', 'Benedict Blue is the eccentric postman of the CH Postal Company who delivers the letters.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'benedict-blue', 'Benedict also knew Claudia long before the company was set up, together with Cattleya.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'benedict-blue', 'Koki Uchiyama voices Benedict Blue in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'erica-brown', 'Erica Brown is an Auto Memory Doll who is weak with clients but never loses faith in the job.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'erica-brown', 'Minori Chihara voices Erica, and she is also the singer of the ending theme Michishirube.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'iris-cannary', 'Iris Cannary is a Doll who joined the CH Postal Company soon after Erica, and she admires working women.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'iris-cannary', 'Iris comes from a small farming village called Kazaly.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'iris-cannary', 'Haruka Tomatsu voices Iris in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'gilbert-bougainvillea', 'Gilbert Bougainvillea is a major from an aristocratic family, and the man who named Violet.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'gilbert-bougainvillea', 'The only keepsake of Gilbert that Violet owns is an emerald brooch that reminds her of his eyes.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'gilbert-bougainvillea', 'Gilbert treasured Violet above all else but never told her, because they were both soldiers.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'gilbert-bougainvillea', 'Daisuke Namikawa voices Gilbert in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'gilbert-bougainvillea', 'At the end of the film Claudia finds Gilbert alive on an island, missing his right eye and arm.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden:_The_Movie', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'dietfried-bougainvillea', 'Dietfried Bougainvillea is a navy captain and Gilbert''s older brother, who sees Violet only as a tool.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'dietfried-bougainvillea', 'Hidenobu Kiuchi voices Dietfried in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'luculia-marlborough', 'Luculia Marlborough is a Doll who befriended Violet in training school.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'luculia-marlborough', 'Azusa Tadokoro voices Luculia in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'charlotte-drossel', 'Charlotte Abelfreyja Drossel is a young princess promised in marriage to a prince as a step toward peace.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'charlotte-drossel', 'Megumi Nakajima voices Princess Charlotte in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'leon-stephanotis', 'Leon Stephanotis works under the Shahar Observatory and is paired with Violet on a joint operation.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'leon-stephanotis', 'Yūto Uemura voices Leon Stephanotis in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'oscar-webster', 'Oscar Webster is a famous playwright who has withdrawn from the world since losing his family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'oscar-webster', 'Satoshi Taki voices Oscar Webster in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'anne-magnolia', 'Anne Magnolia is a girl who loves dolls and first mistakes Violet for a life-size one.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'anne-magnolia', 'Sumire Morohoshi voices Anne in Japanese.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'clara-magnolia', 'Clara Magnolia is Anne''s mother, who asks Violet for a set of letters for her daughter to read later.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'clara-magnolia', 'Clara is terminally ill and fears that her daughter will be left alone.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'isabella-york', 'Isabella York is a student whom Violet helps to enter high society.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'isabella-york', 'Isabella grew up in poverty under the name Amy Bartlett, as the illegitimate child of the York family.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden:_Eternity_and_the_Auto_Memory_Doll', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'taylor-bartlett', 'Taylor Bartlett is the girl whom Amy took in as a younger sister.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden', 'published'), ('violet-evergarden', 'character', 'taylor-bartlett', 'Years later the Evergarden family takes Taylor in as their own child.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Violet_Evergarden:_Eternity_and_the_Auto_Memory_Doll', 'published');
insert into public.trivia (entity_kind, entity_id, group_id, fact, category, source, source_url, lang, status, site_id) select v.entity_kind, v.entity_id, g.id, v.fact, v.category, v.source, v.source_url, 'en', v.status, 'anime' from _k1_trivia v join public.groups g on g.slug = v.group_slug and g.site_id = 'anime' where not exists (select 1 from public.trivia t where t.entity_kind = v.entity_kind and t.entity_id = v.entity_id and md5(btrim(lower(t.fact))) = md5(btrim(lower(v.fact))));
